{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"I`m Luffy! The Man Who`s Gonna Be King of the Pirates!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"1999-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Alvida pirates plunder a ship only to find a barrel containing a strange boy names Luffy who is on a quest to find the legendary One Piece and become the King of Pirates.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361887/screencap/604df7d3ecf3a.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"俺はルフィ! 海賊王になる男だ!\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Great Swordsman! Pirate Hunter Roronoa Zoro!\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"1999-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his new companion Coby set sail in search of the infamous pirate hunter Zoro, rumored to be held captive at the Marine Base.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361888/screencap/604df7f785903.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大剣豪現る! 海賊狩りロロノア・ゾロ\"},{\"title\":\"Morgan vs. Luffy! Who`s the Mysterious Pretty Girl?\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"1999-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is in the line of fire after saving Zoro, and now tyrannical Captain Morgan is out for their heads! Zoro must decide if he will join forces with Luffy or die in captivity.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361889/screencap/604df8b796ccd.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"モーガンVSルフィ! 謎の美少女は誰?\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Past! Enter Red-Haired Shanks!\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"1999-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy recalls a time when Captain Red-Haired Shanks taught him a valuable lesson in friendship and set him on his quest to be King of the Pirates.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361890/screencap/604df8f7a790c.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィの過去! 赤髪のシャンクス登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Terrifying Mysterious Power! Captain Buggy, the Clown Pirate!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"1999-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy crosses paths with the clever thief Nami. A navigator on a quest to collect one hundred million berries, she’s perfect for Luffy’s new crew – except for the fact that Nami hates pirates.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361891/screencap/604df915cd549.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖 謎の力! 海賊道化バギー船長!\"},{\"title\":\"Desperate Situation! Beast Tamer Mohji vs. Luffy!\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"1999-12-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having delivered a deadly blow to Captain Buggy’s pirates, Luffy and his companions need a place to recuperate. But the three are not in hiding very long before the Beast Tamer Mohji seeks them out.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361894/screencap/604dfa115b207.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命! 猛獣使いモージ VS ルフィ!\"},{\"title\":\"Epic Showdown! Swordsman Zoro vs. Acrobat Cabaji!\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"1999-12-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the ongoing fight with Captain Buggy's pirates, Zoro must face off with the Acrobat Cabaji while Luffy continues to do battle with the Pirate Clown himself.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361895/screencap/604dfa349236e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"壮絶決闘! 剣豪ゾロ VS 曲芸のカバジ!\"},{\"title\":\"Who Is the Victor? Devil Fruit Power Showdown!\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"1999-12-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the gang are on the run after the battle with Captain Buggy! With no place to go and nothing else to do, Nami finally agrees to join Luffy on his quest.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/361896/screencap/604dfa5033a48.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勝者はどっち? 悪魔の実の能力対決!\"},{\"title\":\"The Honorable Liar? Captain Usopp!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaya rewards the Straw Hat Pirates' efforts to save her with a ship to call their own - the Going Merry!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361906.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"正義のうそつき? キャプテンウソップ\"},{\"title\":\"The Weirdest Guy Ever! Jango the Hypnotist!\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On the legendary Treasure Island, Luffy and crew encounter strange animals and an even stranger man named Gaimon.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361907.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"史上最強の変な奴! 催眠術師ジャンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Expose the Plot! Pirate Butler, Captain Kuro!\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the past, young Zoro sparred constantly with a girl named Kuina, but he could never claim victory. They vowed that one of them would someday be the world's greatest swordsman - but tragedy intervened.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361908.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"陰謀を暴け! 海賊執事キャプテンクロ\"},{\"title\":\"Clash with the Black Cat Pirates! The Great Battle on the Slope!\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2000-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats need a cook among their crew, so they head to a nearby restaurant and meet a passionate Sous Chef named Sanji.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361909.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! クロネコ海賊団坂道の大攻防!\"},{\"title\":\"The Terrifying Duo! Meowban Brothers vs. Zoro!\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2000-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy witnesses the fighting prowess and compassionate nature of the Sous Chef Sanji. The good news: The Going Merry's found a cook! The bad news: He has no intention of joining the crew!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361910.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖の二人組! ニャーバン兄弟[ブラザーズ]VSゾロ\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Back in Action! Miss Kaya`s Desperate Resistance!\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2000-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The staff and patrons of the Baratie panic when Don Krieg arrives! The starving pirate begs for nourishment, only to find himself denied. Unable to see a wretch starve, Sanji steps in once again.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361911.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ復活! カヤお嬢様の決死の抵抗\"},{\"title\":\"Beat Kuro! Usopp the Man`s Tearful Resolve!\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Don Krieg promises further malice as he returns to his ship, but the threat to the Baratie proves short-lived as an even bigger threat arrives!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361912.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"クロを倒せ! 男ウソップ涙の決意!\"},{\"title\":\"Protect Kaya! The Usopp Pirates` Great Efforts!\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Going Merry's been stolen by Nami, and the showdown for possession of the Baratie is delayed. But the action's not dead in the water - Zoro challenges Hawk-Eye Mihawk to a duel!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361913.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カヤを守れ! ウソップ海賊団大活躍!\"},{\"title\":\"Anger Explosion! Kuro vs. Luffy! How It Ends!\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle begins for possession of the Baratie, with Zeff leading the cooks against Krieg's pirates. Luffy and crew join the fray, but things aren't looking too good!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361914.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"怒り爆発! クロVSルフィ決着の行方!\"},{\"title\":\"You`re the Weird Creature! Gaimon and His Strange Friends!\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji recalls his childhood as an apprentice chef aboard a ship attacked by Red Foot Zeff! When the young Sanji found himself overboard, it was the fearsome captain himself who jumped to the rescue.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361915.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"あんたが珍獣! ガイモンと奇妙な仲間\"},{\"title\":\"The Three-Sword Style`s Past! Zoro and Kuina`s Vow!\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the battle for Baratie rages on, Luffy is forced to take a drastic course of action and Ghin debates where his loyalties lie.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361916.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"三刀流の過去! ゾロとくいなの誓い!\"},{\"title\":\"Famous Cook! Sanji of the Sea Restaurant!\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The scoundrel Don Krieg appears to have the upper hand in his fight with Luffy. To avoid walking the plank, the rubber man must try a different strategy.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361917.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"名物コック! 海上レストランのサンジ\"},{\"title\":\"Unwelcome Customer! Sanji`s Food and Ghin`s Debt!\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The standoff between Luffy and Don Krieg takes a turn in favor of the Straw Hats when their captain focuses his onslaught on his opponent's weaponry.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361918.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"招かれざる客! サンジの飯とギンの恩\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Pirate Fleet! Commodore Don Krieg!\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Don Krieg defeated, Luffy tries to convince Sanji to join up with the Straw Hats. The skilled cook is interested, but he has something to prove before moving on.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81797/361919.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の海賊艦隊! 提督ドン・クリーク\"},{\"title\":\"Protect Baratie! The Great Pirate, Red Foot Zeff!\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Don Krieg promises further malice as he returns to his ship, but the threat to the Baratie proves short-lived as an even bigger threat arrives!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"守れバラティエ! 大海賊・赫足のゼフ\"},{\"title\":\"Hawk-Eye Mihawk! The Great Swordsman Zoro Falls at Sea!\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Going Merry`s been stolen by Nami, and the showdown for possession of the Baratie is delayed. But the action`s not dead in the water - Zoro challenges Hawk-Eye Mihawk to a duel!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鷹の目のミホーク! 剣豪ゾロ海に散る\"},{\"title\":\"The Deadly Foot Technique Bursts Forth! Sanji vs. the Invincible Pearl!\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle begins for possession of the Baratie, with Zeff leading the cooks against Krieg`s pirates. Luffy and crew join the fray, but things aren`t looking too good!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必殺足技炸裂! サンジVS鉄壁のパール\"},{\"title\":\"Zeff and Sanji`s Dream! The Illusory All Blue!\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji recalls his childhood as an apprentice chef aboard a ship attacked by Red Foot Zeff! When the young Sanji found himself overboard, it was the fearsome captain himself who jumped to the rescue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゼフとサンジの夢 幻のオールブルー\"},{\"title\":\"Cool-Headed, Cold-Hearted Demon! Pirate Fleet Chief Commander Ghin!\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2000-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the battle for Baratie rages on, Luffy is forced to take a drastic course of action and Ghin debates where his loyalties lie.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冷徹非情の鬼人 海賊艦隊総隊長ギン\"},{\"title\":\"I Won`t Die! Fierce Battle, Luffy vs. Krieg!\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The scoundrel Don Krieg appears to have the upper hand in his fight with Luffy. To avoid walking the plank, the rubber man must try a different strategy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死なねェよ! 激闘ルフィVSクリーク!\"},{\"title\":\"The Conclusion of the Deadly Battle! A Spear of Blind Determination!\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The standoff between Luffy and Don Krieg takes a turn in favor of the Straw Hats when their captain focuses his onslaught on his opponent`s weaponry.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死闘の決着! 腹にくくった一本の槍!\"},{\"title\":\"Set Sail! The Seafaring Cook Sets Off with Luffy!\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2000-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Don Krieg defeated, Luffy tries to convince Sanji to join up with the Straw Hats. The skilled cook is interested, but he has something to prove before moving on.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"旅立ち! 海のコックはルフィとともに\"},{\"title\":\"The Worst Man in the Eastern Seas! Fishman Pirate Arlong!\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2000-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their culinary concerns in good hands, the Straw Hats set off in search of Nami - who`s on a collision course with a deadly foe!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"東の海最悪の男! 魚人海賊アーロン!\"},{\"title\":\"Witch of Cocoyashi Village! Arlong`s Female Leader!\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2000-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is captured by Fishman Arlong and learns a shocking secret about Nami. Unable to believe his ears, he puts the navigator to the ultimate test.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ココヤシ村の魔女! アーロンの女幹部\"},{\"title\":\"Usopp Dead?! When Is Luffy Going to Make Landfall?!\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2000-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew make their way towards Arlong Park and a showdown with its fishy proprietor. Along the way, they discover a treasure map that raises more questions about Nami.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウソップ死す?! ルフィ上陸はまだ?\"},{\"title\":\"Everyone`s Gathered! Usopp Speaks the Truth About Nami!\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2000-07-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A fierce argument over where Nami`s loyalties lie divides the Straw Hat Pirates and only one thing`s for sure - no one is willing to risk their life for a traitor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全員集結! ウソップが語るナミの真実\"},{\"title\":\"Untold Past! Female Warrior Bellemere!\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2000-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami`s adopted sister, Nojiko arrives to fill in some details about the skilled mapmaker`s younger days.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"秘められた過去! 女戦士ベルメール!\"},{\"title\":\"Survive! Mother Bellemere and Nami`s Bond!\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2000-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nojiko continues the story of Nami`s younger days. Back in the present, Nami gets agonizingly close to a long time goal, but betrayal looms on the horizon.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生き抜け! 母ベルメールとナミの絆!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Rises! Result of the Broken Promise!\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2000-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nezumi comes to confiscate Nami`s treasure, but who`s he working for? More importantly, who`s Nami working for, and what`s she gonna do with her booty?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ立つ! 裏切られた約束の結末!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy in Big Trouble! Fishmen vs. the Luffy Pirates!\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2000-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats` faith in Nami is restored, and now it`s time for a battle royal! Luffy and the gang are determined to make Arlong pay for mistreating their friend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ大ピンチ! 魚人VSルフィ海賊団\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Submerged! Zoro vs. Hatchan the Octopus!\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2000-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and Arlong`s fishmen are locked in a swashbuckling slugfest, but things take a bad turn when Luffy gets trapped beneath the waves.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ水没! ゾロvsタコのはっちゃん\"},{\"title\":\"Proud Warriors! Sanji and Usopp`s Fierce Battles!\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2000-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While his friends work to free the captain of the Straw Hats, cowardly Usopp finds himself in a position to shed his yellow streak and make his father proud.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"誇り高き戦士! 激闘サンジとウソップ\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy at Full Power! Nami`s Determination and the Straw Hat!\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2000-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami must decide between letting Arlong maintain his hold over her, or joining the Straw Hats and leading the oppressed villagers against the tyrant fishman.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ全開! ナミの決意と麦わら帽子\"},{\"title\":\"Explosion! Fishman Arlong`s Fierce Assault from the Sea!\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2000-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Arlong better watch his back-fins, because Captain Luffy knows about all the horrible things he did to Nami - and it makes his blood boil?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炸裂! 魚人アーロン海からの猛攻撃!\"},{\"title\":\"End of the Fishman Empire! Nami`s My Friend!\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2000-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Something about Nami`s former prison gives Luffy an added burst of strength. He`s so moved by her terrible past that he vows to destroy all of Arlong Park!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魚人帝国の終わり! ナミは俺の仲間だ!\"},{\"title\":\"Setting Out with a Smile! Farewell, Hometown Cocoyashi Village!\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2000-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After a grueling fight, Luffy defeats Arlong and succeeds in destroying his headquarters. The merry marauders enjoy the fruits of victory while Nami makes peace with her turbulent past.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"笑顔の旅立ち! さらば故郷ココヤシ村\"},{\"title\":\"Bounty! Straw Hat Luffy Becomes Known to the World!\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2000-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally, the day has arrived where Luffy`s face is on an authentic wanted poster! Now there are enemies in hot pursuit as the crew makes waves for Logue Town - final resting place of Gold Roger!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"賞金首! 麦わらのルフィ世に知れ渡る\"},{\"title\":\"Chase Straw Hat! Little Buggy`s Big Adventure!\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2000-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Buggy gets marooned on an island inhabited by unusual creatures and tangles with the island`s caretaker, Gaimon. If he is to finally destroy Luffy, Buggy must cast his lot with a mysterious woman.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麦わらを追え! 小さなバギーの大冒険\"},{\"title\":\"The Wait Is Over! The Return of Captain Buggy!\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2000-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Buggy Pirates fight each other for the right to take their lost captain`s place. While they`re busy beating each other`s brains out, a cannibalistic tribe makes plans to have something special for dinner.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お待ちかね! あぁ復活のバギー船長!\"},{\"title\":\"The Town of the Beginning and the End! Landfall at Logue Town!\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2000-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats arrive at Logue Town, and each crewmember embarks upon a mission of a more personal nature. While his crew shops, Luffy goes in search of sacred ground.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"始まりと終りの町 ローグタウン上陸\"},{\"title\":\"Kitetsu III and Yubashiri! Zoro`s New Swords and the Woman Sergeant Major!\",\"number\":49,\"airDate\":\"2000-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy has a run-in with Captain Smoker, and his failure to keep a low profile helps Buggy draw a bead on him. Elsewhere, Zoro takes a chance that his skill can overcome a dangerous curse.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三代鬼徹と雪走! ゾロの新刀と女曹長\"},{\"title\":\"Usopp vs. Daddy the Parent! Showdown at High!\",\"number\":50,\"airDate\":\"2000-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp finds an amazing pair of sharpshooter`s goggles, but they lead to a run in with Daddy the Parent - the greatest gunslinger ever! Now, the Straw Hat marksman is headed for the deadliest of all duels.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウソップVS子連れのダディ 真昼の決闘\"},{\"title\":\"Fiery Cooking Battle? Sanji vs. the Beautiful Chef!\",\"number\":51,\"airDate\":\"2000-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A cooking competition with the fiery chef Carmen rekindles Sanji`s dreams of the legendary All Blue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炎の料理バトル? サンジVS美人シェフ\"},{\"title\":\"Buggy`s Revenge! The Man Who Smiles on the Execution Platform!\",\"number\":52,\"airDate\":\"2000-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Buggy and his mysterious female ally trap Luffy on the same platform where Gold Roger was executed. He is to be killed for his offenses against Buggy, but Zoro and Sanji attempt a daring rescue mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"バギーのリベンジ! 処刑台で笑う男!\"},{\"title\":\"The Legend Has Started! Head for the Grand Line!\",\"number\":53,\"airDate\":\"2001-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As a storm batters Logue Town, Buggy, Alvida, and Captain Smoker close in on Luffy for a stirring final showdown!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説は始まった! 目指せ偉大なる航路[グランドライン]\"},{\"title\":\"Precursor to a New Adventure! Apis, a Mysterious Girl!\",\"number\":54,\"airDate\":\"2001-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The discovery of a small girl adrift in an abandoned life boat interrupts Luffy and his crew`s voyage to the Grand Line.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たなる冒険の予感! 謎の少女アピス\"},{\"title\":\"Miraculous Creature! Apis` Secret and the Legendary Island!\",\"number\":55,\"airDate\":\"2001-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After escaping the clutches of the Marine fleet, the Straw Hats soon find themselves in an equally dangerous predicament - stranded in the Calm Belt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡の生物! アピスの秘密と伝説の島\"},{\"title\":\"Eric Attacks! Great Escape from Warship Island!\",\"number\":56,\"airDate\":\"2001-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats want to return Apis`s dragon to his nest, but the Marines have them surrounded. Looks like it`s time for another daring escape!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エリック出撃! 軍艦島からの大脱出!\"},{\"title\":\"A Solitary Island in the Distant Sea! The Legendary Lost Island!\",\"number\":57,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Even for Nami, finding the dragon`s lost island proves to be tougher than looking for a needle in a haystack - or at the bottom of the ocean.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶海の孤島! 伝説のロストアイランド\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown in the Ruins! Tense Zoro vs. Eric!\",\"number\":58,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami discovers a map to the true location of the dragon`s nest, and Zorro puts his steel to the test against Eric the Whirlwind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"廃墟の決闘! 緊迫のゾロ VS エリック!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy, Completely Surrounded! Commodore Nelson`s Secret Strategy!\",\"number\":59,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats sail headfirst into Commodore Nelson and his Marine armada. While Luffy, Sanji, and Zoro dodge cannon balls, Eric the Whirlwind prepares a sneak attack!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ完全包囲! 提督ネルソンの秘策\"},{\"title\":\"Through the Sky They Soar! The 1000 Year Legend Lives Again!\",\"number\":60,\"airDate\":\"2001-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their rescue mission taking on water, the Straw Hats get some surprising help from the great blue yonder.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大空を舞うもの! 蘇る千年の伝説!\"},{\"title\":\"An Angry Showdown! Cross the Red Line!\",\"number\":61,\"airDate\":\"2001-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After unlocking the secrets of the dragon`s nest, Luffy does battle with Eric the Whirlwind to ensure the safety of the island. Don`t mess with the rubberman!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りの決着! 赤い大陸[レッドライン]を乗り越えろ!\"},{\"title\":\"The First Line of Defense? The Giant Whale Laboon Appears!\",\"number\":62,\"airDate\":\"2001-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hat crew takes a wild ride up and down a mountain only to end up in the belly of a giant whale that`s on the lookout for pirates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最初の砦? 巨大クジラ・ラブーン現る\"},{\"title\":\"A Promise Between Men! Luffy and the Whale Vow to Meet Again!\",\"number\":63,\"airDate\":\"2001-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy trades blows with Laboon the whale, and Nami is distressed to learn that navigating the Grand Line is no easy feat.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の約束! ルフィとクジラ再開の誓い\"},{\"title\":\"A Town That Welcomes Pirates? Setting Foot on Whisky Peak!\",\"number\":64,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A violent snow storm batters the crew of the Going Merry, but once the Straw Hats arrive at Whisky Peak, the locals invite them to a raucous celebration.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊歓迎の町? ウイスキーピーク上陸\"},{\"title\":\"Explosion! The Three Swords Style! Zoro vs. Baroque Works!\",\"number\":65,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There are bounty hunters on the prowl, and most of the Straw Hats are dead drunk. Only Zoro is still sober enough to hoist a sword.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炸裂三刀流! ゾロVSバロックワークス!\"},{\"title\":\"All-out Battle! Luffy vs. Zoro, Mysterious Grand Duel!\",\"number\":66,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There`s a mysterious princess that needs protection from a nose-picking assassin, but Luffy and Zoro are too busy duking it out to worry about explosive boogers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"真剣勝負! ルフィVSゾロ謎の大決闘!\"},{\"title\":\"Deliver Princess Vivi! The Luffy Pirates Set Sail!\",\"number\":67,\"airDate\":\"2001-04-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats depart Whisky Peak on a mission to return the Princess of Alabasta to her kingdom while protecting her from an army of vicious assassins.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"王女ビビを届けろ! ルフィ海賊団出航\"},{\"title\":\"Try Hard, Coby! Coby and Helmeppo`s Struggles in the Marines\",\"number\":68,\"airDate\":\"2001-05-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the crew heads for Little Garden with the princess, Luffy and Zorro`s old nemesis, Axe-Hand Morgan, escapes from a Marine prison ship.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"頑張れコビー! コビメッポ海軍奮闘記\"},{\"title\":\"Coby and Helmeppo`s Resolve! Vice-Admiral Garp`s Parental Affection!\",\"number\":69,\"airDate\":\"2001-05-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Colby and Helmeppo train day and night to prove they`re tough enough to be Marines. A violent showdown with Vice-Admiral Garp will determine if they`re worth their salt.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"コビメッポの決意! ガープ中将の親心\"},{\"title\":\"An Ancient Island! The Shadow Hiding in Little Garden!\",\"number\":70,\"airDate\":\"2001-05-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s gang is running low on supplies, so they stop at Little Garden to find something to eat. Unfortunately for them, it might end up the other way around.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"太古の島! リトルガーデンに潜む影!\"},{\"title\":\"Huge Duel! The Giants Dorry and Broggy!\",\"number\":71,\"airDate\":\"2001-06-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Not only are there dinosaurs running wild on the island of Little Garden, but the Straw Hats soon find themselves in the middle of a gargantuan grudge match.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"でっかい決闘! 巨人ドリーとブロギー\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Gets Angry! A Dirty Trick Violates the Sacred Duel!\",\"number\":72,\"airDate\":\"2001-06-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp and Luffy are fascinated by the endless battle waged between Dorry and Broggy; however, fascination turns to outrage when Monkey catches a whiff of treachery.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ怒る! 聖なる決闘に卑劣な罠!\"},{\"title\":\"Broggy`s Bitter Tears of Victory! The Conclusion of Elbaf!\",\"number\":73,\"airDate\":\"2001-06-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s blood boils for revenge against the assassins who sabotaged Dorry and Broggy`s battle, but he`s currently trapped between a rock and a hard place.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ブロキー勝利の号泣! エルバフの決着\"},{\"title\":\"The Devilish Candle! Tears of Regret and Tears of Anger!\",\"number\":74,\"airDate\":\"2001-07-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy struggles to free himself, his friends fall into the hands of Baroque Works. Though the odds are against them, the Straw Hats will never give up!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔のキャンドル! 無念の涙と怒りの涙\"},{\"title\":\"A Hex on Luffy! Colors Trap!\",\"number\":75,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami, Zorro, and the Princess are in danger of becoming exhibits in a fiendish artist`s collection, and only Luffy can save them. But he`s busy having a cup of tea.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィを襲う魔力! カラーズトラップ\"},{\"title\":\"Time to Fight Back! Usopp`s Quick Thinking and Fire Star!\",\"number\":76,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With his friends about to be permanently entombed in wax, Usopp is provided with the perfect opportunity to be brave and make his father proud.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いざ反撃! ウソップの機転と火炎星!\"},{\"title\":\"Farewell Giant Island! Head for Alabasta!\",\"number\":77,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After narrowly avoiding death, Luffy`s crew and the Princess set sail for Alabasta, but something large and dangerous looms in their path.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さらば巨人の島! アラバスタを目指せ\"},{\"title\":\"Nami`s Sick? Beyond the Snow Falling on the Stars!\",\"number\":78,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami comes down with a terrible fever and the Straw Hats don`t know what to do. Looks like the Grand Line might claim another victim.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミが病気? 海に降る雪の向こうに!\"},{\"title\":\"A Raid! The Tin Tyrant and Tin Plate Wapol!\",\"number\":79,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats continue their quest to find a doctor for Nami. Along the way, they deal with a ravenous invader and get a chilly reception from local islanders.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇襲! ブリキング号とブリキのワポル\"},{\"title\":\"An Island Without Doctors? Adventure in a Nameless Land!\",\"number\":80,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Sanji make a bold trek up a snow-covered mountain in search of a witch who might hold the key to curing Nami.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"医者のいない島? 名も無き国の冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"Are You Happy? The Doctor Called Witch!\",\"number\":81,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ferocious, giant, snow rabbits slow Luffy and Sanji`s progress up the mountain. Meanwhile, the former king Wapol returns to the town he abandoned.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ハッピーかい? 魔女と呼ばれた医者!\"},{\"title\":\"Dalton`s Resolve! Wapol`s Corps Land on the Island!\",\"number\":82,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami hovers near death while Luffy and Sanji fend off the abominable rabbits. Back at the village, Dalton leads a revolt against the dastardly Wapol.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ドルトンの覚悟! ワポル軍団島に上陸\"},{\"title\":\"The Island Where Snow Lives! Climb the Drum Rockies!\",\"number\":83,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An unlikely source acts as a roadblock to give Luffy some climbing room, and Zorro emerges from a snow bank cold, cranky, and ready to rumble!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雪の住む島! ドラムロッキーを登れ!\"},{\"title\":\"Blue-Nosed Reindeer! Chopper`s Secret!\",\"number\":84,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After a long journey up the mountain, Nami finally receives much-needed medical attention, but Sanji and Luffy are more interested in eating the doctor!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"トナカイは青っ鼻! チョッパーの秘密\"},{\"title\":\"An Outcast`s Dream! Hiriluk the Quack!\",\"number\":85,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy recruits Tony Tony Chopper to join the Straw Hat crew as the ship`s doctor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"はみだし者の夢! やぶ医者ヒルルク!\"},{\"title\":\"Hiriluk`s Cherry Blossoms and the Will That Gets Carried On!\",\"number\":86,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper`s first friend was a quack doctor who couldn`t cure a cold, but the old man still managed to teach the little reindeer how to care for people.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒルルクの桜と受け継がれゆく意志!\"},{\"title\":\"Fight Wapol`s Crew! The Power of the Munch Munch Fruit!\",\"number\":87,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy unleashes the full force of his Gum Gum furry on Wapol, and Chopper is amazed by the rubberman`s fierce devotion to the pirate flag.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"VSワポル軍団! バクバクの実の能力!\"},{\"title\":\"Zoan-Type Devil Fruit! Chopper`s Seven-Form Transformation!\",\"number\":88,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Wapol orders his goons to attack the Straw Hats, Chopper shows off a little something he calls the Rumble Ball!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動物[ゾオン]系悪魔の実! チョッパー七段変形\"},{\"title\":\"When the Kingdom`s Rule Ends! The Flag of Faith Flies Forever!\",\"number\":89,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Wapol attacks Nami in her weakened condition, but Monkey D. Luffy is quick to step in and even the odds.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"王国の支配終る時! 信念の旗は永遠に\"},{\"title\":\"Hiriluk`s Cherry Blossoms! Miracle in the Drum Rockies!\",\"number\":90,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After an explosive battle with Wapol, Luffy begins the tiring process of convincing Chopper to join his pirate gang.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒルルクの桜! ドラムロッキーの奇跡\"},{\"title\":\"Goodbye Drum Island! I`m Going Out to Sea!\",\"number\":91,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper sets sail for Alabasta with his new friends, and Dalton thinks back to his first meeting with Princess Vivi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さよならドラム島! 僕は海へ出る!\"},{\"title\":\"Alabasta`s Hero and a Ballerina on the Ship!\",\"number\":92,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats rescue a man of many faces as they approach Alabasta. Sure, he`s good for a laugh, but they may regret pulling him out of the drink.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アラバスタの英雄と船上のバレリーナ\"},{\"title\":\"Off to the Desert Kingdom! The Rain-Summoning Powder and the Rebel Army!\",\"number\":93,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats arrive in Alabasta with precious little time to stop the rebellion. Sanji and Chopper are sent to gather supplies for a dangerous trip across the desert.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いざ砂漠の国へ! 雨を呼ぶ粉と反乱軍\"},{\"title\":\"The Heroes` Reunion! His Name Is Fire Fist Ace!\",\"number\":94,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captain Smoker has Luffy in his grasp until a fiery stranger creates a diversion, giving the Straw Hats a chance to make a break for it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"豪傑達の再会! 奴の名は火拳のエース\"},{\"title\":\"Ace and Luffy! Hot Emotions and Brotherly Bonds!\",\"number\":95,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ace and Luffy`s happy reunion is crudely interrupted by the Billions of Baroque Works. They may be outnumbered, but these brothers are no ordinary pirates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エースとルフィ! 熱き想いと兄弟の絆\"},{\"title\":\"Erumalu, the City of Green and the Kung Fu Dugongs!\",\"number\":96,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Before they can start their trek across the desert, Luffy and the Straw Hats are stopped at the shore by the cute - but formidable - Kung Fu Dugongs.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緑の町エルマルとクンフージュゴン!\"},{\"title\":\"Adventure in the Country of Sand! The Monsters That Live in the Scorching Land!\",\"number\":97,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s crew encounters treacherous birds and man-eating foliage on its desert odyssey, and just when they think the coast is clear, a great disturbance emerges from beneath the sand!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砂の国の冒険! 炎熱の大地に棲む魔物\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Desert Pirates! The Men Who Live Freely!\",\"number\":98,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats cross paths with the Barbar Sand Pirates, and Ace runs into big trouble when he gets separated from the group.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砂漠の海賊団登場! 自由に生きる男達\"},{\"title\":\"False Fortitude! Camu, Rebel Soldier at Heart!\",\"number\":99,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Princess Vivi devises a plan to test the hearts of a gang of so-called rebels. They talk a good game, but will their bite measure up to their bark?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ニセモノの意地! 心の反乱軍カミュ!\"},{\"title\":\"Rebel Warrior Koza! The Dream Vowed to Vivi!\",\"number\":100,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats continue their journey to Yuba, where a bittersweet reunion with a childhood friend awaits Princess Vivi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反乱軍戦士コーザ! ビビに誓った夢!\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown in a Heat Haze! Ace vs. the Gallant Scorpion!\",\"number\":101,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fire Fist Ace is hired by two young boys to hunt down and capture a lethal bounty hunter known only as the Scorpion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"陽炎の決闘! エースVS男スコーピオン\"},{\"title\":\"Ruins and Lost Ways! Vivi, Her Friends, and the Country`s Form!\",\"number\":102,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper, Zoro, and Luffy get separate from the others. When the heat makes Luffy act even stranger than usual, his friends wonder if they joined the right pirate gang.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遺跡と迷子! ビビと仲間と国のかたち\"},{\"title\":\"Spiders Cafe at 8 o`Clock! The Enemy Leaders Gather!\",\"number\":103,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The assassins of Baroque Works gather at Spider`s Cafe, and the Straw Hats arrive at Yuba only to find it buried in sand.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スパイダースカフェに8時敵幹部集合\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy vs. Vivi! The Tearful Vow to Put Friends on the Line\",\"number\":104,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile reveals himself to the Baroque Works assassins and discloses his dastardly plan for Alabasta. After departing Yuba, Luffy takes a stand that forces Vivi to rethink her mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィVSビビ! 仲間に賭ける涙の誓い\"},{\"title\":\"The Battlefront of Alabasta! Rainbase, the City of Dreams\",\"number\":105,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vivi takes Luffy`s advice, and the Straw Hats head towards Rainbase for a confrontation with Crocodile. Karoo finally reaches the palace with Vivi`s warning for King Cobra.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アラバスタ戦線! 夢の町レインベース\"},{\"title\":\"The Trap of Certain Defeat! Storming Raindinners!\",\"number\":106,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy leads a daring - but foolish - raid on Crocodile`s casino. His poor planning lands him behind bars with Captain Smoker - and more importantly, leaves Vivi unprotected.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命の罠! レインディナーズ突入\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Utopia Commences! The Swell of Rebellion Stirs!\",\"number\":107,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the Straw Hats are stuck in the clink, King Cobra addresses the starving people of Nanohana. Will his unbelievable revelation drive his subjects past the brink of rebellion?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ユートピア作戦発動! 動き出した反乱[うねり]\"},{\"title\":\"The Terrifying Banana Gators and Mr. Prince!\",\"number\":108,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A royal impostor has the rebel army hell-bent on bringing Cobra`s reign to a violent end. Meanwhile, Luffy and his mates find themselves in deep trouble and even deeper water.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖のバナナワニとミスタープリンス\"},{\"title\":\"The Key to a Great Comeback Escape! The Wax-Wax Ball!\",\"number\":109,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji shows up in the nick of time to make the crocs cough up the key to Luffy`s freedom, but the ravenous reptiles spit up something else instead.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逆転大脱出への鍵! ドルドルボール!\"},{\"title\":\"Merciless Mortal Combat! Luffy vs. Crocodile\",\"number\":110,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile snatches Vivi off the back of a giant crab, but Luffy`s not having it. The rubber-man goes toe-to-toe with the sandman in a battle that will end in bloodshed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"情無用の死闘! ルフィVSクロコダイル\"},{\"title\":\"Dash for a Miracle! Alabasta Animal Land\",\"number\":111,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile puts Luffy down for a never-ending dirt nap, and the Straw Hats get a lift from a crabby ally in their race to stop the looming rebellion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡への疾走! アラバスタ動物ランド\"},{\"title\":\"Rebel Army vs. Royal Army! Showdown at Alubarna\",\"number\":112,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vivi arrives in Alubarna with just enough time to stop the rebellion, but the agents of Baroque Works lurk in every corner, waiting to sabotage her plans for peace.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反乱軍VS国王軍! 決戦はアルバーナ!\"},{\"title\":\"Alubarna Grieves! The Fierce Captain Karoo\",\"number\":113,\"airDate\":\"2002-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji buys Vivi some time by mixing it up with a foe of many faces. Outside Alubarna`s walls, Chopper and Usopp tangle with Miss Merry Christmas and her slugging sidekick.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"嘆きのアルバーナ! 激闘カルー隊長!\"},{\"title\":\"Sworn on a Friend`s Dream! The Battle of Molehill, Block 4\",\"number\":114,\"airDate\":\"2002-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp finally shows some courage by using a five-ton hammer to play whack-a-mole with Miss Merry Christmas. He may be bluffing, but the distraction lets Chopper zero in on the enemy`s weakness.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間の夢に誓う! 決闘モグラ塚4番街\"},{\"title\":\"Big Opening Day Today! The Copy-Copy Montage\",\"number\":115,\"airDate\":\"2002-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper`s Rumble Ball could be the difference between life and death in the mole ballgame. Elsewhere, Sanji has trouble kicking a pretty enemy, and Vivi proposes something unthinkable.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"本日大公開! マネマネモンタージュ!\"},{\"title\":\"Transformed into Nami! Bon Clay`s Rapid-Fire Ballet Kenpo!\",\"number\":116,\"airDate\":\"2002-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vivi continues preparations to blow up the palace; Zorro puts his steel to the test against a lethal blade-man; and Sanji tries to overcome his inability to kick a foxy lady!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友[ナミ]に変身! ボンクレー連発バレエ拳法\"},{\"title\":\"Nami`s Cyclone Advisory! Clima Tact Burst!\",\"number\":117,\"airDate\":\"2002-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Things don`t look good for the prettiest Straw Hat. Nami`s about to tangle with a thorny adversary, and the weapon Usopp built her is only good for party tricks!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミの旋風注意報! クリマタクト炸裂\"},{\"title\":\"Secret Passed Down in the Royal Family! The Ancient Weapon Pluton!\",\"number\":118,\"airDate\":\"2002-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile reveals his sinister motives for attacking Alabasta, and Nami tries to end her duel with Miss Doublefinger by unleashing the Clima Tact`s ultimate weapon: a devastatingly lethal tornado!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"王家に伝わる秘密! 古代兵器プルトン\"},{\"title\":\"Secret of Powerful Swordplay! Ability to Cut Steel and the Rhythm Things Have!\",\"number\":119,\"airDate\":\"2002-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro hopes to attain a new level of strength when he fights a foe with a body made of blades. The Straw Hat sword-slinger is determined to become a man who can cut steel - or die trying.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"豪剣の極意! 鋼鉄を斬る力と物の呼吸\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Is Over! Koza Raises the White Flag!\",\"number\":120,\"airDate\":\"2002-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Koza - the leader of the rebel army - finally discovers the evil mastermind behind Alabasta`s drought, but is he too late to prevent further bloodshed?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦いは終わった!コーザが掲げた白い旗\"},{\"title\":\"Where Vivi`s Voice Gets Heard! The Hero Descends!\",\"number\":121,\"airDate\":\"2002-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Koza is mysteriously shot, the rebellion is reborn, but Vivi`s cries for a cease fire fall on deaf ears until a long-overdue hero swoops to the rescue!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ビビの声の行方! 英雄[ヒーロー]は舞い降りた!\"},{\"title\":\"Sand Croc and Water Luffy! The Second Round of the Duel!\",\"number\":122,\"airDate\":\"2002-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy finally discovers the secret to knocking out a sandman, but it won`t matter unless Vivi and the rest of the Straw Hats can locate the Baroque Works bomber.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砂ワニと水ルフィ! 決闘第2ラウンド\"},{\"title\":\"That Looks Croc-ish! Luffy, Run to the Royal Tomb!\",\"number\":123,\"airDate\":\"2002-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While his mates search for a bomb, Luffy narrowly survives his second scrape with Crocodile. Across town, Nico Robin strong-arms Cobra into revealing his country`s greatest secret.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワニっぽい! 王家の墓へ走れルフィ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Nightmare Draws Near! This Is the Sand-Sand Clan`s Secret Base\",\"number\":124,\"airDate\":\"2002-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the walls crumbling down around them, Crocodile attacks Luffy with a poisoned pirate hook. Meanwhile, Vivi draws a bead on the bombers, but can she stop them in time?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢の時迫る! ここは砂砂団秘密基地\"},{\"title\":\"Magnificent Wings! My Name Is Pell, Guardian Deity of the Country\",\"number\":125,\"airDate\":\"2002-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats team up to give Vivi one last shot at disarming the bomb that threatens to destroy her city. She succeeds in cutting the fuse, but Crocodile has a backup plan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"偉大なる翼! 我が名は国の守護神ペル\"},{\"title\":\"I Will Surpass You! Rain Falls in Arabasta!\",\"number\":126,\"airDate\":\"2002-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pell`s sacrifice spares his beloved city, but only an act of god can stop the rebellion. With Crocodile`s poison coursing through his body, Luffy musters a final attack against Alabasta`s oppressor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"越えていく! アラバスタに雨が降る!\"},{\"title\":\"A Farewell to Arms! Pirates and Different Ideas of Justice!\",\"number\":127,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile is defeated, the rain has returned to Alabasta, and Vivi`s people are eager to rebuild their kingdom. As for the Straw Hats, they have a fleet of marines breathing down their necks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"武器よさらば! 海賊といくつかの正義\"},{\"title\":\"The Pirates` Banquet and Operation Escape from Alabasta!\",\"number\":128,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now that the rebellion is over, Vivi must make an important decision about her future. The Straw Hats are ready to hoist the anchor, but an ambiguous villain has stolen the Going Merry!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊たちの宴とアラバスタ脱出作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"It All Started on That Day...! Vivi Tells the Story of Her Adventure!\",\"number\":129,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mr. 2 is a man of many faces, but he finally shows his true colors when the marines attack the Straw Hats. Elsewhere, Vivi has a scheme up her sleeve, and it involves Igaram wearing a dress.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"始まりはあの日! ビビが語る冒険譚!\"},{\"title\":\"Scent of Danger! The Seventh Member Is Nico Robin!\",\"number\":130,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew watch Alabasta fade into the distance, but there`s no time for reminiscing. The marines are in hot pursuit, and there`s a stowaway aboard the Going Merry!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危険な香り! 七人目はニコ・ロビン!\"},{\"title\":\"The First Patient! The Untold Story of the Rumble Ball!\",\"number\":131,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fresh off their adventure Alabasta, the Straw Hats discover an isolated island where they can restock their food supply. Chopper is left to guard the ship, but he and Nico spend the afternoon exploring instead!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"はじめての患者[クランケ]! ランブルボール秘話\"},{\"title\":\"Uprising of the Navigator! For the Unyielding Dream!\",\"number\":132,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When a mail-order salesman gets lost at sea, Nami finds the paper she needs to start making maps. If the Straw Hat crew can somehow manage to survive a deadly cyclone, she might actually get some use out of it!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"航海士の反乱! ゆずれない夢の為に!\"},{\"title\":\"A Recipe Handed Down! Sanji, the Iron Man of Curry\",\"number\":133,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Heavy fog leads to a close encounter of the culinary kind when Nico fishes a marine out of the drink. The aspiring chef is concerned about the quality of his curry, and Sanji is just the guy to refine his recipe!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"受け継がれる夢[レシピ]! カレーの鉄人サンジ\"},{\"title\":\"I Will Make It Bloom! Usopp the Man and the Eight-Foot Shell!\",\"number\":134,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A break in the rain provides the perfect opportunity for Usopp to help a young girl fulfill her dream of launching the world`s largest firework.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"咲かせてみせます! 男ウソップ八尺玉\"},{\"title\":\"The Fabled Pirate Hunter! Zoro, The Wandering Swordsman\",\"number\":135,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Money troubles force Zoro to tangle with Dick the Bandit and his treacherous gang of thugs. These gun-toting outlaws are terrorizing a peaceful village, and the Straw Hat swordsman aims to stop their reign of terror!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"噂の海賊狩り! さすらいの剣士ゾロ\"},{\"title\":\"Zenny of the Island of Goats and the Pirate Ship in the Mountains!\",\"number\":136,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A barrage of Marine cannon balls forces the Straw Hats to seek refuge on an uncharted island. Once ashore, the crew encounters a strange old man living amongst a herd of goats.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヤギの島のゼニィと山の中の海賊船!\"},{\"title\":\"How`s Tricks? The Designs of Zenny the Moneylender!\",\"number\":137,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Old man Zenny made a fortune lending money to scallywags, but he always dreamed of becoming a pirate himself. When the marines set out to trap the Straw Hats, the wily hermit may finally get his wish!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"儲かりまっか? 金貸しゼニィの野望!\"},{\"title\":\"Whereabouts of the Island Treasure! Attack of the Zenny Pirates!\",\"number\":138,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zenny gets more than he bargained for when he embarks on his maiden pirate voyage. The Straw Hats may have made a friend for life, but what are they gonna do about those pesky marines?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"島のお宝の行方! ゼニィ海賊団出撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Legend of the Rainbow Mist! Old Man Henzo of Luluka Island\",\"number\":139,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats stop for supplies at a harbor town plagued by a mayor who taxes anything and everything. Over lunch, Luffy and Nico befriend a kooky scientist who`s obsessed with the Rainbow Mist.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"虹色の霧伝説! ルルカ島[とう]の老人ヘンゾ\"},{\"title\":\"Residents of the Land of Eternity! The Pumpkin Pirates\",\"number\":140,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Usopp, Nico, and Zoro get trapped in the Rainbow Mist along with Henzo. The aging scientist is looking for answers, the Straw Hats want treasure, and the ghosts who haunt the mist want them all to leave!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"永遠の国の住人! パンプキン海賊団!\"},{\"title\":\"Thoughts of Home! The Pirate Graveyard of No Escape!\",\"number\":141,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew search for a way out of Ape`s Concert, but the Rainbow Mist is an inescapable maze of madness. Back on shore, Nami, Chopper, and Sanji face a lifetime of hard labor for failing to pay their taxes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"故郷への想い! 脱出不能の海賊墓場!\"},{\"title\":\"An Inevitable Melee! Wetton`s Schemes and the Rainbow Tower\",\"number\":142,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami enters the mist on a mission to save her mates - and maybe hunt for treasure while she`s at it. The local mayor wants her dead, but the Straw Hats are being protected by a mysterious marine.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"乱戦必死! ウェットンの野望と虹の塔\"},{\"title\":\"And So, the Legend Begins! To the Other Side of the Rainbow\",\"number\":143,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The showdown with Mayor Wetton builds towards an explosive finale as the Straw Hats scramble to escape the Rainbow Mist - or be trapped inside forever.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"そして伝説が始まる! いざ虹の彼方へ\"},{\"title\":\"Caught Log! The King of Salvagers, Masira!\",\"number\":144,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats are nearly crushed by the falling wreckage of a ship that`s over 200 years old. Could rumors of a floating island in the sky be true? Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji go scuba diving to find out!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奪われた記録[ログ]! サルベージ王マシラ!\"},{\"title\":\"Monsters Appear! Don`t Mess with the White Beard Pirates!\",\"number\":145,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Still searching for a route to the island in the sky, the Straw Hats chart a course for Jaya. Meanwhile, Fire-Fist Ace crashes a party aboard a vessel helmed by Buggy the Pirate!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怪物登場! 白ひげ一味には手を出すな\"},{\"title\":\"Quit Dreaming! Mock Town, the Town of Ridicule!\",\"number\":146,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats drop anchor at a town overrun by scallywags, so Nami makes the boys swear to stay out of trouble. But when the Bellamy Pirates come looking for a fight, Luffy may have to break his promise!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夢を見るな! 嘲りの街モックタウン!\"},{\"title\":\"Distinguished Pirates! A Man Who Talks of Dreams and the King of Undersea Search!\",\"number\":147,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nico`s handy work unearths a solitary dreamer who may know the way to Sky Island. All Luffy and his crew have to do is survive the sonic onslaught of simian salvagers seeking to sink the Going Merry!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊の高み! 夢を語る男と海底探索王\"},{\"title\":\"Legendary Family! Noland, the Liar!\",\"number\":148,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his mates reach the home of Mont Blanc Cricket: the man with the key to reaching Sky Island. There`s just one tiny problem - he comes from a long line of legendary liars.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の一族! 「うそつきノーランド」\"},{\"title\":\"Steer for the Clouds! Capture the South Bird!\",\"number\":149,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Montblanc Cricket agrees to help the Straw Hats reach Sky Island, but first they must venture deep into the darkest depths of a spider-infested forest to capture a mysterious bird with a keen sense of direction.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雲舵いっぱい! サウスバードを追え!\"},{\"title\":\"Dreams Don`t Come True?! Bellamy vs. the Saruyama Alliance!\",\"number\":150,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the Straw Hats battle creepy-crawly forest creatures on their quest to capture a South Bird, Mont Blanc and his monkey minions are brutally attacked by the Bellamy Pirates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"幻想は叶わない!? ベラミーVS猿山連合\"},{\"title\":\"100 Million Man! World`s Greatest Power and Pirate Black Beard!\",\"number\":151,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy turned the other cheek during his first encounter with Bellamy, but now he`s out to settle the score for old man Mont Blanc. Meanwhile, a fearsome pirate crew takes aim at the Straw Hats, eager to earn a bad reputation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一億の男! 世界最高権力と海賊黒ひげ\"},{\"title\":\"Take to the Sky! Ride the Knockup Stream!\",\"number\":152,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thanks to some modifications to the Going Merry, the Straw Hats are on their way to that island in the sky! But with the Blackbeard Pirates in hot pursuit, navigating the vertical currents will be anything but easy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"船は空をゆく! 突き上げる海流[ノックアップストリーム]に乗れ\"},{\"title\":\"Sail the White Sea! The Sky Knight and the Gate in the Clouds!\",\"number\":153,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Reaching the sea of clouds proves easier than surviving in it when giant sea creatures attack the Going Merry, Usopp nearly drowns in a cloud, and a strange sky knight issues the Straw Hats a warning!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ここは空の海! 空の騎士と天国の門\"},{\"title\":\"Godland, Skypiea! Angels on a Beach of Clouds!\",\"number\":154,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After hitching a ride on a speedy shrimp, the Straw Hats reach the land of Skypiea! The intrepid pirates have much to learn about their new surroundings, but a beautiful angel makes a perfect tour guide.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神の国スカイピア! 雲の渚の天使たち\"},{\"title\":\"The Forbidden Sacred Ground! The Island Where God Lives and Heaven`s Judgment!\",\"number\":155,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami`s eagerness to explore the forbidden realm of Upper Yard brings her face to face with the wrath of god, and the Straw Hats incur Heaven`s Judgment for failing to pay their immigration fees!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁断の聖地! 神の住む島と天の裁き!\"},{\"title\":\"Already Criminals?! Skypiea`s Upholder of the Law!\",\"number\":156,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats are no strangers to living on the wrong side of the law, but unpaid immigration fees and Nami`s assault of a White Beret earns Luffy`s crew a sentence of death by cloud drifting!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"早くも犯罪者!? スカイピアの法の番人\"},{\"title\":\"Is Escape Possible?! God`s Challenge Is Set in Motion!\",\"number\":157,\"airDate\":\"2003-06-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami, Zoro, Chopper, and Robin are trapped aboard the Going Merry when it`s commandeered by a monstrous lobster! To rescue his crew, Luffy must venture onto the sacred grounds of Upper Yard!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"脱出なるか!? 動きはじめた神の試練!\"},{\"title\":\"A Trap on Lovely Street! The Almighty Eneru!\",\"number\":158,\"airDate\":\"2003-06-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Conis helps Luffy and his mates launch their rescue mission, but the rubber-man senses something amiss. When he presses her for answers, a vengeful god takes a shot at the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ラブリー通りの罠! 全能なる神[ゴッド]エネル\"},{\"title\":\"Onward, Crow! To the Sacrificial Altar!\",\"number\":159,\"airDate\":\"2003-07-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro dukes it out with a hungry Skyshark in the shadow of the Sacrificial Alter. On the other side of Upper Yard, Luffy, Sanji, and Usopp try to survive their visit to an island that wants them dead!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"すすめカラス丸! 生贄の祭壇を目指せ\"},{\"title\":\"10% Survival Rate! Satori, the Mantra Master!\",\"number\":160,\"airDate\":\"2003-07-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Sanji, and Usopp tangle with Satori and his exploding, snake-filled Surprise Clouds. The sky priest may look like a dancing dango, but the impact of his mantra leaves the pirates bloodied and boatless.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生存率10%! 心綱[マントラ]使いの神官サトリ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ordeal of Spheres! Desperate Struggle in the Lost Forest!\",\"number\":161,\"airDate\":\"2003-07-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp and Sanji try to regain control of the Crow, and Luffy stirs up a brutal barrage of bursting balls when he attacks Satori. Meanwhile, Chopper whistles for the Sky Knight to avoid becoming a sacrificial reindeer!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"「玉の試練」の脅威! 迷いの森の死闘\"},{\"title\":\"Chopper in Danger! Former God vs. Priest Shura!\",\"number\":162,\"airDate\":\"2003-08-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper fights bravely to stop Shura from incinerating the Going Merry, but the little reindeer is no match for a sky priest. Gan Fall is on his way, but will the dispossessed deity arrive in time?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"チョッパー危うし! 元神VS神官シュラ\"},{\"title\":\"Profound Mystery! Ordeal of String and Ordeal of Love?\",\"number\":163,\"airDate\":\"2003-08-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Gan Fall is badly burned during his battle with Shura, Chopper musters the courage for a death-defying leap of faith. Elsewhere, Luffy may have finally discovered a way to defeat Satori!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"摩訶不思議! 紐の試練と恋の試練!?\"},{\"title\":\"Light the Fire of Shandora! Wyper, the Warrior!\",\"number\":164,\"airDate\":\"2003-08-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Shandorians prepare for an all-out attack on their priestly adversaries, Chopper meets the mysterious creatures that saved his life, and Nami makes an astonishing discovery about the origins of Upper Yard.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シャンドラの灯を燈せ! 戦士ワイパー\"},{\"title\":\"Jaya, City of Gold in the Sky! Head for God`s Shrine!\",\"number\":165,\"airDate\":\"2003-08-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the Shandorians continue their battle for control of Upper Yard, the Straw Hats celebrate their happy reunion by swapping stories over a campfire and feasting on barbequed Skyshark!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天空の黄金郷ジャヤ! 目指せ神の社!\"},{\"title\":\"Festival on the Night Before Gold-Hunting! Feelings for Vearth!\",\"number\":166,\"airDate\":\"2003-09-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Laki`s pursuit of precious Vearth causes one of her Shandorian comrades to be injured during the battle with Ohm. As night falls on Upper Yard, the Straw Hats dream of gold while dancing with wolves!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄金前夜祭! 「ヴァース」への想い!\"},{\"title\":\"Enter God Eneru! Farewell to the Survivors!\",\"number\":167,\"airDate\":\"2003-09-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The electrifying deity of Skypiea, God Eneru, grants his priests unlimited power in their hunt for the Straw Hats. Usopp has a plan to get the mysteriously-repaired Going Merry back in the water, but it involves using Chopper as bait!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神[ゴッド]・エネル登場!! 生き残りへの夜明曲[オーパード]\"},{\"title\":\"A Giant Snake Bares Its Fangs! The Survival Game Begins!\",\"number\":168,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats scatter when their search for gold uncovers a giant python, and Gan Fall reveals the tragic story of Jaya`s arrival in the sky. Meanwhile, Wyper readies the Shandorians for a raid on Eneru`s shrine!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"牙むく大蛇[うわばみ]! 遂に始まる生き残り合戦[サバイバルゲーム]\"},{\"title\":\"The Deadly Reject! War Demon Wyper`s Resolve!\",\"number\":169,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the heartless god of Upper Yard eagerly anticipates the dawning of Sky Warefare, the Shandorian forces are savagely snared by the Ordeal of String, and Luffy wanders into the fight of his life!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"捨て身の排撃[リジェクト]!「戦鬼」ワイパーの覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Midair Battle! Pirate Zoro vs. Warrior Braham!\",\"number\":170,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro rushes to perfect a deadly technique known as the Flying Blade Attack. The move proves difficult to master, but it could be the key to the swordsman surviving a battle with the Shandorian warrior, Braham.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空中の激戦! 海賊ゾロVS戦士ブラハム\"},{\"title\":\"The Roaring Burn Bazooka! Luffy vs. War Demon Wyper!\",\"number\":171,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji and Usopp are driven to their knees by the electrifying presence of god, Luffy is nearly incinerated by Wyper`s Burn Bazooka, and Nami joins Gan Fall in a fight against two killer clones!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"唸る燃焼砲[バーンバズーカー]!! ルフィvs戦鬼ワイパー\"},{\"title\":\"The Ordeal of the Swamp! Chopper vs. Sky Punk Gedatsu!\",\"number\":172,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper unleashes the fury of his Rumble Ball during a sticky slugfest with a swap cloud spewing priest of Upper Yard. Can the little reindeer discover his opponent`s lone weakness before it`s too late?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"沼の試練! チョッパーVS神官ゲダツ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Unbeatable Powers! Eneru`s True Form Is Revealed!\",\"number\":173,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and the Knight of the Sky team up to obliterate two bumbling, balloon-shaped bad guys, and God Eneru relies on his astounding invincibility to torment a noble Shandorian warrior.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無敵の能力! 明かされるエネルの正体\"},{\"title\":\"A Mystical City! The Grand Ruins of Shandora!\",\"number\":174,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin`s search for a mystical city of gold is interrupted by Yama, one of Eneru`s faithful servants. When the rampaging warrior destroys some ancient ruins, he provokes the wrath of Robin`s many fists of fury!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"幻の都! 雄大なるシャンドラの遺跡!!\"},{\"title\":\"0% Survival Rate! Chopper vs. Ohm, the Sword Wielding Priest!\",\"number\":175,\"airDate\":\"2003-12-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Priest Ohm silences Chopper with an attack from which few - if any - ever recover. Meanwhile, Luffy begins to notice something strange about his cave-like prison, and four fearsome warriors prepare for battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生存率0%!! チョッパーvs神官オーム\"},{\"title\":\"Climb Giant Jack! Deadly Combat in the Upper Ruins!\",\"number\":176,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro, Gan Fall, Wyper, Ohm and a prizefighting pooch gather for a ferocious free-for-all at the site of the Upper Ruins. While the battle rages, Luffy tries to punch his way out of the belly of a poisonous python!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"\\\"巨大豆蔓[ジィアントジャック]\\\"を登れ!! 上層遺跡の死闘\"},{\"title\":\"The Ordeal of Iron! White Barbed Death Match!\",\"number\":177,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Wyper are out to beat down the same bad guys, but will they realize it soon enough to survive a white-barbed death match of doom? Deep in the belly of the python, Nami and Luffy enjoy what could be a short-lived reunion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鉄の試練の真骨頂! 白荊デスマッチ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Bursting Slash! Zoro vs. Ohm!\",\"number\":178,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Eager to end their battle, Zoro aims the awesome destructive power of his 108 Caliber Phoenix at the sinister Priest Ohm! Elsewhere, god demands that Robin help him search for a legendary golden bell.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ほとばしる斬撃! ゾロvs神官オーム!!\"},{\"title\":\"Collapsing Upper Ruins! The Quintet for the Finale!\",\"number\":179,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"God Eneru begins a deadly rampage aimed at exterminating the heavenly beings of Skypiea, and the ruins of Shandora become the scene of bloody contest where survival is the name of the game.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"崩れゆく上層遺跡! 終曲[フィナーレ]への五重奏[クインテット]!!\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown in the Ancient Ruins! Sky God Eneru`s Goal!\",\"number\":180,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gan Fall, Wyper, Zoro, and Robin join forces for an attack on God Eneru. Despite their furious onslaught, the four warriors prove powerless to harm the thunderous deity until Wyper utilizes the power of a mystical stone!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"古代遺跡の対決! 神[ゴッド]・エネルの目的!!\"},{\"title\":\"Ambition Toward the Endless Vearth! The Ark Maxim!\",\"number\":181,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"God Eneru makes a shocking recovery from wounds that should have ended his reign of terror. Zoro and Wyper muster the strength for one final stand, and Nami must choose between her friends - and survival.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"限りない大地[フェアリーヴァース]への野望 方舟マクシム!!\"},{\"title\":\"They Finally Clash! Pirate Luffy vs. God Eneru!\",\"number\":182,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy emerges from his serpentine tomb with one thing on his mind: revenge! As the rubber-man sets out to settle the score with God Eneru, Conis rushes to warn her people of their impending doom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に激突! 海賊ルフィvs神[ゴット]・エネル!!\"},{\"title\":\"Maxim Surfaces! Deathpiea Is Activated!\",\"number\":183,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the citizens of the sky run for their lives, Eneru issues in the dawn of Deathpiea! Luffy is determined to stop the madman, but first he must discover a way to lay hands on the heinous holy man!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マクシム浮上! 動き始めたデスピア!!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Falls! Eneru`s Judgment and Nami`s Wish!\",\"number\":184,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A handful of gold sends Luffy hurtling towards his death, Sanji and Usopp mount a midair rescue mission, and Nami prepares for an electrifying showdown with God Eneru!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ落下! 神の裁きとナミの望み!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Awaken! On the Front Lines of the Burning Love Rescue!\",\"number\":185,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp arrives just in time to save Nami from a lethal thunderbolt, but even their combined powers are no match for Eneru. While they scramble for an escape route, Sanji stealthily searches for a way to sabotage god`s ark!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"目覚めた二人! 燃える恋の救出前線!!\"},{\"title\":\"Capriccio for Despair! The Impending Doom of Sky Island!\",\"number\":186,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite being slowed by an arm encased in gold, Luffy races up a giant beanstalk on a mission to settle the score with Eneru! Elsewhere, the people of Skypiea feel the jolt of god`s wrath!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望への狂想曲[カプリッチオ] 迫り来る空島の消滅!!\"},{\"title\":\"Led by a Bell`s Sound! Tale of the Great Warrior and the Explorer!\",\"number\":187,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A flashback offers a glimpse at that lives of two legendary figures in Skypiea`s history: Montblanc Noland and the ferocious warrior Kalgara!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鐘の音の導き! 大戦士と探検家の物語\"},{\"title\":\"Free from the Spell! The Great Warrior Sheds Tears!\",\"number\":188,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The look back at the legend of Montblanc Noland and Kalgara the warrior continues with the story of how these two very different men suddenly found friendship - and then lost it just as quickly!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呪縛からの解放! 大戦士が流した涙!!\"},{\"title\":\"Eternal Friends! The Vowed Bell Echoes Across the Mighty Seas!\",\"number\":189,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Montblanc Noland and the warrior Kalgara succeed in settling their difference before parting ways, but the laws of nature and man conspire to keep them apart - permanently!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"永遠の親友! 大海原に響く誓いの鐘!!\"},{\"title\":\"Angel Island Obliterated! The Horror of the Raigo`s Advent!\",\"number\":190,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Eneru strikes Angel Island with a devastating lightning bolt, and Luffy continues his heroic climb up the giant beanstalk. The rubber-man refuses to stop until he rings the golden bell - no matter what the cost!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エンジェル島消滅! 雷迎[らいごう]降臨の恐怖!!\"},{\"title\":\"Knock Over Giant Jack! Last Hope for Escape!\",\"number\":191,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Eneru continues his thunderous barrage, Nami hatches a plan to give Luffy one more shot at a grudge match with god. Zoro`s at the center of the scheme, but he might not survive his mission!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨大豆蔓[ジャイアントジャック]を倒せ! 脱出への最後の望み\"},{\"title\":\"Miracle on Skypiea! The Love Song Heard in the Clouds!\",\"number\":192,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami`s quick thinking gets Luffy closer to god, and the Straw Hat captain launches himself into the center of a sinister storm! Can he find a way to destroy Eneru`s looming cloud of death?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神の国の奇跡! 天使に届いた島の歌声[ラブ・ソング]\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Ends! Proud Fantasia Echoes Far!\",\"number\":193,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the aftermath of Luffy`s epic battle with Eneru, sunny skies chase away the storms, and the cloud-dwelling citizens of Angel Island turn their attention to rebuilding their homeland.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦いの終焉! 遠く響く誇り高き幻想曲[ファンタジア]\"},{\"title\":\"I Made It Here! The Yarn the Poneglyphs Spin!\",\"number\":194,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin attempts to decipher the riddle of a mysterious poneglyph, Usopp barters with the locals, and Luffy raids the priceless treasures of the legendary city of gold!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"我ここに至る! 歴史の本文[ポーネグリフ]が紡ぐもの\"},{\"title\":\"Off to the Blue Sea! A Heartfelt Finale!\",\"number\":195,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With a little help from their new friends - and a giant octopus - the Straw Hats bid farewell to Skypiea and begin their decent back to the deep blue sea. Where they`ll land is anyone`s guess!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いざ青海へ!! 想いが織りなす最終楽章\"},{\"title\":\"A State of Emergency Is Issued! A Notorious Pirate Ship Has Infiltrated!\",\"number\":196,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After a frightening fall from the clouds, the Straw Hats find themselves trapped inside an impenetrable Marine stronghold. The crew gets separated, the Going Merry is impounded, and rumors of ghosts run rampant!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"非常事態発令! 悪名高き海賊船潜入!\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji the Cook! Proving His Merit at the Marine Dining Hall!\",\"number\":197,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Nami searches for the Going Merry, Luffy and Sanji pose as famous chefs, only to end up competing in a cooking contest with a beautiful mistress of the galley!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"料理人サンジ! 海軍食堂で真価発揮!\"},{\"title\":\"Captured Zoro! Chopper`s Emergency Operations!\",\"number\":198,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is imprisoned and interrogated, and Chopper`s ill-chosen hiding spot lands him in the operating room along with a doctor who can`t stand the sight of blood!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"囚われたゾロとチョッパー緊急執刀!\"},{\"title\":\"The Marine`s Dragnet Closes In! The Second Member Captured!\",\"number\":199,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s insatiable appetite betrays his true identity, and yet another member of his crew ends up in the brig when two Straw Hats try to fool Commander Jonathan with the same disguise!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迫る海軍の捜査網! 囚われた二人目!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy and Sanji`s Daring Rescue Mission!\",\"number\":200,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Commander Jonathan sets a Straw Hat trap, but Luffy and Sanji are willing to risk it all to help spring their mates. Will a souvenir from the sky save the day - or will their escape plan be scuttled by foul play?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決死のルフィとサンジ! 救出大作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Hot-Blooded Special Forces! Battle on the Bridge!\",\"number\":201,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his gang make a break for the docks, and Commander Jonathan deploys armed guards in an attempt to slow down the Straw Hats. Only one thing is certain: somebody is going down for the count!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱血特別部隊参戦! ブリッジ攻防戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Breaking Through the Siege! The Going Merry Is Recovered!\",\"number\":202,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats are surrounded, outnumbered, blasted with tear gas. Taking a pretty, young doctor hostage may be their only hope for surviving long enough for a Merry reunion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"包囲網突破! 奪還ゴーイングメリー号\"},{\"title\":\"The Pirate Ship Disappears! Fortress Battle, Round #2!\",\"number\":203,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew were almost in the clear when Nami made a horrifying discovery: the Marines stole their gold! Now, the Straw Hats must sail straight into the thick of the fight to reclaim their lost riches!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消えた海賊船! 要塞攻防第2ラウンド\"},{\"title\":\"The Gold and Waver Recovery Operations!\",\"number\":204,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp hatches a plan for a moonlit raid on the Marine vault, but Commander Jonathan is has a nasty surprise waiting for the pirates! Meanwhile, Sanji and Nami attempt to recover the waver.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄金奪還作戦とウエイバー回収作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"The One Fell Swoop Plan! Jonathan`s Surefire Secret Tactic!\",\"number\":205,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The extreme arrogance of a Marine special investigator clears a path for Luffy and company to make their escape! Unfortunately, the Straw Hats still have to find their gold before returning to the high seas!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一網打尽計画! ジョナサン自信の秘策\"},{\"title\":\"Farewell, Marine Fortress! The Last Battle for Escape!\",\"number\":206,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats may think they`re in the clear, but Commander Jonathan has one final trap waiting to ground the Going Merry! If Luffy`s crew is to escape, they`ll need a helping hand - or eight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さらば海軍要塞! 脱出への最後の攻防\"},{\"title\":\"Great Adventure at Long Ring Long Land!\",\"number\":207,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his mates survive and near-death encounter with some mischievous sea monkeys only to land on a mysterious island where everything is much longer than it should be!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロングリングロングランドの大冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"A Davy Back with the Foxy Pirates!\",\"number\":208,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After a loyal horse and his recently-returned master are assaulted by thugs, Luffy is drawn into a Davy Back Fight with the Foxy Pirates. The Straw Hat captain never backs down from a challenge, but this contest could cost him his crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フォクシー海賊団とデービーバック!\"},{\"title\":\"Round 1! One Lap of the Donut Race\",\"number\":209,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Davy Back Fight begins with a treacherous Donut Race around Ling Ring Long Land! The Straw Hats square off against the Foxy Pirates in a battle to see who loses a crew member!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第一回戦! ぐるり一周ドーナツレース\"},{\"title\":\"Silver Fox Foxy! The Merciless Interference!\",\"number\":210,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami uses her considerable skill as a navigator to put the Straw Hats on the verge of victory, but the captain of the Foxy Pirates has more than a few dirty tricks up his sleeve!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"銀ギツネのフォクシー! 猛烈妨害攻勢\"},{\"title\":\"Round 2! Shoot It into the Groggy Ring!\",\"number\":211,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thanks to some foxy sabotage, Chopper has been lost to the enemy. The only hope for getting him back lies with Zoro and Sanji, but can they learn to work together in time to save the little reindeer?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第2回戦! ブチ込めグロッキーリング\"},{\"title\":\"A Barrage of Red Cards in Groggy Ring!\",\"number\":212,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji and Zoro take a beating at the hands of the Groggy Monsters, but they won`t give up the fight. With a little luck – and some teamwork - they`ll emerge victorious from round two of the Davy Back Fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"レッドカード連発! グロッキーリング\"},{\"title\":\"Round 3! The Round-and-Round Roller Race!\",\"number\":213,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Round three of the Davy Back Fight is a rip roaring roller derby! Chopper`s fate still hangs in the balance, and the Straw Hats have a huge problem: Luffy doesn`t know how to skate!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第三回戦! ぐるぐるローラーレース!\"},{\"title\":\"A Seriously Heated Race! Into the Final Round!\",\"number\":214,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Davy Back Fight sprints toward a sensational finish, the Straw Hats find themselves on the brink of defeat! Luffy`s finally managed to stay on his skates, but the Foxy Pirates are notorious cheaters!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白熱爆走レース! 最終ラウンド突入!\"},{\"title\":\"Screaming-Hot Bombardment! Pirate Dodgeball!\",\"number\":215,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats somehow manage to defeat the Foxy Pirates and win back Chopper, but Luffy eagerly accepts the challenge of a rematch! What is the captain thinking? And will his crew mutiny?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うなる熱球剛球! 海賊ドッジボール!\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown on the Cliff! Red Light, Green Light!\",\"number\":216,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A devious game of dodge ball costs the Straw Hats their archaeologist. Now, they`ll have to win an unusual uphill race to reclaim Robin and avoid losing another crew member!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"断崖の決戦! だるまさんがころんだ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Captains Square Off! The Final Combat Round!\",\"number\":217,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin and Chopper have both been lost to the Foxy Pirates, and there`s only one match remaining in the Davy Back Fight! Luffy`s got a plan to get his mates back, but failure would mean the end of the Straw Hats forever!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"キャプテン対決! 最終戦コンバット!\"},{\"title\":\"Full-Blast Slow-Slow Onslaught vs. Invulnerable Luffy!\",\"number\":218,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Captain Foxy go toe-to-toe in a brutal battle waged aboard a booby trapped boat. Luffy is fighting for his crew, but Captain Foxy`s dirty tricks have him on the ropes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全開ノロノロ攻撃 VS 不死身のルフィ\"},{\"title\":\"Epic, Heated Combat! The Fateful Final Conclusion!\",\"number\":219,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s epic battle with Captain Foxy reaches its riveting end, and a very old man with a very tall horse reunites with a face from very long ago.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"壮絶熱闘コンバット! 運命の最終決着\"},{\"title\":\"Was It Lost? Stolen? Who Are You?\",\"number\":220,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Luffy and his mates lose their memory, Robin is the only Straw Hat who can remember their adventures together. Can she can she recover their recollections before the crew splits up?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失った? 奪われた? おまえはだれだ?\"},{\"title\":\"A Mysterious Boy with a Horn and Robin`s Deduction!\",\"number\":221,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin tries to hold the crew together while unraveling the mystery of the missing memories. Meanwhile, Nami and Zoro flashback to painful moments from their pasts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"笛を抱いた謎の少年とロビンの推理!\"},{\"title\":\"Now, Let`s Get Back Our Memories! The Pirate Crew Lands on the Island\",\"number\":222,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats finally discover the culprit behind their memory loss, but they`ve got bigger problems. The mysterious thief is determined to pit Zoro and Luffy against each other!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いざ記憶を奪還せよ! 海賊団島に上陸\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro Bares His Fangs! A Savage Animal Stands in the Way!\",\"number\":223,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Luffy fight to the death, Nami attempts to orchestrate an uprising, and Sanji discovers he`s willing to kick a kid in order to get his memories back!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"牙をむくゾロ! 立ちはだかった野獣!\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Counterattack by the Memory Thief Who Reveals His True Colors!\",\"number\":224,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats finally regain their memories, but a much larger challenge looms on the horizon. The mysterious thief is about to transform into something even more powerful!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"本性を現した記憶泥棒の 最後の逆襲!\"},{\"title\":\"Proud Man! Silver Fox Foxy!\",\"number\":225,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A terrible storm leads to another run in with the devious Captain Foxy! When Luffy makes the dangerous decision to help his old foe, it could spell disaster for the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"誇り高き男! 銀ギツネのフォクシー\"},{\"title\":\"The Guy Who`s the Closest to Invincible? And the Most Dangerous Man!\",\"number\":226,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his mates must survive another outrageous battle aboard the Captain Foxy`s booby-trapped boat, and even if they survive, something far worse is awaits them!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最も無敵に近い奴? と最も危険な男!\"},{\"title\":\"Navy Headquarters Admiral Aokiji! The Ferocity of an Ultimate Powerhouse!\",\"number\":227,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats take time out to help a group of hungry castaways, but trouble looms on the horizon. An icy marine adversary is out to track down Robin!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍本部大将青キジ! 最高戦力の脅威\"},{\"title\":\"Duel Between Rubber and Ice! Luffy vs. Aokiji!\",\"number\":228,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper and Usopp work feverishly to save Robin from her icy tomb, and Luffy looks to settle the score with Admiral Aokiji in a man-to-man fight to the finish!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゴムと氷の一騎打ち! ルフィvs青キジ\"},{\"title\":\"The Dashing Sea Train and the City of Water: Water Seven!\",\"number\":229,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An encounter with a giant swimming frog leads to a close call with a seafaring train! Next up for the Straw Hats: drop anchor at a town full of water and seek out a shipwright!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"疾走海列車と水の都ウォーターセブン\"},{\"title\":\"Adventure in the City on the Water! Head to the Mammoth Shipbuilding Plant!\",\"number\":230,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Usopp, and Nami take a wild ride through Water Seven in search of a shipwright. Meanwhile, Chopper and Robin get separate during their quest to find a bookstore!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"水上都市の冒険! 目指せ巨大造船工場\"},{\"title\":\"The Franky Family and Iceberg!\",\"number\":231,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is attacked by thugs who want to cash in on his bounty, Sanji gets lost on a grocery shopping expedition, and three suitcases full of cash mysteriously go missing!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フランキー一家とアイスバーグさん!\"},{\"title\":\"Galley-La Company! A Grand Sight: Dock #1!\",\"number\":232,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A carpenter and his talking pigeon help recover the Straw Hats` missing money, but the Franky Family won`t give up so easily. Luffy and Nami receive very bad news about their beloved boat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ガレーラカンパニー! 壮観一番ドッグ\"},{\"title\":\"Pirate Abduction Incident! A Pirate Ship That Can Only Await Her End!\",\"number\":233,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Nami refuse to believe that the Going Merry`s seaworthy days are finished, but for now, bigger problems loom on the horizon! Their money is missing again, along with Usopp!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊誘拐事件と死を待つだけの海賊船\"},{\"title\":\"Rescuing Our Friend! Raid on the Franky House!\",\"number\":234,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp bravely tries to recover the stolen money, but the Franky Family has him badly outnumbered. Zoro, Sanji, and Chopper set out on a rescue mission, but they`ll need Luffy to even the odds!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間救出! 殴りこみフランキーハウス\"},{\"title\":\"Big Fight Under the Moon! The Pirate Flag Flutters with Sorrow!\",\"number\":235,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp regains consciousness after his vicious beating, but he`s not at all happy to hear Luffy`s plans for the Going Merry. Temper flares and challenges are issued as the Straw Hats face their most uncertain hour.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月下の大喧嘩! 哀しみに翻る海賊旗!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy vs. Usopp! Collision of Two Men`s Pride!\",\"number\":236,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Usopp battle to a brutal standstill in a heartbreaking duel between men who once called each other family. Can the Straw Hats find the strength to carry on without their sniper?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィVSウソップ! ぶつかる男の意地\"},{\"title\":\"Severe Shock Hits the City of Water! Iceberg Targeted!\",\"number\":237,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hat split is overshadowed by an assassination attempt on the mayor of Water Seven! Luffy is eager to investigate, but the leader of the Franky Family is about to reappear!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激震水の都! 狙われたアイスバーグ\"},{\"title\":\"Gum-Gum Human vs. Fire-Breathing Cyborg!\",\"number\":238,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s grudge match with Franky gets serious when his opponent turns out to be a cyborg! Iceberg awakes from his slumber only to hurl heinous accusations at the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゴムゴム人間VS火を吹く改造人間 [サイボーグ]\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hat Pirates Are the Culprits? The Protectors of the City of Water!\",\"number\":239,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is branded an assassin and attacked by Iceberg`s strongest men! Meanwhile, Sanji and Chopper attempt to warn Usopp about an impending natural disaster!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"犯人は麦わら海賊団? 水の都の用心棒\"},{\"title\":\"Eternal Farewell? Nico Robin: The Woman Who Draws Darkness!\",\"number\":240,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The citizens of Water Seven search for the Straw Hats, and a devastating storm threatens to sink the city. Chopper and Sanji pick up Robin`s trail, but they aren`t prepared for what they`ll find.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"永遠の別れ? 闇を引く女ニコ・ロビン\"},{\"title\":\"Capture Robin! The Determination of the Straw Hats!\",\"number\":241,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp prepares to ride out the storm aboard the Going Merry, Franky hatches a plan to force Luffy into a rematch, and the Straw Hats set out to uncover Robin`s dark secret.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロビンを捕まえろ! 麦わら一味の決意\"},{\"title\":\"Cannon Fire Is the Signal! CP9 Goes Into Action!\",\"number\":242,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin and her CP9 brethren seek to settle unfinished business with Iceberg. The Straw Hats have a plan to clear their names, but the assassins are one step ahead of them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"合図は砲撃と共に! 動き出したCP9\"},{\"title\":\"CP9 Takes Off Their Masks! Their Shocking True Faces!\",\"number\":243,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes his long awaited entrance, Iceberg has a shocking surprise in store for Robin, and the true identities of the masked assassins of CP9 are finally revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仮面を取ったCP9! その驚きの素顔\"},{\"title\":\"Secret Bond! Iceberg and Franky!\",\"number\":244,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"CP9 listens to Iceberg`s blood to learn to the location of the blueprints, Usopp has another run in with Franky, and the remaining Straw Hats – plus a new friend – race to the rescue!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"秘めた絆! アイスバーグとフランキー\"},{\"title\":\"Come Back, Robin! Showdown with CP9!\",\"number\":245,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the gang come face to face with Robin and her CP9 comrades. The rubberman is prepared to fight for his friend, but he`s never faced foes like this!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"帰って来いロビン! CP9との対決!\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hat Pirates Annihilated? The Menace of the Leopard Model!\",\"number\":246,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Zoro, and Nami are sent hurtling toward their deaths by the villains of CP9! Meanwhile, Usopp forges an unlikely friendship with Franky while waiting out a storm.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麦わら海賊団全滅? モデル豹[レオパルド]の脅威!\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Who Is Loved Even by His Ship! Usopp`s Tears!\",\"number\":247,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky tries to convince Usopp that there`s no hope for the Going Merry, but the sniper - inspired by a mysterious moment from the past - remains loyal to his beloved boat\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"船からも愛された男! ウソップの涙!\"},{\"title\":\"Franky`s Past! The Day the Sea Train First Ran!\",\"number\":248,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A look back at Franky`s past reveals the amazing origins of the sea train – and paints a vivid picture of his younger days, spent alongside Iceberg and the legendary shipwright Tom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フランキーの過去! 海列車が走った日\"},{\"title\":\"Spandam`s Scheme! The Day the Sea Train Shook!\",\"number\":249,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky`s backstory continues! The sea train is a success, and it looks like Tom`s life is spared! Unfortunately, a government spy is searching for a reason to investigate Tom, and Franky provides the ammunition!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スパンダムの陰謀! 海列車が揺れた日\"},{\"title\":\"The End of the Legendary Man! The Day the Sea Train Cried!\",\"number\":250,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tom does the unthinkable in an attempt to protect his apprentices, but young Franky is unable to control his rage, leading to a showdown with a spy - and a train!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の男の最後! 海列車が泣いた日\"},{\"title\":\"The Truth Behind Her Betrayal! Robin`s Sorrowful Decision!\",\"number\":251,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper`s heroism may mean the difference between life and death for Iceberg and Paulie, Nami learns the agonizing truth about Robin, and Sanji prepares to make his move!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切りの真相! ロビンの哀しき決意!\"},{\"title\":\"The Steam Whistle Forces Friends Apart! The Sea Train Starts to Run!\",\"number\":252,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami makes a frantic dash for the Sea Train station, Chopper searches desperately for Zoro and Luffy, and Sanji plays it cool while waiting for the right time to spring into action.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間を引き離す汽笛! 走り出す海列車\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji Barges In! Sea Train Battle in the Storm!\",\"number\":253,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami arrives at the train station a minute too late, Sanji makes his presence aboard the sea train known, and the search for Luffy and Zoro continues!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジ突入! 嵐の中の海列車バトル!\"},{\"title\":\"Nami`s Soul Cries Out! Straw Hat Luffy Makes a Comeback!\",\"number\":254,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper and Nami risk their own lives in a desperate attempt to save Luffy and Zoro from a monstrous wall of water! Meanwhile, Sanji moves ever closer to a reunion with Robin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミ魂の叫び! 麦わらのルフィ復活!\"},{\"title\":\"Another Sea Train? Rocketman Charges Forth!\",\"number\":255,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Nami ask to borrow a ship so they can chase down the sea train, but the weather is too severe to set sail. Lucky for them, Iceberg and his friends are full of surprises!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"もう一つの海列車! ロケットマン出撃\"},{\"title\":\"Rescue Our Friends! A Bond Among Foes Sworn with Fists!\",\"number\":256,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Zoro, Chopper, and Nami rocket toward a rendezvous with the assassins of CP 9, but they`ll need to forge an alliance with some new friends to have any chance at survival!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間を救え! 拳に誓った敵同士の絆!\"},{\"title\":\"Smash the Wave! Luffy and Zoro Use the Strongest Combo!\",\"number\":257,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Luffy go head-to-head with Mother Nature, and Sanji`s rescue mission is bolstered by Franky`s allegiance – and the arrival of the mysterious Sniper King!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"波を砕け! ルフィとゾロの最強合体技[コンボ]\"},{\"title\":\"A Mysterious Man Appears?! His Name Is Sogeking!\",\"number\":258,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sniper King, a mysterious warrior from the island of snipers, lends a hand as Franky and Sanji try to fight their way to Robin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"謎の男登場!? その名はそげキング!\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown Between Cooks! Sanji vs. Ramen Kenpo\",\"number\":259,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji mixes it up with a deranged cook, Franky dukes it out with the newest member of CP9, and the Sniper King gets creative in his attempt to reach Robin!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"コック対決! サンジVSラーメン拳法\"},{\"title\":\"Rooftop Duel! Franky vs. Nero!\",\"number\":260,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky and Sanji continue to battle the thugs of CP9. Meanwhile, Luffy and the rest of the gang find themselves headed for a collision that could spell doom for everyone!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"屋根の上の決闘! フランキーVSネロ\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Demon-Slasher Zoro vs. Ship-Slasher T-Bone!\",\"number\":261,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro faces a fellow master of the blade, Sanji looks to end his fight with against a rampaging ramen master, and Franky finally lands a big blow against his CP9 foe!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 鬼斬りゾロVS船斬りTボーン\"},{\"title\":\"Scramble Over Robin! A Cunning Plan by Sogeking!\",\"number\":262,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Sniper King hatches a daring escape plan, but the assassins of CP9 are more powerful than our heroes ever imagined. Meanwhile, Luffy and the gang run into a very familiar frog!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロビン争奪戦! そげキングの奇策!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Judicial Island! Full View of Enies Lobby!\",\"number\":263,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As their train approaches Enies Lobby, Franky`s kind words cut through Robin`s cold exterior. Luffy`s train is thrown off course, but the group gains a powerful new ally!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"司法の島! エニエス・ロビーの全貌!\"},{\"title\":\"Landing Operations Start! Charge in, Straw Hats!\",\"number\":264,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats hatch a plan to rescue Robin, but as usual, Luffy can`t wait to find a fight. Will his impulsive attack derail their mission?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"上陸作戦始動! 麦わら一味突入せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Cuts Through! Big Showdown on the Judicial Island!\",\"number\":265,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy manages to reach the main island, but the Franky Family`s assault is stopped short by a couple of angry giants!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ快進撃! 司法の島で大決戦!!\"},{\"title\":\"Battle Against Giants! Open the Second Gate!\",\"number\":266,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes short work of a few hundred marines, the Franky Family takes down a giant, and the assassins of CP9 report back to Spandam!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨人族との攻防! 第二の扉を開けろ!\"},{\"title\":\"Find a Way Out! Rocketman Takes Flight!\",\"number\":267,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro`s quick thinking - and a little help from a giant frog - sends the sea train soaring into the sky on a collision course with armed guards and their canine companions!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"活路を開け! 空を飛ぶロケットマン!\"},{\"title\":\"Catch Up with Luffy! The Straw Hats` All-Out Battle\",\"number\":268,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami electrocutes the enemy with a Clima Tact attack, but the bad guys have the Straw Hats surrounded until the Franky Family shows up with a couple of sea monsters!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィに追いつけ! 麦わら一味総力戦\"},{\"title\":\"Robin Betrayed! The Motive of the World Government!\",\"number\":269,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro, Sanji, Nami, and Chopper try to catch up with their captain, Soge King is nowhere to be found, and Luffy runs head first into a battle with Blueno!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切られたロビン! 世界政府の思惑!\"},{\"title\":\"Give Robin Back! Luffy vs. Blueno!\",\"number\":270,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy shows off his new strength in a brawl with Blueno, Soge King befriends a giant, and a hulking sea beast makes the ultimate sacrifice.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロビンを返せ! ルフィVSブルーノ!\"},{\"title\":\"Don`t Stop! Hoist the Counterattack Signal!\",\"number\":271,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy continues his battle with Blueno, Soge King`s giant companions make their presence felt, and the assassins of CP9 experiment with Devil Fruits!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"立ち止まるな! 反撃の狼煙を上げろ!\"},{\"title\":\"Almost to Luffy! Gather at the Courthouse Plaza!\",\"number\":272,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A blind Kingbull fights with his last breath to get the Straw Hats one step closer to their captain. Luffy kick his body into second gear to protect his friends from dangerous foes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ目前! 裁判所前広場へ集結せよ\"},{\"title\":\"Everything Is to Protect My Friends! Second Gear Activated!\",\"number\":273,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy batters a baffled Blueno with his powerful new fighting style, and the cowardly Spandam begins to panic at the sound of the Straw Hats approaching!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全ては仲間を守る為に! ギア2発動\"},{\"title\":\"Give Us Your Answer, Robin! The Straw Hats` Outcry!\",\"number\":274,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew are finally reunited and ready to rescue Robin, but the raven-haired beauty remains reluctant to rejoin her former mates despite Franky`s urging.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"答えろロビン! 麦わら一味の叫び!!\"},{\"title\":\"Robin`s Past! The Girl Who Was Called a Devil!\",\"number\":275,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Flash back to Robin`s days as a young girl, her dangerous pursuit of forbidden knowledge, and her encounter with a friendly giant.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロビンの過去! 悪魔と呼ばれた少女!\"},{\"title\":\"Fated Mother and Daughter! The Mother`s Name Is Olvia!\",\"number\":276,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin`s flashback continues with the heartbreaking arrival of her mother - and the government`s cruel and brutal invasion of a peaceful island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"宿命の母娘! その母の名はオルビア!\"},{\"title\":\"The Tragedy of Ohara! The Terror of the Buster Call!\",\"number\":277,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Professor Clover reveals a startling and sinister theory about the World Government, Robin reunites with her mother, and a giant joins the fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オハラの悲劇! バスターコールの恐怖\"},{\"title\":\"Say You Want to Live! We Are Your Friends!\",\"number\":278,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The painful story of Ohara - and Robin`s younger years - draws to a tragic close. Luffy declares war on the World Government, and Robin finally changes her tune!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生きたいと言え! オレ達は仲間だ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Jump Towards the Falls! Luffy`s Feelings!\",\"number\":279,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-01\",\"duration\":20,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats are ready to begin the fight for Robin, but first, Luffy flashes back to memories of his childhood - and the man who made him want to become a pirate!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"滝に向かって飛べ! ルフィの想い!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ways of Men! Zoro`s Techniques, Usopp`s Dream\",\"number\":280,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-08\",\"duration\":20,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro remembers the first time he met Luffy, and Usopp recalls the events that led him to join the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の生き様! ゾロの業・ウソップの夢\"},{\"title\":\"A Bond of Friendship Woven by Tears! Nami`s World Map\",\"number\":281,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-15\",\"duration\":20,\"synopsis\":\"Nami`s heartbreaking past - and Luffy`s epic battle with Arlong - are recalled in this flashback to the early days of the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙が紡いだ仲間の絆! ナミの世界地図\"},{\"title\":\"Parting Builds a Man`s Character! Sanji and Chopper\",\"number\":282,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-22\",\"duration\":20,\"synopsis\":\"A flashback sheds light on how Sanji came to join the crew, and Chopper`s backstory is revealed through memories of a visit to a snow-covered island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"別れが男を磨く! サンジとチョッパー\"},{\"title\":\"Everything Is for Her Friends! Robin in the Darkness!\",\"number\":283,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-29\",\"duration\":20,\"synopsis\":\"A flashback reveals Robin`s motives for cooperating with CP9, Nami`s shocking discovery about the archaeologist`s past, and Luffy`s determination to save his friend!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"すべては仲間の為に! 闇の中のロビン!\"},{\"title\":\"I`m Not Gonna Hand Over the Blueprints! Franky`s Decision!\",\"number\":284,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky stands up to Spandam by destroying what the madman desires most, and the sound of the sea train spurs the Straw Hats to make a daring leap of faith!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"設計図は渡さない! フランキーの決断\"},{\"title\":\"Obtain the Five Keys! The Straw Hat Pirates vs. CP9!\",\"number\":285,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy races to rescue Robin while the rest of the Straw Hats set off in search of the five keys needed to unlock the archaeologist!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"5つの鍵を奪え! 麦わら一味対CP9\"},{\"title\":\"Devil Fruit Powers! Kaku and Jabra Transform\",\"number\":286,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Usopp and Zoro go head-to-head with a couple of animal assassins, Sanji teaches the most beautiful member of CP9 the secrets of making good tea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔の実の力! カクとジャブラ大変身\"},{\"title\":\"I Won`t Kick Even If It Costs Me My Life! Sanji`s Chivalry!\",\"number\":287,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy runs into trouble trying to sail his way to Robin, Usopp and Zoro end up handcuffed together, and Sanji`s inability to kick a women may lead to serious injury!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死んでも蹴らん! サンジ男の騎士道!\"},{\"title\":\"Fukurou`s Miscalculation! My Cola Is the Water of Life!\",\"number\":288,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chimney and Gombe show Luffy the secret passage that leads to Robin, and Franky puts on a display of raw punching power thanks to a few bottles of cola!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フクロウの誤算! 俺のコーラは命の水\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro Bursts Out a New Technique! The Sword`s Name Is Sniper King?\",\"number\":289,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Franky`s brawl spills into the ocean, Sogeking and Zoro attempt to overcome their handcuffs by outsmarting their opponents!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゾロ新技炸裂! 刀の名はそげキング?\"},{\"title\":\"Uncontrollable! Chopper`s Forbidden Rumble\",\"number\":290,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Determined not to be defeated by the heinous hair of a devious lion, Chopper risks life and limb by summoning the power of his Rumble Ball for a third time!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"制御不能! チョッパー禁断のランブル\"},{\"title\":\"Boss Luffy Returns! Is It a Dream or Reality? Lottery Ruckus\",\"number\":291,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Travel back to ancient Japan for a madcap adventure starring the Straw Hats, some old friends and enemies, and a camel that eats lottery tickets!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ親分再び! 夢か現[うつつ]か富くじ騒動\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Rice Cake Tossing Race at the Castle! Red Nose`s Plot\",\"number\":292,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The madcap throwback continues as Luffy and the gang - along with a crowd of characters from the Alabasta arc - competes for a priceless treasure hidden inside a tasty snack!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お城で餅まき大レース! 赤い鼻の陰謀\"},{\"title\":\"Bubble Master Kalifa! The Soap Trap Closes In on Nami\",\"number\":293,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami battles a bathing beauty and her lethal bubbles, Chopper unleashes his inner beast, and Luffy inches ever closer to catching up with Robin!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"泡使いカリファ! ナミに迫る石鹸の罠\"},{\"title\":\"Resounding Bad News! Buster Call Invoked!\",\"number\":294,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky has a painful encounter with monster Chopper, and Nami gets scrubbed too clean to fight! Meanwhile, Spandam accidentally invokes the deadly Buster Call!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"響き渡る凶報! 発動バスターコール\"},{\"title\":\"Five Namis? Nami Strikes Back with Mirages!\",\"number\":295,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro uses Usopp as a decoy in his battle with the beasts, and Nami discovers the secret that could be the key to survival in her brawl with the bathing beauty!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"5人のナミ? 反撃は蜃気楼とともに!\"},{\"title\":\"Nami`s Decision! Fire at the Out-of-Control Chopper!\",\"number\":296,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky and Nami come up with a plan to stop Chopper`s rampage, but it could prove deadly to the not-so-little reindeer. Usopp and Zoro are thrilled to finally be free of each other!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミの決断! 暴走チョッパーを撃て!\"},{\"title\":\"Hunter Sanji Makes an Entrance? Elegy for a Lying Wolf\",\"number\":297,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp`s ill-advised attempt at bravery threatens to get him killed, but a familiar foot spares the sniper`s life. Luffy struggles to even strike a formidable foe, and Franky races to deliver some very important keys!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狩人サンジ登場? 嘘つき狼に贈る挽歌\"},{\"title\":\"Fiery Kicks! Sanji`s Full Course of Foot Techniques\",\"number\":298,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji evens the playing field in his CP9 slugfest by introducing his wolfish opponent to the burning power of the devil`s leg!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"灼熱の蹴り! サンジ足技のフルコース\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Sword Attacks! Zoro vs. Kaku, Powerful Sword Fighting Showdown\",\"number\":299,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro finally lands a blow against the killer giraffe, but Luffy still can`t find a way to break through against Lucci! Can Frank reach Robin before it`s too late!?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白刃[はくじん]の猛襲! ゾロ対カク強力斬撃対決\"},{\"title\":\"Demon God Zoro! An Incarnation of Asura Born from Fighting Spirit\",\"number\":300,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro unleashes a demonic nine sword fighting style on his giraffe opponent, Luffy buys time for Franky by ascending to second gear, and Robin refuses to give up hope of being rescued!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鬼神ゾロ! 気迫が見せた阿修羅の化身\"},{\"title\":\"Spandam Frightened! The Hero on the Tower of Law\",\"number\":301,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spandam cruely drags Robin ever closer to the gates of justice, but the battle takes a turn for the better when the Sniper King makes a surprise appearance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スパンダム驚愕! 司法の塔に立つ英雄\"},{\"title\":\"Robin Freed! Luffy vs. Lucci, Showdown Between Leaders\",\"number\":302,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s battle with Lucci reveals the powerful secrets of the rubber man`s second gear, and the Spandam`s thoughtless Buster Call begins with a brutal barrage of cannon balls.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロビン解放! ルフィ対ルッチ頂上決戦\"},{\"title\":\"Boss Luffy Is the Culprit? Track Down the Missing Great Cherry Tree\",\"number\":303,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When an ancient tree is stolen by a madman with the power to freeze time, Luffy, Usopp, and Sanji track down the culprit in an attempt to save a village`s annual festival!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"犯人はルフィ親分? 消えた大桜を追え\"},{\"title\":\"I Can`t Protect Anyone Unless I Win! Third Gear Activated!\",\"number\":304,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami, Sanji, Usopp, Zoro, and company find themselves trapped in to tunnel filled with rapidly rising water. Meanwhile, Luffy musters the strength for one last stand in his battle with Lucci.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝てなきゃ誰も守れない! ギア3始動\"},{\"title\":\"Shivering Past! Dark Justice and Rob Lucci\",\"number\":305,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synop