Vanishing Straw Hat Crew! A Mysterious Swordsman Appears!\",\"number\":346,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An undead warthog sets her sights on Nami, Zorro and Sanji vanish without a trace, Franky and Robin battle an unbeatable army, and Luffy gets captured!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消える麦わら一味! 現れた謎の剣士!\"},{\"title\":\"Chivalry Remains! The Traitorous Zombie Protects Nami!\",\"number\":347,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A penguin zombie starts acting an awful lot like Sanji, Nami continues running for her life, and Robin and Franky buy some time by blowing up a bridge!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"残る騎士道! ナミを守る裏切りゾンビ\"},{\"title\":\"Appearing from the Sky! That Man Is the Humming Swordsman!\",\"number\":348,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami gives love advice to a zombie, Luffy finds himself face-to-face with Gecko Moria, and Robin gets caught in spooky spider web. Things look bleak for the Straw Hats until their skeleton friend lends a hand!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空から参上! 剣狭ハナウタはあの男!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Emergency Situation! The Ultimate Shadow`s Destination!\",\"number\":349,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook strikes the final blow in his battle with the spider monkey, Gecko Moria`s devious plan is revealed, and Luffy`s escape attempt leads to the loss of something he can`t live without!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ緊急事態! 最強の影の行き先!\"},{\"title\":\"The Warrior Known As the `Devil`!! The Moment of Oars` Revival!\",\"number\":350,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook tells Franky and Robin the secret to slaying zombies, and Gecko Moria reveals the terrifying monster that will be the recipient of Luffy`s shadow!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔人と呼ばれた戦士!! オーズ復活の時\"},{\"title\":\"Awakening After 500 Years!! Oars Opens His Eyes!!\",\"number\":351,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s shadow is forced into the body of a monster, Usopp and Chopper get incinerated, and Nami is kidnapped by a zombie who wants to make her his wife!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"500年ぶりの目覚め!! オーズ開眼!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Belief Worth Begging to Live For!! Brook Defends His Afro!\",\"number\":352,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gecko Moria`s minions struggle with the burden of feeding a giant zombie brought to life by Luffy`s shadow. Meanwhile, Brook flashes back to a battle that almost cost him his beloved afro!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"信念の命乞い!! アフロを守るブルック\"},{\"title\":\"A Man`s Promise Never Dies!! To the Friend Waiting Under the Distant Sky!\",\"number\":353,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The freshly-revived trio of Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji discover that their shadows are missing, and Franky relates Brook`s story about a promise he made to a very special whale!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の誓いは死なず!! 遠い空で待つ友へ\"},{\"title\":\"I Swear to Go See Him!! Brook and the Cape of Promise!\",\"number\":354,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the Straw Hats flash back to the heartbreaking story of Laboon the abandoned whale, and Brook`s battle with the zombie samurai reveals the reason behind his intense afro love!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必ず会いに行く!! ブルックと約束の岬\"},{\"title\":\"Food, Nami, and Shadows!! Luffy`s Enraged Counterattack!\",\"number\":355,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy sets out to regain his shadow and convince Brook to join the crew. Meanwhile, Sanji races to stop Nami`s zombie wedding before it`s too late!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"メシとナミと影!! ルフィ怒りの大反撃\"},{\"title\":\"Usopp`s the Strongest? Leave Anything Negative to Him!\",\"number\":356,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp`s naturally negative personality makes him the only Straw Hat who stands a chance against Perona`s depressing army of ghosts, and Chopper prepares to do battle against his hero, Dr. Hogback!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウソップ最強? ネガティブは任せとけ\"},{\"title\":\"The General Zombies Are Down in a Flash!! Oars Feels Like an Adventure!!\",\"number\":357,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Brook is overmatched by the zombie samurai, Zoro steps in to help the skeleton get his shadow back. Meanwhile, Luffy prepares for a battle with Gecko Moria, and Sanji interrupts an undead wedding!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"将軍[ジェネラル]ゾンビ瞬殺!! オーズは冒険気分!!\"},{\"title\":\"Blazing Knight Sanji!! Kick Down the Fake Wedding!\",\"number\":358,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite his furious attempts, Luffy struggles to land a blow against Gecko Moria, but Sanji fares much better in his passionate attempt to defeat Nami`s beastly abductor!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炎の騎士[ナイト]サンジ!! 蹴り潰せ偽りの挙式\"},{\"title\":\"A Clear-Clear History? Sanji`s Stolen Dream\",\"number\":359,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji takes a beating when his opponent suddenly turns invisible, Luffy finally manages to land a blow in his battle with Gecko Moria, and Usopp uses fire to ward off a zombie bear!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スケスケの因縁? 奪われたサンジの夢\"},{\"title\":\"Save Me, Hero!! My Enemy Is the Immortal Princess!\",\"number\":360,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After getting the stuffing beat out of him by a zombie teddy bear, Usopp summons his sharp-shooting alter ego to help him discover the secret to defeating Perona!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"助けて英雄[ヒーロー]!? 敵は不死身のプリンセス\"},{\"title\":\"Perona Is Terrified!! Usopp and Untruthful Share the Same `U`!\",\"number\":361,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp reaches deep into his devious bag of tricks to even the odds in his battle with Perona. Meanwhile, Luffy can`t lay a finger on Gecko Moria, and a zombie is less than gentlemanly in his battle with Robin!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペローナ恐怖!? 嘘のウはウソップのウ\"},{\"title\":\"Slashes Dancing on the Rooftop!! Showdown: Zoro vs. Ryuma!\",\"number\":362,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Franky and Brook watch in awe, Zorro and the zombie samurai wage a sword-slinging battle the likes of which the world has never seen before!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"屋根に舞う斬撃!! 決着ゾロVSリューマ\"},{\"title\":\"Chopper Is Furious!! Hogback`s Evil Medical Practices!\",\"number\":363,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper can no longer contain his fury over Dr. Hogback`s evil treatment of his zombie slaves. Meanwhile, Luffy prepares to face the zombie who`s wearing his shadow!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"チョッパー激怒!! ホグバック魔の医術\"},{\"title\":\"Oars Roars! Come Out, Straw Hat Crew!\",\"number\":364,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Moria`s mansion is reduced to ruins as the zombie with Luffy`s shadow stalks the Straw Hats! As the walls come tumbling down, Chopper puts the hurt on Hogback, and Nami vanishes right before Sanji`s eyes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オーズ吼える!! 出て来い麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Is the Enemy! The Ultimate Zombie vs. the Straw Hat Crew!\",\"number\":365,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One by one, the Straw Hats attack Oars, but the monstrous zombie appears too powerful to be defeated. Luffy`s got his sights set on Moria, but he`d better hurry if he wants to save his crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵はルフィ!! 最強ゾンビ対麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"You`re Going Down, Absalom!! Nami`s Lightning Attack of Friendship!!\",\"number\":366,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami wakes up just in time to find out she’s about to marry a zombie, but the special occasion is interrupted by a very jealous warthog!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"倒れろアブサロム!! ナミ友情の雷撃!!\"},{\"title\":\"Knock Him Down!! Special Attack: Straw Hat Docking?\",\"number\":367,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami attempts to track down some missing treasure, Brook searches the kitchen for a mystery ingredient, and a heroic team effort topples Oars!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奪えダウン!! 必殺麦わらドッキング?\"},{\"title\":\"The Silent Assault!! The Mysterious Visitor, `Tyrant` Kuma!\",\"number\":368,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami has a horrifying run in with Bartholomew Kuma, Perona becomes the latest lady to vanish, and Chopper, Franky, and Usopp team up to strike a blow against Oars!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"足音なき襲来!! 謎の訪問者 暴君くま\"},{\"title\":\"Oars + Moria! The Most Heinous Combination of Brains and Brawn!\",\"number\":369,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kuma has an upsetting message for Moria, Luffy loses track of his intended target, and Zoro attempts to harness the power of a new sword during his battle with Oars!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オーズ+モリア 力と頭脳の最凶合体\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret Plan to Turn the Tables! Nightmare Luffy Makes His Appearance!\",\"number\":370,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook arrives with the salt needed to stop Oars, but the monster shows off some special new abilities. Deep in the 