titleJapanese\":\"麦わら一味憎し 鉄仮面のデュバル登場\"},{\"title\":\"The Fated Reunion! Save the Imprisoned Fishman!\",\"number\":387,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Arriving at Duval’s base, it is obvious a trap, but when Camie’s friend is recognized as Hatchan, a former Arlong Pirate.  Luffy refuses to help so Camie and Pappgu attempt the rescue by themselves.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"因縁の再会! 囚われの魚人を救い出せ\"},{\"title\":\"Tragedy! The Truth Hidden Behind Duval`s Mask!\",\"number\":388,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The flying fish riders attack on the Straw Hats take place in the air and sea. Luffy is memorized by the flying fish as Zoro attempts to free Hatchan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲劇! 仮面に隠されたデュバルの真実\"},{\"title\":\"Unleash the Sunny`s Super Secret Weapon, the Gaon Cannon!\",\"number\":389,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The secret of Duval is revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炸裂! サニー号の超秘密兵器ガオン砲\"},{\"title\":\"Landing on the Way to Fishman Island! The Sabaody Archipelago!\",\"number\":390,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Enjoying takoyaki from a grateful Hatchan, he explains to the crew how to get to Fish-man Island.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魚人島を目指して上陸 シャボンディ諸島\"},{\"title\":\"Tyranny! The Rulers of Sabaody, the Celestial Dragons\",\"number\":391,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew stop at an island overflowing with bubbles to get their ship modified for underwater travel. But it`s not long before they stumble upon an outrageous explosion and attract unwanted attention.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暴虐! シャボンディの支配者天竜人\"},{\"title\":\"New Rivals Gather! The 11 Supernovas\",\"number\":392,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shakky explains why Sabaody Archipelago seems to be crawling with bounty hunters – eleven of the Grand Line`s most wanted pirates are currently ashore and two of them are in Luffy`s crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たなライバル集結! 11人の超新星\"},{\"title\":\"The Target Is Camie! The Looming Clutches of a Professional Kidnapper\",\"number\":393,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious stranger keeps Zoro from tangling with a powerful Celestial Dragon, and Chopper goes bonkers when Camie disappears from the amusement park.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"標的はケイミー!! 迫る人攫い屋の魔手\"},{\"title\":\"Rescue Caimie: The Archipelago`s Lingering Dark History\",\"number\":394,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Camie was abducted by a dastardly gang of kidnappers, and her next stop is the auction house unless the Straw Hats can rescue her. To make it in time, they’ll have to hitch a ride on some flying fish!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ケイミーを救え 諸島に残る暗黒の歴史\"},{\"title\":\"Time Limit: The Human Auction Begins\",\"number\":395,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With a little help from their fishy mates, the Straw Hats make it to the auction house in time to save Camie, but explosive elements prevent them from taking her back by force. Luckily, Nami’s concocted a very generous plan!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"タイムリミット 人間[ヒューマン]オークション開幕\"},{\"title\":\"The Fist Explodes! Destroy the Auction\",\"number\":396,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami’s plan to save Camie goes belly up when a snot-nosed celestial dragon outbids the Straw Hats. Luffy and Zoro make an explosive arrival at the auction house and promptly open up a deadly can of worms.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鉄拳炸裂! オークションをぶっつぶせ\"},{\"title\":\"Major Panic! Desperate Struggle at the Auction House\",\"number\":397,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy turns a mermaid auction into a pirate-style brawl when he knocks the snot out of a celestial dragon. With a fleet of marines out to get them, the Straw Hats will have to fight their way off the island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大パニック! オークション会場の死闘\"},{\"title\":\"Admiral Kizaru Takes Action! Sabaody Archipelago Thrown into Chaos\",\"number\":398,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"They saved Cami from the auction block, but now the Straw Hats are surrounded by a fleet of marines. Lucky for Luffy, Eustass Captain Kid and Trafalgar Law are ready to join the fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大将黄猿動く! 騒然シャボンディ諸島\"},{\"title\":\"Break Through the Siege! The Navy vs. the Three Captains\",\"number\":399,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats join forces with Kid’s crew and Trafalgar’s mates to make short work of the marines, but they’re in for a surprise when they encounter a Warlord of the Sea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"包囲網を突破せよ! 海軍VS三人の船長\"},{\"title\":\"Roger and Rayleigh: The King of the Pirates and His Right Hand Man\",\"number\":400,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew duck the marines by hiding out at Rayleigh’s house. While Chopper tends to Hachi, Rayleigh entertains the Straw Hats with tales of his days as first mate on Gold Roger’s ship.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロジャーとレイリー 海賊王とその右腕\"},{\"title\":\"No Escape!? Admiral Kizaru`s Light Speed Kick!!\",\"number\":401,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Admiral Kizaru has arrived to lead the marines on a mission to wipe out all pirates. Meanwhile, Luffy and his crew prepare for a deadly battle with one of the Warlords of the Sea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"回避不可能!? 大将黄猿の光速の蹴り!!\"},{\"title\":\"Overwhelming! The Navy`s Fighting Weapons, the Pacifistas\",\"number\":402,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A groovy pirate belts out a tune that leaves Kizaru in pieces, but the admiral pulls himself together in time for a crushing Light Speed Kick. Luffy and Sanji try to protect the injured Zoro from a warlord lookalike.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"圧倒的! 海軍の戦闘兵器パシフィスタ\"},{\"title\":\"An Even Stronger Enemy Appears! The Battle Axe-Carrying Sentomaru\",\"number\":403,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the Straw Hats narrowly defeat a robot that resembles one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea. But before the dust settles on the field of battle, a far more deadly foe comes looking for a fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さらなる強敵現る! 鉞かついだ戦桃丸\"},{\"title\":\"Admiral Kizaru`s Fierce Assault: The Straw Hats Face Certain Death!\",\"number\":404,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro’s barely breathing, and Admiral Kizaru is ready to stomp him into oblivion. The battered and beaten Straw Hats could certainly use a powerful friend right about now.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大将黄猿の猛攻 麦わら一味絶体絶命!\"},{\"title\":\"Eliminated Friends: The Final Day of the Straw Hat Crew\",\"number\":405,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One by one, the mighty paw-print of Bartholomew Kuma makes the Straw Hats disappear until only Luffy remains. To where did his mates vanish? And will he ever see them again?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消された仲間たち 麦わら一味最後の日\"},{\"title\":\"Feudal Era Side Story: Boss Luffy Appears Again\",\"number\":406,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yesterday, the Straw Hats valiantly battled a warlord of the sea. Today, Boss Luffy and his friends at the Pinwheel Diner prepare to compete in the Great Portable Shrine Race!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"時代劇特別編 ルフィ親分ふたたび見参\"},{\"title\":\"Feudal Era Side Story: Defeat Thriller Company`s Trap\",\"number\":407,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thriller Company sabotages the race for a sacred treasure, and the displaced Straw Hats must pull an all-nighter to rebuild their shrine and score some ancient gold!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"時代劇特別編 破れ! スリラー商会の罠\"},{\"title\":\"Landing! The All-Female Island, Amazon Lily\",\"number\":408,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy finds himself stranded and starving on a strange island. The rubber-man’s amazing appetite puts his manhood in danger when he devours an array of exotic mushrooms!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"上陸! 男子禁制の島アマゾン・リリー\"},{\"title\":\"Hurry Back to Your Friends! The Maiden Island Adventure\",\"number\":409,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An army of scantily-clad Amazonian warriors want to investigate Luffy’s family jewels, but the captain of the Straw Hats is more interested in reuniting with his lost mates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"急げ! 仲間たちのもとへ 女ヶ島の冒険\"},{\"title\":\"Everyone Falls in Love! Pirate Empress Hancock\",\"number\":410,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Amazonians chasing Luffy are loyal subjects of Boa Hancock, the curvaceous Warlord of the Sea. This stone-cold beauty is deadly, and she’s about to pick a fight with an entire fleet of marines!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"みんなメロメロ! 海賊女帝ハンコック\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret Hidden on the Backs: Luffy and the Snake Princess Meet\",\"number\":411,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy’s search for a seaworthy vessel leads to a “drop-in” on the Snake Princess during the royal bathing hour. The view is world-class, but it might turn the rubber-man to stone!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"背中に隠された秘密 遭遇ルフィと蛇姫\"},{\"title\":\"Heartless Judgment! Margaret Is Turned to Stone!!\",\"number\":412,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Boa Hancock makes Luffy fighting mad when she turns Margaret into a statue. The Snake Princess may have bitten off more than she can chew by challenging captain Straw Hat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"非情の裁き! 石にされたマーガレット!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Difficult Fight for Luffy! The Snake Sisters` Haki Power!!\",\"number\":413,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Snake Princess pits Luffy’s Gum Gum abilities against the incredible Haki Power of her serpentine sisters in a fight to the death. Will Luffy survive long enough to save his statuesque friends?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ大苦戦! ヘビ姉妹の覇気の力!!\"},{\"title\":\"All-Out Special Power Battle!! Gum-Gum vs. Snake-Snake\",\"number\":414,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy kicks his attack mode into second gear to save a precious statue, and the snake sisters start to feel the Straw Hat heat. At the battle’s climax, Luffy makes an impression on his opponents.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"能力全開バトル!! ゴムゴムVSヘビヘビ\"},{\"title\":\"Hancock`s Confession: The Sisters` Abhorrent Past\",\"number\":415,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"News of Luffy’s run-in with the Celestial Dragons impresses the Snake Princess, so she tells him the story of her tortured past. Will his honorable nature speed Luffy toward a reunion with his crew?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ハンコックの告白 姉妹の忌まわしき過去\"},{\"title\":\"Saving Ace! The Next Stop: The Great Prison!\",\"number\":416,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is mobbed by a hoard of pretty amazons eager to touch a real live man. Granny Nyon offers him safe haven, but what she has to say might sink his plans for a Straw Hat reunion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エースを救え! 新たな目的地は大監獄\"},{\"title\":\"Love Is a Hurricane! Love-Love Hancock!\",\"number\":417,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Boa Hancock`s illness threatens to sabotage Luffy`s rescue mission; however, the Snake Princess just can`t say \\\"no\\\" to the rubberman, so a plan to save Ace is quickly hatched.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恋はハリケーン! メロメロハンコック\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts: The Science of Weather and the Mechanical Island\",\"number\":418,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy races to save Ace, Nami tries to survive life on Sky Island, and Franky dances up a snowstorm before making the switch from cola to tea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 天候の科学とからくり島\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts: An Island of Giant Birds and a Pink Paradise!\",\"number\":419,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper narrowly avoids being served for dinner in a land inhabited by giant birds, and Sanji`s refined tastes land him a role as a leading lady on the island of \\\"girlish hearts\\\".\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 巨鳥の島と桃色の楽園!\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts: Bridging the Islands and Vicious Vegetations!\",\"number\":420,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nico Robin finds herself trapped on the island of Tequila Wolf: a miserable land where children are forced to work as slaves. Elsewhere, Usopp tries to survive a run-in with a man-eating plant!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 島をつなぐ橋と食人植物\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts: A Negative Princess and the King of Demons\",\"number\":421,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is held against his will by the pink-haired princess of bad vibes, Brook gets mistaken for the king of darkness, and Luffy continues to eat his way toward a reunion with Fire-Fist Ace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 ネガティブ王女[プリンセス]と悪魔王\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Infiltration! The Underwater Prison Impel Down\",\"number\":422,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Boa arrive at Impel Down, but only thirty-three hours remain until Ace`s execution. To save him, the Snake Princess must find a way to hide Luffy during her full-body search!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決死の潜入! 海底監獄インペルダウン潜入!\"},{\"title\":\"A Reunion in Hell?! The Man Who Ate the Chop-Chop Fruit!\",\"number\":423,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Time is running out on Ace, so Luffy teams up with a scoundrel who`s going to pieces trying to escape Impel Down. There`s no love lost between Buggy the Clown and the Straw Hat captain, but they`d better work together if they want to survive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地獄で再会!? バラバラの実の実力者!\"},{\"title\":\"Break Through the Crimson Hell! Buggy`s Chaos-Inducing Plan\",\"number\":424,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy must part ways with a priceless treasure map before Buggy the Clown agrees to lead him through the bloody tangle of Blade Trees and Spike Needle Grass that make up Impel Down`s Crimson Hell!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"破れ! 紅蓮地獄 バギーのド派手大作戦\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Man in the Prison! Poison Man Magellan Appears!\",\"number\":425,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Buggy the Clown could end up as hippo food if they aren`t careful in Impel Down`s Wild Beast Hell. Of course, the rubberman might find that a better fate than dealing with the prison`s putrid warden!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"監獄最強の男! 毒人間・マゼラン登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Presentation Related to the Movie! A Gold Lion`s Ambition on the Move!\",\"number\":426,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew stumble upon a most peculiar village when they hitch a ride on a fire-breathing beetle. The natives are petrified of pirates, but they welcome the Straw Hats with open arms!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動特別編[スペシャル] 動き出す金獅子の野望\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Presentation Related to the Movie! Little East Blue in Danger!\",\"number\":427,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The citizens of Little East Blue throw a feast in honor of the Straw Hats, but when the Amigo Pirates try to capture Boss the beetle, Luffy and his crew will have to defend their new friends.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動特別編[スペシャル] 狙われた小さな東の海[リトル・イーストブルー]\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Presentation Related to the Movie! The Fierce Onslaught of the Amigo Pirates!\",\"number\":428,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji prepare to do battle on behalf of Boss the beetle, but Captain Largo of the Amigo Pirates counters with a deadly arsenal of nets to put the Straw Hat brawlers on lock down!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動特別編[スペシャル] アミーゴ海賊団の猛攻\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Presentation Related to the Movie! Luffy vs. Largo: The Battle Is On!\",\"number\":429,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy kicks into second gear for his rematch with Largo, and Nami leads the islanders as they lay waste to the Amigo Pirates. Boss the Beetle may be safe for now, but someone sinister lurks behind the scenes.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動特別編[スペシャル] 決戦! ルフィVS[たい]ラルゴ\"},{\"title\":\"A Warlord in Prison! Jimbei, the Honorable Pirate!\",\"number\":430,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy struggles to stay a step ahead of a prison patrol made up of hungry lions and poisonous scorpions! Meanwhile, Ace spends what could be his final hours swapping stories with a pirate who hates pirates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"囚われの王下七武海! 海侠のジンベエ\"},{\"title\":\"Chief Guard Saldeath`s Trap! Level 3: Starvation Hell!\",\"number\":431,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the guards struggle to squelch a violent prison uprising, Luffy and his fellow fugitives try to keep their cool in a level of Impel Down known as Starvation Hell!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"牢番長サルデスの罠 LV3・飢餓地獄\"},{\"title\":\"The Unleashed Swan! A Reunion with Bon Clay!\",\"number\":432,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Boa Hancock uses her ample assets to buy some private time for a clandestine chat with Ace. Meanwhile, Luffy needs help from a graceful friend to escape the jaws of a hungry Sphinx!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"解き放たれた白鳥[スワン]! 再会! ボン・クレー\"},{\"title\":\"Warden Magellan`s Strategy! Straw Hat Entrapment Completed\",\"number\":433,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Bon are on the verge of reaching Level 4, but they didn`t count on fighting a demonic, lightning-fast, devastatingly powerful Minotaur! To defeat this beast, they`ll need help from a human candle and a deranged clown!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"署長マゼラン動く 完成! 麦わら包囲網\"},{\"title\":\"All Forces Have Gathered! The Battle on Level 4, the Burning Heat Hell!\",\"number\":434,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy narrowly avoids a deadly dip in a boiling pool of blood, only to find himself face to face with Warden Magellan. Meanwhile, outside the prison walls, the marine fleet prepares for Whitebeard`s onslaught!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全戦力集結! LV4·焦熱地獄の決戦\"},{\"title\":\"Mighty Magellan! Bon Clay Bugs Out\",\"number\":435,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Warden Magellan is a monster of a man with a penchant for poisoning prisoners. To rescue Ace, Luffy must go toe to toe with this toxic terror, but how do you defeat a foe who`s deadly to the touch?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マゼラン強し! ボン・クレー敵前逃亡\"},{\"title\":\"The Showdown Has Come! Luffy`s Desperate Last Attack!\",\"number\":436,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s daring assault on the venomous warden of Impel Down leaves him struggling to stand up, but despite the lethal poison breaking down his body, the rubber-man kicks his rescue mission into second gear!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雌雄決す! 捨て身のルフィ最後の一撃\"},{\"title\":\"For His Friend! Bon Clay Goes to the Deadly Rescue!\",\"number\":437,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is at the end of the line - the only thing that can save him now is true friendship. But in a place like Impel Down can true friendship be found?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友達[ダチ]だから ボン・クレー決死の救出行\"},{\"title\":\"A Paradise in Hell! Impel Down Level 5.5!\",\"number\":438,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"No existing antidote can save Luffy from the poison coursing through his veins, yet Bon Clay refuses to give up. His final, fleeting hope is a mysterious miracle-worker rumored to have vanished into the Gates of Hell!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地獄に楽園 インペルダウンLV5.5\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Treatment Begins! Ivan-san`s Miraculous Power!\",\"number\":439,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bon is overjoyed to hear that Luffy is still alive, but his happiness quickly turns to shock when he learns that Ivan`s agonizingly painful \\\"Healing Hormones\\\" will cost the rubber-man ten years of his life!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ治療開始 イワさん奇跡の能力[ちから]!!\"},{\"title\":\"Believe in Miracles! Bon Clay`s Cries from the Heart\",\"number\":440,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ace is scheduled to be executed in a matter of hours, and Luffy`s still hovering on the verge of death. It will take a miracle to save them both, but Bon would rather die than give up on his friend!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡を信じて! ボン・クレー魂の声援\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Back! Ivan-san Begins the Breakout Plan!!\",\"number\":441,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy miraculously survived his brush with death, but he`s far too weak to finish rescuing Ace. Ivan is reluctant to lend a hormonal hand to the doomed rescue mission - until he learns of Luffy`s lineage!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ復活! イワさん脱獄計画始動!!\"},{\"title\":\"Ace`s Convoy Begins! Battle on the Lowest Floor, Level 6!\",\"number\":442,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The quest to rescue Ace tuckers out thanks to a blast of sleeping gas! Ivan`s scissor-handed sidekick puts an end to nap time, but Luffy will have to join forces with a scar-faced foe from the past if he wants to complete his mission!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エース護送開始 最下層LV6の攻防!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ultimate Team Has Formed! Shaking Impel Down!\",\"number\":443,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s desperate attempt to rescue Ace is bolstered by two powerful new allies: the murderous Crocodile and the honorable fishman Jinbei. Meanwhile, Ivan sparks a prison riot to create a diversion for the rubber-man.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強チーム結成 震撼! インペルダウン\"},{\"title\":\"Even More Chaos! Here Comes Blackbeard Teech!\",\"number\":444,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his gang of outlaws cause a commotion on Level Four, Blackbeard`s arrival leads to the release of the prison`s most feared inmate, and Ace gazes upon the great blue sky for what could be the very last time!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さらなる混乱! 黒ひげ・ティーチ襲来!\"},{\"title\":\"The Dangerous Encounter! Blackbeard and Shiryu of the Rain!\",\"number\":445,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ivan undergoes a curvaceous transformation to better battle sadistic Sadie, the commander of the Demon Guards. Meanwhile, Blackbeard and Shiryu head for a showdown on Level 1!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危険な出会い! 黒ひげと雨のシリュウ\"},{\"title\":\"No Price Too High! Serious Hannyabal!\",\"number\":446,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s bone-crushing battle with the Vice Warden of Impel Down is interrupted by the sudden appearance of Blackbeard. When the rubber-man hears what the warlord has to say - heads will roll!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"意地でも倒れぬ! 本気のハンニャバル\"},{\"title\":\"Jet Pistol of Anger! Luffy vs. Blackbeard!\",\"number\":447,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Even in Second Gear, Luffy is no match for Blackbeard`s vortex, but the rubber-man rebounds by knocking out a Demon Guard with one ferocious pistol-punch. Elsewhere, Warden Magellan vows to finish Luffy once and for all!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りのJETピストル ルフィvs黒ヒゲ\"},{\"title\":\"Stop Magellan! Ivan-san`s Esoteric Technique Explodes\",\"number\":448,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ace is to be executed in a matter of hours, and Magellan`s toxic breath is singeing the back of Luffy`s neck. Ivan uses a devastating Death Wink to buy some time, but the warden`s Poison Hydra may be more than he can handle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マゼランを止めろ! イワさん奥義炸裂\"},{\"title\":\"Magellan`s Tricky Move! A Foiled Escape Plan\",\"number\":449,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy dons a suit of waxy armor in preparation for his rematch with Warden Magellan. Outside the prison walls, Jimbei turns a door into a boat, so Crocodile and Buggy can commandeer an escape vessel!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マゼランの奇策! はばまれた脱獄計画\"},{\"title\":\"The Escapee Team in Trouble! The Forbidden Move: Venom Demon!\",\"number\":450,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Magellan takes his toxic attack to the next level by unleashing the hideous and deadly Venom Demon! If Jimbei and Crocodile don`t return with a rescue ship soon, Luffy won`t survive long enough to save Ace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"脱獄チーム絶体絶命 禁じ手\\\"毒の巨兵[ベノムデーモン]\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"Come, Final Miracle! Break Through the Gate of Justice!\",\"number\":451,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his merry band of escapees are safely onboard the rescue ship, but they`re not out hot water just yet. A fleet of marines is bombarding them with cannon balls, and an impenetrable gate looms on the horizon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"起こせ最後の奇跡 正義の門を突破せよ\"},{\"title\":\"To the Navy Headquarters! Off to Rescue Ace!\",\"number\":452,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Ivan mourn the loss of Bon Clay, and Captain Buggy`s reputation gets a boost when a phone call from the Marines reveals the secrets of his past.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"目指せ海軍本部 エース救出への船出!\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts! The Weatheria Report and the Cyborg Animals!\",\"number\":453,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy continues his rescue mission, Nami learns a lesson about how to turn rain into cash, and Franky wakes up in a freezing forest full of ferocious cyborg animals!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間たちの行方 空島[ウェザリア]リポートと改造動物[サイボーグアニマル]\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts! The Chick of a Giant Bird and a Pink Showdown!\",\"number\":454,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji tries to fight his way off a most peculiar island, but his frilly battle costume threatens to awaken his inner maiden. Elsewhere, Chopper tries to avoid being served in a hot pot!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 巨鳥のヒナと桃色の対決\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts! Revolutionaries and the Gorging Forest`s Trap!\",\"number\":455,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nico Robin lends her many hands to an overmatched gang of revolutionaries in a frigid land of eternal suffering, and Usopp bulks up to avoid becoming a snack for a hungry, hungry island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 革命軍と暴食の森の罠!\"},{\"title\":\"The Friends` Whereabouts! A Huge Tomb and the Panty Debt!\",\"number\":456,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro`s attempt to reunite with his friends leads him a massive tomb and a host of shadowy swordsmen. Elsewhere, Brook uses his status as Satan to get an eyeful of undergarments!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間達の行方 巨大な墓標とパンツの恩\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Retrospective Before Marineford! The Vow of Brotherhood!\",\"number\":457,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the marines prepare for Ace`s execution, Luffy looks back on all the good times he shared with his brother, and Jimbei reveals the shocking details of the day Fire Fist Ace went down in defeat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍本部[マリンフォード]直前回想特別編[スペシャル] 兄弟の誓い!\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Retrospective Before Marineford! The Three Navy Admirals Come Together!\",\"number\":458,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his gang continue on their way to Marineford, but once he arrives, the rubber-man must defeat both Navy Admirals and Warlords of the Sea before he can save Ace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍本部[マリンフォード]直前回想特別編[スペシャル] 集結! 三大将\"},{\"title\":\"Ticking Down to the Time of Battle! The Navy`s Strongest Lineup in Position!\",\"number\":459,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Citizens and soldiers alike prepare for all-out war as Ace is led to the site of his execution. While the world watches, the true identity of the condemned man`s father is shockingly revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決戦の刻迫る! 海軍最強の布陣完成!\"},{\"title\":\"A Vast Fleet Appears! Here Come the Whitebeard Pirates!\",\"number\":460,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Flashbacks reveal the agonizing sacrifice made by Ace`s mother in order save his life - and the secret behind his connection to Luffy. Back in the present, Whitebeard makes a unexpected entrance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨大艦隊あらわる - 襲来! 白ひげ海賊団\"},{\"title\":\"The Beginning of the War! Ace and Whitebeard`s Past!\",\"number\":461,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As a massive seaquake rocks Marineford, Ace recalls the ups and downs of his life as a pirate, including his first encounter with Whitebeard - and the unthinkable betrayal that led to his capture!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決戦の幕開け! エースと白ひげの過去\"},{\"title\":\"The Force That Could Destroy the World! The Power of the Tremor-Tremor Fruit!\",\"number\":462,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard begins his attack with a tsunami-spawning sea quake, but the marines counter with a blast of frigid air that turns the tidal wave into an iceberg! Will Luffy and his crew arrive in time to join the battle?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界を滅ぼす力! グラグラの実の能力\"},{\"title\":\"An All-Consuming Inferno!! Admiral Akainu`s Power!\",\"number\":463,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fire meets ice as mythical warriors, erupting admirals, legendary pirates, and a giant giant go head to head in the biggest, baddest battle of all time! There`s only one thing missing: Monkey D. Luffy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"すべてを焼き尽くす!! 大将赤犬の能力!\"},{\"title\":\"A Descendent of the Beast! Little Oars Jr.: Full Speed Ahead!\",\"number\":464,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A towering giant of a giant known as Little Oars Jr. carves a path of death and destruction as he fights to save Ace. The monstrous mauler is within arm`s reach of his friend when he`s intercepted by the seven warlords of the sea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔人の子孫! リトルオーズJr.驀進!\"},{\"title\":\"Justice for the Winners! Sengoku`s Strategy in Action!\",\"number\":465,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the wake of Little Oars Junior`s tragic defeat, Admiral Sengoku hatches a devious plan to speed up the countdown to Ace`s execution. The situation looks beyond bleak until a hero enters the fray from on high!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝者だけが正義 発動! センゴクの作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Straw Hat Team Arrives! Tension Grows at the Battlefield\",\"number\":466,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy appears on the field of battle with a ferocious sense of urgency. Ace could be executed at any minute, and the rubber-man`s refusal to back down impresses even the most feared men in all the world!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麦わらチーム到着 風雲急を告げる戦場\"},{\"title\":\"Even If It Means Death! Luffy vs. the Navy: The Battle Starts!\",\"number\":467,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy leaps into action, attacking the Naval forces with a frantic display of brutality. Meanwhile, Ace watches in horror as an army of zombies rises up to attack his brother!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死んでも助ける ルフィVS海軍戦闘開始[バトルスタート]\"},{\"title\":\"Hard Battles, One After Another! Devil Fruit Eaters vs. Devil Fruit Eaters!\",\"number\":468,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Supernatural powers take center stage in the battle to save Ace as Luffy and his uniquely talented allies throw down with the Navy`s own arsenal of Devil Fruit Eaters!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激戦の連続! 能力者軍団VS能力者軍団\"},{\"title\":\"Kuma`s Transformation! Ivan-san`s Blow of Anger!\",\"number\":469,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A gift from Boa Hancock and Ivan-san`s Galaxy Wink get Luffy closer to Ace than ever, but a sword-wielding foe from the past threatens to derail the rescue mission!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"クマに起きた異変 イワさん怒りの一撃\"},{\"title\":\"The Great Swordsman Mihawk! Luffy Comes Under the Attack of the Black Sword!\",\"number\":470,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy runs into a lethal roadblock in the form of Hawk-Eye Mihawk. The legendary swordsman is determined to halt Luffy`s onslaught, but Ivan-san, Boa Hancock, and Jimbei aren`t ready to give up the fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"剣豪ミホーク ルフィに迫る黒刀の斬撃\"},{\"title\":\"The Extermination Strategy in Action! The Power of the Pacifistas!\",\"number\":471,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his pirate brethren have their hands full with an ominous army of unbeatable Kumas! While the inhuman minions march onward, Whitebeard encounters a former ally!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"殲滅作戦始動 パシフィスタ軍団の威力\"},{\"title\":\"Akainu`s Plot! Whitebeard Entrapped!\",\"number\":472,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard is betrayed - and brutally stabbed - by one of his own men! In the wake of this unthinkable act of treason, allegations about the legendary pirate bring the battle to a halt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"赤犬の謀略! おとしいれられた白ひげ\"},{\"title\":\"The Encircling Walls Activated! The Whitebeard Pirates Backed into a Corner!\",\"number\":473,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard shrugs off his injuries and leads a ferocious charge into the heart of the enemy`s defenses, but three deadly Admirals join forces to silence his shock wave attack as the pirates find themselves surrounded by impenetrable walls!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"包囲壁作動! 白ひげ海賊団絶体絶命!!\"},{\"title\":\"Execution Order Issued! Break Through the Encircling Walls!\",\"number\":474,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the ice melting beneath his feet, Luffy begins a desperate final charge towards his soon-to-be-executed brother. Should his rescue attempt fail, death will surely embrace them both!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"処刑執行指令下る 包囲壁を突破せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Moving into the Final Phase! Whitebeard`s Trump Card for Recovery!\",\"number\":475,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Crocodile`s unexpected assistance creates an opening for Luffy to advance, and Whitebeard has a surprise lurking beneath the ice that might swing the momentum in favor of the pirates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最終局面突入! 白ひげ起死回生の一手\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy at the End of His Tether! An All-Out Battle at the Oris Plaza!\",\"number\":476,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle rages on and the bodies pile up as Whitebeard squares off against an Admiral, Luffy gets knocked cold, and the legendary Vice-Admiral Garp finally enters the fray!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ力尽く! オリス広場の総力戦!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Power That Will Shorten One`s Life! Energy Hormone, Redux!\",\"number\":477,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While awaiting his execution, Ace flashes back to a trouble youth spent seeking the truth about his father. Meanwhile, Luffy begs Ivan for a potentially-deadly treatment that will allow him to continue fighting!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"命を削る力 テンション・ホルモン再び\"},{\"title\":\"To Live Up to a Promise! Luffy and Coby Collide!\",\"number\":478,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes short work of face from his past, and Whitebeard struggles to withstand the full force of the Marine onslaught. With the executioner`s swords hovering above Ace`s head, Straw Hat Luffy discovers a new ability!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"約束のために!! 激闘! ルフィとコビー\"},{\"title\":\"The Scaffold at Last! The Way to Ace Has Opened!\",\"number\":479,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard orders his men to help Luffy clear a path to the execution scaffold, but someone close to the Rubber-man rises up to derail the rescue mission at the last second!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"処刑台目前! 開かれたエースへの道!!\"},{\"title\":\"Each on Different Paths! Luffy vs. Garp!\",\"number\":480,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy must defeat the man who taught him how to fight - his own grandfather - in order to save Ace. Battling his own flesh and blood won`t be easy, but a waxy ally is there to provide back up!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"それぞれの選んだ道 ルフィVSガープ!\"},{\"title\":\"Ace Rescued! Whitebeard`s Final Order!\",\"number\":481,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ace is finally free from the execution scaffold! Luffy and his brother make a fearsome team as they blaze a path toward salvation. Ravaged by the war, Whitebeard wistfully commands his men to make the journey to the New World without him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エース救出! 白ひげ最後の船長命令!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Power That Can Burn Even Fire! Akainu`s Ruthless Pursuit!\",\"number\":482,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite Whitebeard`s order to retreat, Ace is drawn back to the battlefield by the cruel taunts of a Marine adversary. Luffy watches in horror as his brother makes what could be his last stand!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火をも焼き尽くす能力[ちから] 赤犬非情の追撃\"},{\"title\":\"Looking for the Answer! Fire Fist Ace Dies on the Battlefield!\",\"number\":483,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An eerie silence falls over the battlefield as Luffy and Ace share a heartbreaking final moment together. With his dying breath, Ace begs his brother to convey a message to his fellow pirates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"答えを探して 火拳[ひけん]エース戦場に死す\"},{\"title\":\"The Navy Headquarters Falls! Whitebeard`s Unspeakable Wrath!\",\"number\":484,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Anguished cries echo across the battlefield in the wake of Ace`s tragic death. Luffy - paralyzed by grief - must be carried to safety, but Whitebeard summons the strength for one last ferocious attack!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍本部崩壊! 白ひげ言葉なき怒り!\"},{\"title\":\"Ending the Matter! Whitebeard vs. the Blackbeard Pirates!\",\"number\":485,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard’s children watch in horror as the old man faces off the villainous Blackbeard pirates. Though his injuries are mounting and the odds are stacked against him, Whitebeard never, ever runs away from a fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ケジメをつける 白ひげVS黒ひげ海賊団\"},{\"title\":\"The Show Begins! Blackbeard`s Plot Is Revealed!\",\"number\":486,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The world reacts to Whitebeard`s death with shock and awe. Meanwhile, Jimbei risks his life to save Luffy and Blackbeard reveals the depraved depths of his nefarious nature!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ショーの開幕 明かされた黒ひげの企み\"},{\"title\":\"The Insatiable Akainu! Lava Fists Pummel Luffy!\",\"number\":487,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Blackbeard and his men seek to sink Marineford, Jimbei and Luffy`s desperate attempt to flee is thwarted by Akainu`s fiery fists. The situation appears dire until a former enemy lends a sandy hand!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"赤犬の執念! ルフィを襲うマグマの拳[こぶし]\"},{\"title\":\"The Desperate Scream! Courageous Moments That Will Change the Future\",\"number\":488,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Trafalgar Law and the Heart Pirates offer Luffy a submarine escape route, Blackbeard continues his reckless rampage, and a puny pink-hair marine changes the world with a scream!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必死の叫び 運命を変える勇気ある数秒\"},{\"title\":\"Here Comes Shanks! The War of the Best Is Finally Over!\",\"number\":489,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Heart Pirates head for the bottom of the ocean as Trafalgar Law prepares to operate on Luffy and Jimbei. Meanwhile, the arrival of Shanks brings the bloodshed to a sudden halt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シャンクス見参! 頂上戦争ついに終結\"},{\"title\":\"Mighty Leaders Face Each Other Down! Heralding the `New Era`!\",\"number\":490,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The world rejoices in the wake of Whitebeard`s death, and a host of powerful pirates vie for his position. Meanwhile, Luffy`s friends fear that Ace`s death may be more than the rubber-man can handle - if he ever wakes up!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"群雄割拠す! \\\"新しい時代\\\"の始まり!\"},{\"title\":\"Landing at the Maiden Island! The Harsh Reality Falls Upon Luffy!\",\"number\":491,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Power-hungry pirates terrorize innocent citizens once protected by Whitebeard, and Luffy`s nightmarish awakening sends him on a reckless rampage that could land him in an early grave!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"女ヶ島上陸 ルフィを責める過酷な現実\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Tag-Team! Luffy and Toriko`s Hard Struggle!\",\"number\":492,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One Piece X Toriko Crossover\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強タッグ! 奮闘, ルフィとトリコ!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy and Ace! The Story of How the Brothers Met!\",\"number\":493,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A flashback to the younger days of Luffy and Ace reveals their unusual upbringing under the not-so-watchful eye of villainous mountain bandits!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィとエース 兄弟の出会いの物語!\"},{\"title\":\"Here Comes Sabo! The Boy at the Gray Terminal!\",\"number\":494,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The flashback continues as Ace robs a ruthless gang of pirates, and Luffy is left to take the fall! Will Ace and his friend Sabo let Luffy be tortured to death - or will they risk their high seas dreams to save him?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サボ登場! 不確かな物の終着駅[グレイ・ターミナル]の少年\"},{\"title\":\"I Won`t Run! Ace`s Desperate Rescue Operation!\",\"number\":495,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ace and Sabo race to rescue Luffy from the clutches of a murderous gang of pirates! Sabo wants to grab Luffy and make a break for it, but Ace refuses to back down from a fight - even when he`s outnumbered!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おれは逃げない エース決死の救出作戦\"},{\"title\":\"To the Sea Someday! The Pledge of the Three Brats!\",\"number\":496,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When a nobleman recognizes Sabo in the streets, Luffy and Ace learn the painful secret of their friend`s past. As a sign of solidarity, the three boys pledge to become pirates, and hoist a toast to brotherhood!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いつか海へ! 三人の悪童ちかいの盃[さかずき]!\"},{\"title\":\"Leaving the Dadan Family for Good?! The Kids` Hideout Has Been Built!\",\"number\":497,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After another beating from Garp, Luffy and his friends take to the jungle and build a pirate hideout at the top of an enormous tree. First order of business: booby trap the new place!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ダダン一家との別れ!? 完成! 秘密基地\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Becoming an Apprentice?! A Man Who Fought Against the King of the Pirates!\",\"number\":498,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his friends vow to defeat the giant tiger that`s been stealing their food, Ace gets angry when his father`s identity is revealed, and Sabo`s parents hire pirates to track down their son!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ弟子入り!? 海賊王と戦った男!\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Against the Big Tiger! Who Is Going to Be Captain?!\",\"number\":499,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Ace, and Sabo take pirate lessons from a mysterious old scallywag who just might know the secret to defeating the big tiger - and becoming a good captian!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大虎との決戦! 船長になるのは誰だ!\"},{\"title\":\"Freedom Taken Away! The Nobles` Plot Closing In on the Brothers!\",\"number\":500,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The brothers are captured by a gang of pirates, and Sabo is handed over to his noble father, where the boy quickly discovers a sinister plot to destroy Gray Terminal forever!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奪われた自由! 三兄弟に迫る貴族の罠\"},{\"title\":\"The Fire Has Been Set! The Gray Terminal in Crisis!\",\"number\":501,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While flames spread across Gray Terminal, Sabo makes a desperate attempt to escape the trappings of his noble birth and save his brothers. Meanwhile, Luffy and Ace must fight to avoid an untimely end!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"放たれた炎 グレイ・ターミナルの危機\"},{\"title\":\"Where Can Freedom Be Found? A Sad Departure of a Boy!\",\"number\":502,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is spared from a fiery death by an unlikely rescuer, but Ace refuses to leave Gray Terminal until he settles the score with Bluejam. Meanwhile, Sabo makes waves with a last ditch escape attempt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自由はどこにある? 少年の悲しき船出\"},{\"title\":\"Take Good Care of Him! A Letter from the Brother!\",\"number\":503,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Ace receive troubling reports of a Celestial attack on Sabo`s ship. Ace is eager to seek out the responsible parties and extract revenge, but a letter from his absent brother tempers his eagerness to fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"よろしく頼む! 兄弟から届いた手紙!\"},{\"title\":\"To Live Up to the Promise! Departures of Their Own!\",\"number\":504,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the wake of Sabo`s death, Luffy and Ace grow stronger than ever by continuing their daily routine of nonstop fighting. As the years pass, each brother prepares to set sail in search of future adventures!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"約束を果たすため それぞれの旅立ち!\"},{\"title\":\"I Want to See Them! Luffy`s Mournful Cry!\",\"number\":505,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Garp takes a beating from a heartbroken mountain bandit, and a big, blue friend helps Luffy drown his despair in the newfound desire to reunite with his mates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"あいつらに会いてェ! ルフィ涙の叫び\"},{\"title\":\"Straw Hats in Shock! The Bad News Has Reached Them!\",\"number\":506,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One by one, the Straw Hats are crushed to learn the tragic fate of Fire Fist Ace. Despite their own unique problems, the crew members` thoughts immediately turn to their crestfallen captain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麦わらの一味激震! もたらされた凶報\"},{\"title\":\"Reunited with Dark King Rayleigh! Decision Time for Luffy!\",\"number\":507,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is determined to reassemble his scattered crew, but a powerful old friend forces him to rethink his plans. Meanwhile, Usopp fights to escape an island that wants to have him for lunch!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冥王[めいおう]レイリーとの再会 ルフィ決断の時\"},{\"title\":\"Back to Our Captain! A Jail Break at the Sky Island and the Incident on the Winter Island!\",\"number\":508,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Desperate to reach Luffy, Nami risks her life to escape from an island of weather wizards. Meanwhile, Franky rides a carbonation high through the ice and snow in search of a seaworthy vessel!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"船長のもとへ 空島の脱獄と冬島の事件\"},{\"title\":\"Encounter! The Great Swordsman Mihawk! Zoro`s Self-Willed Deadly Struggle!\",\"number\":509,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro`s escape attempt is thwarted by a gang of sword-slinging baboon bullies, and Brook uses music to end a feud between irate islanders with unequal arms!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"接触! 大剣豪ミホーク ゾロ意地の死闘\"},{\"title\":\"A Disaster for Sanji! The Queen`s Return to the Kingdom!\",\"number\":510,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper hitches a ride on a giant bird, Luffy makes a shocking return to Marineford, and Sanji finds himself fighting the most beautiful man he`s ever seen!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジの受難 王国へと帰還した女王!\"},{\"title\":\"Unexpected Relanding! Luffy, to Marineford!\",\"number\":511,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, along with Jimbei and Dark King Rayleigh, causes quite the commotion upon his return to Marineford. Meanwhile, powerful pirates all across the globe wreak havoc on the innocent!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"まさかの再上陸! ルフィ海軍本部[マリンフォード]へ!\"},{\"title\":\"With Hopes It Will Reach My Friends! Big News Spreading Fast!\",\"number\":512,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy hopes to send a message to his mates by way of a clue hidden in a newspaper article. Meanwhile, the Flying Fish Riders protect the Straw Hat`s ship from scandalous scavengers!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間に届け かけめぐる大ニュース!\"},{\"title\":\"Pirates Get on the Move! Astounding New World!\",\"number\":513,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Trafalgar Law waits for the right moment to make his move, Blackbeard is pursued by powerful marines, and Chopper makes a surprising return to the land of gargantuan birds!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出す海賊たち! 驚天動地の新世界\"},{\"title\":\"Living through Hell! Sanji`s Fight for His Manhood!\",\"number\":514,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami uses her feminine charms to learn about the New World weather, Franky moves into Dr. Vegapunk`s laboratory, and Sanji must fight to stay out of a cute dress!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地獄を生き抜け サンジ男をかけた勝負\"},{\"title\":\"I Will Get Much, Much Stronger! Zoro`s Pledge to His Captain!\",\"number\":515,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats continue preparations for their voyage to the New World as Robin heads for a meeting with the Revolutionary Dragon, Usopp aspires to become King of the Snipers, and Zoro begs his mortal enemy to train him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"まだまだ強くなる! ゾロ船長への誓い\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Training Begins! To the Place We Promised in 2 Years!\",\"number\":516,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dark King Rayleigh takes Luffy to a deadly, deserted island for two years of intense battle training! If the Straw Hat captain wants to survive in the New World, he`ll have to hone his hidden powers!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ修行開始 2年後に約束の場所で\"},{\"title\":\"The Beginning of The New Chapter! The Straw Hats Reunited!\",\"number\":517,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After two years of rigorous training, the new and improved Straw Hats make their way to Sabaody Archipelago, but their long-awaited reunion is spoiled by a villainous gang of imposters!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新章開幕 再集結! 麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"An Explosive Situation! Luffy vs. Fake Luffy!\",\"number\":518,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy picks a fight with himself, Chopper falls in with a dubious crowd of imitation pirates, and Zoro causes a commotion when he falls asleep on the wrong ship!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一触即発! ルフィVS[たい]ニセルフィ\"},{\"title\":\"The Navy Has Set Out! The Straw Hats in Danger!\",\"number\":519,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper struggles to make sense of the changes his \\\"friends\\\" have undergone in the last two years, and the Navy mobilizes in an attempt to stop the pirate posers. Will the real Straw Hats please stand up?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍出動 狙われた麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"Big Guns Assembled! The Danger of the Fake Straw Hats!\",\"number\":520,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper and Usopp flip over Franky`s new body, Brook must choose between rock-n-roll stardom and the life of a pirate, and Luffy wanders into a very dangerous crowd!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大物集結 ニセ麦わら一味の脅威\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Is On! Show Them What You Got from Training!\",\"number\":521,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the rest of the Straw Hats prepare to set sail, Luffy gets a chance to show off his new powers in a brutal throw down between notorious pirates, navy soldiers, and deadly Pacifistas!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦闘開始! 見せろ修行の成果!\"},{\"title\":\"Everyone Together! Luffy, Setting Out for the New World!\",\"number\":522,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew are finally reunited, but before they can set sail, they`ll need help from Dark King Rayleigh, Boa Hancock, and all the friends they`ve made in the last two years!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全員集合 ルフィ新世界への船出\"},{\"title\":\"A Suprising Fact! The Man Who Guarded the Sunny!\",\"number\":523,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As word of the Straw Hat resurrection spreads through the Navy, Luffy and his crew get acclimated to their underwater environment, and Franky reveals the startling identity of the man who protected their ship!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"驚愕の真実 サニー号を守った男\"},{\"title\":\"Deadly Combat Under the Sea! The Demon of the Ocean Strikes!\",\"number\":524,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats are attacked by a rival gang of pirates, but that may be the least of their worries. Luffy and his crew are on a collision course with a cantankerous Kraken!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海中の死闘 現れた大海原の悪魔\"},{\"title\":\"Lost in the Deep Sea! The Straw Hats Get Separated!\",\"number\":525,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After their quarrel with the Kraken, the Straw Hats find themselves in hot water as Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji turn up missing, and the rest of the crew runs short on air!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"深海で遭難 逸れた麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"Undersea Volcanic Eruption! Drifting to the Fish-Man Island!\",\"number\":526,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thanks to a little help from a friend, Luffy saves his mates from a ghost ship captained by a deranged Dutchman! Unfortunately, their happy reunion is cut short by a volcanic eruption! Can the Hats take the heat?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海底火山噴火! 流されて魚人島\"},{\"title\":\"Landing at the Fish-Man Island! Beautiful Mermaids!\",\"number\":527,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats finally make it to Fish-Man Island, but their reputation precedes them, leading to trouble with the New Fish-Man Pirates! Only a daring maneuver can get them out of hot water, but there`s no guarantee they`ll survive!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魚人島上陸 うるわしき人魚たち\"},{\"title\":\"Excitement Blow-Out! Sanji`s Life Under Threat!\",\"number\":528,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Sanji gets up close and personal with a mesmerizing mermaid, his extreme fondness for the female form lands him in a life and death situation. Could the Straw Hat chef die from a nosebleed?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"興奮爆発! サンジ生命の危機!\"},{\"title\":\"The Fish-Man Island Will Be Annihilated?! Sharley`s Prophecy!\",\"number\":529,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After two generous donors save Sanji from death by nosebleed, Luffy and Usopp take a tour of the island. But their welcome is worn out when a mystic mermaid has a terrifying vision - that Fish-Man Island will be destroyed at the hands of a Straw Hat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魚人島滅亡!? シャーリーの予言\"},{\"title\":\"The King of the Fish-Man Island! Neptune, the God of the Sea!\",\"number\":530,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After reuniting with Nami, Luffy and the gang are invited to the royal palace of Neptune, god of the sea! Meanwhile, the New Fish-Man Pirates exploit the power of a designer steroid in order to terrorize humans!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魚人島の王 海神ネプチューン!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ryugu Palace! Taken by the Shark That They Saved!\",\"number\":531,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A trio of unsuspecting mermaids find themselves in hot water after releasing a bad guy from his barrel of a prison. Over at the royal palace, Luffy gets up close and personal with the Mermaid Princess!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"竜宮城! 助けた鮫に連れられて\"},{\"title\":\"A Coward and a Crybaby! The Princess in the Hard Shell Tower!\",\"number\":532,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s lightning reflexes spare the Mermaid Princess from a grisly death, Neptune`s army attempts to apprehend the Straw Hats, and Captain Vander Decken forges a sinister undersea alliance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"弱虫で泣き虫! 硬殻塔の人魚姫\"},{\"title\":\"It`s an Emergency! The Ryugu Palace Is Occupied!\",\"number\":533,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their backs against the wall, the Straw Hats are forced to take King Neptune and his men hostage. On the other side of the palace, Luffy and the Mermaid Princess make plans to visit the Sea Forrest!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緊急事態発生 占拠された竜宮城\"},{\"title\":\"The Ryugu Palace in Shock! The Kidnapping of Shirahoshi!\",\"number\":534,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy accidentally \\\"kidnaps\\\" the Mermaid Princess, an old friend issues a grave warning to Chopper and Sanji, and the New Fish-Man Pirates prepare for a raid on Ryugu Palace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"竜宮城激震! しらほし誘拐事件\"},{\"title\":\"Hordy`s Onslaught! The Retaliatory Plan Set into Motion!\",\"number\":535,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captain Vander Decken and Hordy Jones manage to successfully breach the defenses of Ryugu Palace. Meanwhile, Jimbei waits patiently for Luffy to arrive at the Sea Forest.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ホーディ襲来 復讐計画の始まり\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle in the Ryugu Palace! Zoro vs. Hordy!\",\"number\":536,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin ventures into the forest in search of ancient secrets, Zoro takes to the water for a slicing, dicing showdown with Hordy Jones, and Luffy is branded a royal kidnapper by an angry mob of fish folk!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"竜宮城の決戦! ゾロVSホーディ\"},{\"title\":\"Keep Shirahoshi Safe! Decken Close Behind!\",\"number\":537,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Chopper, and Sanji are taken prisoner by a fish mob just as Vander Decken launches an attack the princess! Elsewhere, Zoro continues his battle with Hordy, and Nami hitches a ride on a mermaid to escape the crumbling palace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"しらほしを守れ デッケンの追撃\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hats Defeated?! Hordy Gains Control of the Ryugu Palace!\",\"number\":538,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Neptune fight bravely, but they`re no match for Hordy and his pill-popping minions. Back at the ship, Luffy reunites with Jimbei, who reveals something sinister about his past.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味敗北!? ホーディ竜宮城制圧\"},{\"title\":\"The Haunting Ties! Nami and the Fish-Man Pirates!\",\"number\":539,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The New Fish-Man Pirates continue their bloody and violent uprising, and Jimbei begins the story of how he unleashed the monster known as Arlong on the unsuspecting citizens of the East Blue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"蘇る因縁! ナミと魚人海賊団!\"},{\"title\":\"A Hero Who Freed the Slaves! An Adventurer Tiger!\",\"number\":540,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei continues his story with tales of fish-men taken as slaves, Queen Otohime`s fierce devotion to her people, the legend of Fisher Tiger, and the sinister rise of Arlong.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奴隷解放の英雄 冒険家タイガー\"},{\"title\":\"Kizaru Appears! A Trap to Catch Tiger!\",\"number\":541,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Arlong`s violent tendencies are condemned by Fisher Tiger, and the arrival of a young human girl teaches the Fish-Man Pirates a lesson in compassion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄猿登場! タイガーを狙う罠!\"},{\"title\":\"A Team Is Formed! Save Chopper\",\"number\":542,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One Piece X Toriko Crossover\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"チーム結成! チョッパーを救え\"},{\"title\":\"The Death of the Hero! A Shocking Truth of Tiger!\",\"number\":543,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The great pirate Fisher Tiger keeps his promise to a young slave girl, but the adults in her village are determined to make him pay for his act of honor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"英雄の最期 タイガー衝撃の真実\"},{\"title\":\"The Sun Pirates Split! Jimbei vs. Arlong!\",\"number\":544,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the wake of Fisher Tiger`s tragic death, the once-mighty Sun Pirates are splintered by an ongoing quarrel between Jimbei and Arlong. Meanwhile, Queen Otohime`s ceasless quest to help her people begins to take its toll.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊団分裂 ジンベエVS[たい]アーロン\"},{\"title\":\"Shaking Fish-Man Island! A Celestial Dragon Drifts In!\",\"number\":545,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tensions run high when a slave-owning Celestial Dragon washes up on Fish-Man Island. His former captives cry for out for blood, but Queen Otohime sees it as a chance to mend fences between the gilled and non-gilled!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"揺れる魚人島! 漂着した天竜人\"},{\"title\":\"A Sudden Tragedy! A Gunshot Shuts Down the Future!\",\"number\":546,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After an agonizing absence, Queen Otohime returns to her people with exciting news. Unfortunately, a horrific act of violence derails the queen`s mission and changes life on Fish-Man Island forever.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"突然の悲劇! 未来を閉ざす凶弾\"},{\"title\":\"Back to the Present! Hordy Makes a Move!\",\"number\":547,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei reaches the heartbreaking conclusion in the story of Queen Otohime, Nami does something completely unexpected, and Hordy Jones makes a foreboding appearance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再び現在へ! 動き出すホーディ\"},{\"title\":\"The Kingdom in Shock! An Order to Execute Neptune Issued!\",\"number\":548,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hordy announces his sinister plans for Fish-Man Island. Luffy and Shirahoshi are ready to fight, but Jimbei wants to wage this war on his own!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"王国激震 ネプチューン処刑指令\"},{\"title\":\"A Rift Opens Up! Luffy vs. Jimbei!\",\"number\":549,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Jimbei come to blows over how to handle Hordy`s uprising. Back at the palace, Brook embarks on an out of body experience with hopes of saving his mates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生じた亀裂! ルフィVS[たい]ジンベエ\"},{\"title\":\"Something Has Happened to Hordy! The True Power of the Evil Drug!\",\"number\":550,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei and Luffy continue their standoff, the New Fish-Man pirates go on a rampage, and Hordy begins to experience startling side effects from his pill-popping habit!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ホーディの異変 凶薬の真の力!\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Is On! At Conchchorde Plaza!\",\"number\":551,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hordy`s rampant use of the energy steroid makes him bigger, stronger, and scarier than ever before! The Fish-Man princes join the battle, but even they may not be strong enough to stop Hordy`s onslaught!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決戦始まる ギョンコルド広場!\"},{\"title\":\"A Surprising Confession! The Truth Behind the Assassination of Otohime!\",\"number\":552,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei and Shirahoshi are captured by the enemy, and Hordy makes a shocking revelation to the population of Fish-Man Island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃の告白 オトヒメ暗殺の真実\"},{\"title\":\"Shirahoshi`s Tears! Luffy Finally Shows Up!\",\"number\":553,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shirahoshi reveals that she knew the truth about her mother`s murder all along, and Luffy makes a bone-crushing entrance when the princess needs him most!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"しらほしの涙! ルフィ遂に登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Clash! The Straw Hats vs. a Hundred Thousand Enemies!\",\"number\":554,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hordy announces his plan for turning humans into slaves, the people of Fish-Man Island throw their support behind a new champion, and Luffy amazes even his own friends!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大激突! 麦わら一味VS10万の敵\"},{\"title\":\"Deadly Attacks One After Another! Zoro and Sanji Join the Battle!\",\"number\":555,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the gang show off how much stronger they`ve become by issuing a brutal beat down to Hordy and his ferocious Fish-Man Pirates! Can anything stop the Hats?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大技炸裂! ゾロ・サンジ出撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Unveiled! The Secret Weapons of the Sunny!\",\"number\":556,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hordy`s men keep attacking, but the Straw Hats have new weapons at their disposal! Franky unleashes the fury of the Black Rhino, and Luffy turns the tables on Hordy with a little help from his Kraken!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"初披露! サニー号の秘密兵器!\"},{\"title\":\"Iron Pirate! Here Comes General Franky!\",\"number\":557,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky dazzles Usopp and Chopper by transforming into a gigantic fighting robot, Hordy tries to blackmail the Kraken, and Luffy introduces his fist to the Fish-man`s face!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鉄の海賊[アイアンパイレーツ]! フランキー将軍登場\"},{\"title\":\"The Noah Closing in! The Fish-Man Island Facing Destruction!\",\"number\":558,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy shows off even more new powers as he brutally pummels Hordy, but the main attraction proves to be an ancient and immense pirate ship that`s heading straight for Fish-Man Island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ノア接近! 魚人島壊滅の危機!\"},{\"title\":\"Hurry Up, Luffy! Shirahoshi`s Life in Jeopardy!\",\"number\":559,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shirahoshi summons the courage to risk everything to save her world, Luffy puts his own life in peril by venturing into the ocean, and Hordy`s devious nature fully comes to the surface.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"急げルフィ! しらほし絶体絶命\"},{\"title\":\"The Fierce Fight Begins! Luffy vs. Hordy!\",\"number\":560,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy sets the stage for a final battle with Hordy, Sanji kicks a giant in defense of Nami`s honor, and Zoro puts his blades to the ultimate test against a steroid-powered fighting fish!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘開始! ルフィVS[たい]ホーディ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Massive Confused Fight! The Straw Hats vs. the New Fish-Man Pirates!\",\"number\":561,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy and Shirahoshi try to prevent Fish-Man Island from being crushed, the rest of the Straw Hats square off against the meanest Fish-Man Pirates in the deep blue sea!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大乱戦! 一味VS新魚人海賊団!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Loses the Fight?! Hordy`s Long-Awaited Revenge!\",\"number\":562,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is the only one who can stop Hordy, but he`ll need air to survive the fight, so Shirahoshi`s big brother risks his own life in heroic attempt to get Luffy a bigger bubble!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ敗北!?ホーディ復讐の時\"},{\"title\":\"A Shocking Fact! The True Identity of Hordy!\",\"number\":563,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the rest of the Straw Hats continue to fight bravely, Luffy tries to find a way to save the island, and the horrible truth about Hordy`s hatred for humans is finally revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃の事実! ホーディの正体!\"},{\"title\":\"Back to Zero! Earnest Wishes for Luffy!\",\"number\":564,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hordy`s twisted past takes center stage in a Fish-Man flashback. Meanwhile, Shirahoshi`s brother begs Luffy to save his beloved homeland and wipe out the anti-human element!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゼロに! ルフィへの熱き願い!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s All-Out Attack! Red Hawk Blasts!\",\"number\":565,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s fist of fire puts Hordy down for the count, and the rest of the Straw Hats try to make short work of the remaining Fish-Man Pirates. Meanwhile, a very big boat looms overhead!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ渾身の一撃! 火拳銃[レッドホーク]炸裂\"},{\"title\":\"Coming to an End! The Final Decisive Battle against Hordy!\",\"number\":566,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the rest of the Straw Hats try to make short work of their enemies, Luffy summons the strength for one last brutal attack on Hordy. Now, about that giant boat...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ついに決着! ホーディ最終決戦\"},{\"title\":\"Stop, Noah! Desperate Elephant Gantling!\",\"number\":567,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After defeating Hordy, Luffy turns his attention to stopping the Noah from crushing Fish-Man Island. Straw Hats and Fish-Men alike watch as Luffy tries to obliterate a boat with a barrage of brutal blows!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"止まれノア! 決死の象銃乱打[エレファントガトリング]!\"},{\"title\":\"To the Future! The Path to the Sun!\",\"number\":568,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fish-Man Island was saved by the timely arrival of the Sea Kings, but all is not well. Luffy lost a lot of blood in his battle with Hordy, and fish-to-human transfusions are strictly forbidden!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"未来へ! タイヨウへと続く道!\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret Revealed! The Truth About the Ancient Weapon!\",\"number\":569,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei must decide whether or not to join the Straw Hats, and the grateful citizens of Fish-Man Island host a fabulous banquet in honor of their human heroes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"明かされた秘密 古代兵器の真実\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hats Stunned! The New Fleet Admiral of the Navy!\",\"number\":570,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew learn of epic battle between Aokiji and Akainu, a forgotten foe tries to kidnap the mermaid princess, and Hordy`s gang finally gets what`s coming to them!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味驚愕! 新たなる海軍元帥!\"},{\"title\":\"She Loves Sweets! Big Mam of the Four Emperors!\",\"number\":571,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji stumble upon a couple of Big Mam`s henchmen extorting sweets from the peaceful people of Fish-Man Island, the Straw Hats make a new - and very powerful - enemy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お菓子好き! 四皇ビッグ・マム\"},{\"title\":\"Many Problems Lie Ahead! A Trap Awaiting in the New World!\",\"number\":572,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats prepare to depart Fish-Man Island, a lion and a caribou come to blows over booby-trapped treasure, and Vice Admiral Smoker makes his presence felt in the New World!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"前途多難 新世界に待ち受ける罠\"},{\"title\":\"Finally Time to Go! Goodbye, Fish-Man Island!\",\"number\":573,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and his crew bid farewell to their new friends before setting off in search of the greatest adventures the New World has to offer!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ついに出航! さよなら魚人島\"},{\"title\":\"To the New World! Heading for the Ultimate Sea!\",\"number\":574,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Usopp’s extreme deep sea fishing adventure lands the crew in the middle of a deadly whirlpool, but an unexpected encounter with a pod of giant whales may bail the Straw Hats out of hot water!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新世界へ! 最強の海をめざして\"},{\"title\":\"Z`s Ambition! Lily the Little Giant!\",\"number\":575,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s arrival in the New World is marked by violent weather and the discovery of a tiny stowaway. When the Straw Hats agree to help their new friend, it could lead to big trouble with the Marines!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"Zの野望編 小さな巨人リリー!\"},{\"title\":\"Z`s Ambition! A Dark and Powerful Army!\",\"number\":576,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami hatches a plan to save Lily`s father, but the arrival of an ex-marine madman throws a monkey wrench into the rescue mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"Zの野望編 謎の最強軍団登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Z`s Ambition! A Great and Desperate Escape Plan!\",\"number\":577,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Zoro find themselves locked in battle with their latest foes, but Nami`s knowledge of the sea may be the key to escaping this scrum alive!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"Zの野望編 決死の大脱出作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Z`s Ambition! Luffy vs. Shuzo!\",\"number\":578,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shuzo`s squad of manned torpedoes targets the Straw Hats and the giants! The crazed captain tests Luffy`s mettle in a showdown on land, but the wily pirate pulls off a supersized surprise in hopes to stomp out the madman for good.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"Zの野望編 ルフィVSシューゾ!\"},{\"title\":\"Arriving! A Burning Island: Punk Hazard!\",\"number\":579,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A desperate cry for help leads the Straw Hats to Punk Hazard, an island engulfed in flames and inhabited by a mythic beast that could make short work of Luffy and the gang!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"上陸! 燃える島パンクハザード\"},{\"title\":\"A Battle in the Heat! Luffy vs. the Giant Dragon!\",\"number\":580,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Zoro put their strength to the ultimate test in a battle with a dragon. Meanwhile, a band of mysterious intruders make their gassy presence felt aboard the Sunny!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"灼熱の戦い! ルフィVS[たい]巨大竜!\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hats Stunned! Enter: A Samurai`s Horrifying Severed Head!\",\"number\":581,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy gets up close and personal with a torso-less Samurai! Elsewhere, Nami, Sanji, Chopper, and Franky find themselves imprisoned with the pieces of a human face!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味騒然! 衝撃の首だけ侍登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Startling! The Secret of the Island Is Finally Revealed\",\"number\":582,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes friends with a Centaur, Franky uses a cola-powered laser to break out of the clink, and Sanji takes a chance on a body-less Samurai!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"驚愕! 遂に明かされる島の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Save the Children! The Straw Hats Start to Fight\",\"number\":583,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami`s soft spot for children prompts her to call off the escape and declare war on anyone who makes a kid cry. Meanwhile, Luffy and the gang take a banana boat to the icy side of the island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"子供達を救え! 一味戦闘開始\"},{\"title\":\"A Swordplay Showdown! Brook vs. the Mysterious Torso Samurai!\",\"number\":584,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s group finds themselves up against a gang of centaurs, Brook battles the torso of a surly samurai, and Captain Smoker encounters someone highly unexpected!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"剣術勝負 ブルックVS[たい]謎の胴体侍\"},{\"title\":\"The Warlord! Trafalgar Law!\",\"number\":585,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and Chopper seek a safe exit for the children, Luffy`s group hopes to avoid a perilous plunge into icy waters, and Captain Smoker faces off against Trafalgar Law!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"七武海! トラファルガー・ロー\"},{\"title\":\"In a Real Pinch! Luffy Sinks into the Ice-cold Lake!\",\"number\":586,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s group takes a deadly plunge into icy waters, and Trafalgar Law uses his unique abilities to rearrange Nami`s group and cast our heroes into chaotic confusion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大ピンチ ルフィ極寒の湖に沈む\"},{\"title\":\"A Collision! Law vs. Vice Admiral Smoker!\",\"number\":587,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy and his mates race toward a reunion, Admiral Smoker struggles to survive a heart-stopping showdown with Trafalgar Law!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! ロー VS スモーカー中将\"},{\"title\":\"Meeting Again After Two Years! Luffy and Law\",\"number\":588,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is excited to once again cross paths with Trafalgar Law, but a reunion with his mixed up crew - and the loss of his extra legs - quickly dampens the captain`s enthusiasm!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"2年ぶりの再会! ルフィとロー\"},{\"title\":\"The Worst in the World! A Scientist of Terror - Caesar!\",\"number\":589,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Captain Smoker determines his next move, a very large pirate with alligator legs tells Luffy and the Straw Hats the true story of Punk Hazard`s mysterious transformation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界最悪 恐怖の科学者シーザー\"},{\"title\":\"The Mightiest Team-Up in History vs. the Glutton of the Sea\",\"number\":590,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Featured characters of One Piece, Toriko and Dragon Ball enter the IGO tournament in order to gain the Carat meat, which is said to be the most tasteful in the world. However, it leads in a tie between Goku, Toriko and Luffy. Meanwhile, Zoro, Zebra and Vegeta meet accidentally in a remote part of the race, and start fighting.\\nSource: http://onepiece.fandom.com/\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"史上最強コラボVS[たい]海の大食漢\"},{\"title\":\"Chopper`s Fury! The Master`s Inhumane Experiment\",\"number\":591,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The giant children fly into a mysterious rage, and Chopper discovers the true reason for their unusual condition! Meanwhile, Zoro, Brook, and Sanji cross paths with a dangerous duo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"チョッパー激怒 M[マスター]非道なる実験\"},{\"title\":\"To Annihilate the Straw Hats! Legendary Assassins Descend!\",\"number\":592,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The story of how Trafalgar Law arrived at Punk Hazard is revealed, and the Yeti Cool Brothers set their sights on a showdown with the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味抹殺!伝説の殺し屋来襲!\"},{\"title\":\"Save Nami! Luffy`s Fight on the Snow-Capped Mountains\",\"number\":593,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy tries to chase down the Yetti Cool Brothers, but Franky`s still trapped in Chopper`s Body makes his mission extremely difficult. Just when all appears lost, an unexpected ally lends a hand!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミを救え!ルフィ雪山の戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Formed! Luffy and Law`s Pirate Alliance!\",\"number\":594,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy agrees to an alliance with Trafalgar Law, but the Straw Hats refuse to leave the island until the children are safe. Meanwhile, the gaseous master unleashes something very deadly!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結成!ルフィ・ロー海賊同盟!\"},{\"title\":\"Capture M! The Pirate Alliance`s Operation Launches!\",\"number\":595,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro, Sanji, and Brook continue their search for the samurai, Trafalgar tries to sneak Chopper into the laboratory, and Luffy boldly challenges the Master!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"M[マスター]を捉えろ 海賊同盟作戦開始!\"},{\"title\":\"On the Verge of Annihilation! A Deadly Monster Comes Flying In!\",\"number\":596,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s battle with his old nemesis Smoker is interrupted by the arrival of a terrifying toxic blob - and the evil genius who created the monster!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全滅の危機 死のモンスター飛来\"},{\"title\":\"An Intense Battle! Caesar Exercises His True Power!\",\"number\":597,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji puts Nami`s beautiful body at risk to save the torso of a Samurai, and Luffy appears to have gained the upper hand in his battle with Ceasar - until the gas bag unleashes something sinister!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大激戦 シーザー真の能力発動!\"},{\"title\":\"A Samurai Who Can Cut Fire! Foxfire Kin`emon!\",\"number\":598,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Trafalgar Law finds trouble in the form of an old acquaintance, Chopper investigates the Master`s lab, and the mysterious Samurai shows what he can do with a full body!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炎切り裂く侍! 狐火の錦えもん!\"},{\"title\":\"Shocking! The True Identity of the Mystery Man Vergo!\",\"number\":599,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Master gathers his young test subjects, shocking secret identities are finally revealed, and the poisonous purple blob continues its march across the island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃! 謎の男ヴェルゴの正体!\"},{\"title\":\"Save the Children! The Master`s Evil Hands Close In!\",\"number\":600,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and Usopp get an unexpected helping hand in their fight to save the children, Chopper plots a daring escape attempt, and the Master markets his greatest weapon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"子供達を守れ! 迫るM[マスター]の魔の手\"},{\"title\":\"Shaking Up the New World! Caesar`s Horrendous Experiment!\",\"number\":601,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A desperate need for candy leads the children to return to the lab, and Caesar plans to show the world the new and improved version of Smiley!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新世界激震 シーザー悪夢の実験\"},{\"title\":\"The Deadliest Weapon of Mass Destruction in History! Shinokuni!\",\"number\":602,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the Straw Hats find themselves pursued by a deadly cloud of purple gas that turns everything living thing in its path into petrified statues of ash!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"史上最悪の殺戮兵器! シノクニ\"},{\"title\":\"Launching the Counter Attack! Luffy and Law`s Great Escape!\",\"number\":603,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law`s got a trick up his sleeve that could mean the difference between life and death. Zoro and company reunite with Nami and Sanji, but can they reach safety before being swallowed by a poisonous cloud!?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反撃開始! ルフィ・ロー大脱出\"},{\"title\":\"Get to Building R! The Pirate Alliance`s Great Advance!\",\"number\":604,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally reunited and returned to their proper bodies, the Straw Hats fall in line as Luffy and Law lead the charge to settle the score with Caesar - and save the children!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"めざせR棟! 海賊同盟快進撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Tashigi`s Tears! G-5`s Desperate Breakthrough Plan!\",\"number\":605,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Caesar hatches a plan to forever silence his enemies, Chopper races through the compound in search of the drugged children, and Tashigi`s men make the ultimate sacrifice!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"たしぎの涙 G5決死の突破作戦\"},{\"title\":\"The Treacherous Vice Admiral! Demon Bamboo Vergo!\",\"number\":606,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy races toward Caesar in the hopes of delivering a beating, Sanji saves a damsel in distress, and Chopper tries to prevent the children from eating the drugged candy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切りの中将! 鬼竹のヴェルゴ\"},{\"title\":\"A Fierce Battle Gets Heated! Luffy vs. Caesar!\",\"number\":607,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji and Vergo slug it out in a cloud of toxic gas, Law finds the room that could ruin the New World, and Luffy hopes to bring Caesar`s reign of terror to a brutal end!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白熱の激戦 ルフィVSシーザー\"},{\"title\":\"A Mastermind Underground! Doflamingo Makes His Move!\",\"number\":608,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Doflamingo orders Vergo to stop Law in his tracks, Luffy battles a deadly snowbird, and the rest of the Straw Hats attempt to survive the fiery breath of an angry dragon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇の黒幕! ドフラミンゴ動く!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Dies from Exposure?! The Spine-chilling Snow Woman Monet!\",\"number\":609,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy goes down fast after Monet puts a chill into him, and Trafalgar Law makes a desperate attempt to reclaim his heart during an electric battle with Vergo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ凍死!? 恐怖の雪女モネ!\"},{\"title\":\"Fists Collide! A Battle of the Two Vice Admirals!\",\"number\":610,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Smoker attacks Vergo for assaulting his men, Luffy meets something strange in the trash heap, and a flashback reveals the true depths of Caesar`s madness!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ぶつかる拳! 二人の中将の戦い\"},{\"title\":\"A Small Dragon! Momonosuke Appears!\",\"number\":611,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy befriends a dragon that used to be a human boy, and Captain Smoker continues his brutal battle with the villainous Vergo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"小さなドラゴン! モモの助現る\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Fight in a Blizzard! The Straw Hats vs. the Snow Woman!\",\"number\":612,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy hitches a ride on a dragon, Mocha tries to keep the Master`s candy away from her friends, and Zoro pits his steel against snow in a battle with Monet!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"吹雪の死闘 麦わらの一味VS雪女\"},{\"title\":\"Showing Off His Techniques! Zoro`s Formidable One-Sword Style!\",\"number\":613,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To survive his battle with Monet, Zoro must overcome his unwillingness to cut a woman. Elsewhere, Luffy puts a hungry dragon on his back and tries to punch his way out of the basement!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奥義炸裂! ゾロ最強の一刀流!\"},{\"title\":\"To Save Her Friends! Mocha Runs at the Risk of Her Life!\",\"number\":614,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper, Nami, and Robin watch in horror as Mocha makes a heartbreaking sacrifice in a courageous attempt to save the lives of her friends!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友達を守る! モチャ命がけの逃走\"},{\"title\":\"Brownbeard in Grief! Luffy Lands a Furious Blow!\",\"number\":615,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brownbeard heroically attempts to expose Caesar as a villain, the horrific truth about Punk Hazard is finally revealed, and Luffy puts the hurt on his gaseous enemy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"茶ひげ悲痛! ルフィ怒りの一撃\"},{\"title\":\"A Surprising Outcome! White Chase vs. Vergo!\",\"number\":616,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes Caesar pay for his crimes against the children, and Smoker risks his life for a chance to see Vergo fall in battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃の決着! 白猟[スモーカー]VSヴェルゴ!\"},{\"title\":\"Caesar`s Defeat! The Powerful Grizzly Magnum!\",\"number\":617,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law reaches the end of his epic battle with Vergo, and Luffy looks to land a devastating final blow on the murderous gasbag Caesar!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シーザー撃破! 最強の灰熊銃[グリズリー・マグナム]\"},{\"title\":\"Raid! An Assassin from Dressrosa!\",\"number\":618,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Word of Luffy and Law`s alliance spreads throughout the world, Chopper and Brook race to stay ahead of the deadly gas, and Joker sends a team to rescue Caesar!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"襲来! ドレスローザからの刺客\"},{\"title\":\"Running Wild! Invincible General Franky!\",\"number\":619,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky battles a lethal beauty, Caesar tries to strike a final blow against Smoker, and Monet detonates an explosive surprise that could spell doom for the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大暴れ! 無敵のフランキー将軍\"},{\"title\":\"A Critical Situation! Punk Hazard Explodes!\",\"number\":620,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Straw Hats and company flee the crumbling laboratory, Caesar`s desperate act of vengeance thwarts Joker`s plan to forever silence his enemies!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命! パンクハザード大爆発\"},{\"title\":\"Capture Caesar! General Cannon Blast!\",\"number\":621,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky continues his battle with Buffalo and Baby 5, Nami uses a mighty gust of wind to save the children from a deadly cloud of gas, and Usopp takes a shot at capturing Caesar!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シーザーを捕獲せよ 将軍砲[ジェネラルキャノン]炸裂\"},{\"title\":\"A Touching Reunion! Momonosuke and Kin`emon!\",\"number\":622,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A dragon regains his boyish form, a noble warrior once feared dead makes a shocking resurrection, and bitter enemies set aside their differences to enjoy a well-deserved feast!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"感動の再会! モモの助と錦えもん\"},{\"title\":\"It`s Time to Say Goodbye! Leaving Punk Hazard!\",\"number\":623,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The weary marines and the rescued children get teary-eyed as they say goodbye to the Straw Hats. Meanwhile, Law enters into treacherous negotiations with Joker!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"惜別の時 パンクハザード出航!\"},{\"title\":\"The G-5 Wiped Out! Doflamingo`s Sudden Attack!\",\"number\":624,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats set a course for Dressrosa, Law explains his alliance with Luffy, and Smoker`s refusal to reveal a secret earns him a serious beating from Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"G5壊滅! ドフラミンゴ急襲!\"},{\"title\":\"Intense! Aokiji vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":625,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Smoker`s life is spared by the arrival of an old friend. Law reveals some shocking news about Caesar`s partnership with Doflamingo, and Momonosuke uses his youth to get cozy with Robin and Nami!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緊迫! 青キジVSドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Caesar Goes Missing! The Pirate Alliance Makes a Sortie!\",\"number\":626,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Smooth seas stretch out before the Straw Hats as they leave Punk Hazard far behind. While they fear Donflamingo`s return and prepare to face him, another powerful foe lies in wait - one whose power could be their downfall!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消えたシーザー! 海賊同盟出撃\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Dies at Sea?! The Pirate Alliance Comes Apart!\",\"number\":627,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Breed uses his evil abilities to turn Chopper into a pet - and force Luffy and Law to fight to the death.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ海に死す!? 海賊同盟崩壊\"},{\"title\":\"A Major Turnaround! Luffy`s Angry Iron Fist Strikes!\",\"number\":628,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Law discovers the secret to Breed`s power, Luffy and his old friend the Kung Fu Dugong give the animal-abusing madman a beasty beat down!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大逆転! 炸裂ルフィ怒りの鉄拳\"},{\"title\":\"Startling! The Big News Shakes Up the New World!\",\"number\":629,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the world reacts to Doflamingo`s shocking announcement, Law and the Straw Hats plot the next move in their daring alliance, and a face from the past returns!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激震! 新世界動かす大ニュース\"},{\"title\":\"Explore! A Kingdom of Love and Passion: Dressrosa!\",\"number\":630,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and their friends set out to explore Dressrosa, a land full of beautiful women, delicious food, and live toys that walk amongst the living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冒険! 愛と情熱の国ドレスローザ\"},{\"title\":\"Full of Enthusiasm! The Corrida Colosseum!\",\"number\":631,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A blind warrior lays a beat down on a gang of masked thugs, Zorro chases the thief who stole his sword, and Luffy finds himself tempted by the promise of a fiery fruit!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱狂渦巻く コリーダコロシアム\"},{\"title\":\"A Dangerous Love! The Dancer Girl: Violet!\",\"number\":632,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro continues his hunt for the fairy who stole his sword, Sanji is smitten by a beautiful dancer, and Luffy prepares to fight for the Devil Fruit that belonged to his brother!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危険な恋 踊り娘ヴァイオレット\"},{\"title\":\"A Formidable, Unknown Warrior! Here Comes Lucy!\",\"number\":633,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji falls further under the spell of his new lady friend, and Luffy makes quite an impression as he gets to know the fighters competing for Ace`s Devil Fruit.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の無名戦士! ルーシー登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Pirate Noble! Cavendish!\",\"number\":634,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A gorgeous gladiator tells Luffy the story of the world`s greatest warrior, a masked mauler literally destroys the competition, and the Navy makes its presence felt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊貴公子キャベンディッシュ\"},{\"title\":\"The Fateful Reunion! Bellamy the Hyena!\",\"number\":635,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An old nemesis sees through Luffy`s disguise, Zoro finally catches up to the sword-stealing fairy, and Sanji`s skill at sniffing out snipers impresses his new lady friend!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"運命の再会 ハイエナのベラミー\"},{\"title\":\"A Super Rookie! Bartolomeo the Cannibal!\",\"number\":636,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bartolomeo and Bellamy take center stage in the latest round of the battle royal, but a slugger with a serious punch threatens to steal their thunder. Meanwhile, Luffy is targeted by an angry behemoth!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"超新星! 人食いのバルトロメオ\"},{\"title\":\"Big Names Duke It Out! The Heated Block B Battle!\",\"number\":637,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An old enemy of Garp`s reveals Luffy`s true identity, landing the Straw Hat captain in hot water with one of his fellow competitors. Meanwhile, the battle in Block B gets supremely brutal!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"群雄割拠! 白熱のBブロック!\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Blow! The Astonishing King Punch!\",\"number\":638,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky`s new robot friend promises to reveal the tragic secrets of Dressrosa, and a regal brawler prepares to throw a powerful punch that could destroy the entire colosseum!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一撃必殺! 驚異のキング・パンチ\"},{\"title\":\"The Fishing Fish Strike! Across the Deadly Iron Bridge!\",\"number\":639,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Law, Robin, Usopp, and Caesar attempt to survive a Fighting Fish attack, Sanji learns the heartbreaking truth about the beautiful woman who stole his heart!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闘魚襲来! 死の鉄橋を突破せよ\"},{\"title\":\"Explore! Fairies` Island - Green Bit!\",\"number\":640,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s turn to fight in the epic colosseum battle draws near, Zoro has an interesting encounter with a surprisingly strong fairy, and the thoughts in Sanji`s head shock his lady captor!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冒険! 妖精の島グリーンビッ\"},{\"title\":\"The Unknown World! The Tontatta Kingdom!\",\"number\":641,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji learns some disturbing news that could mean trouble for his friends, Luffy prepares for a fight, and Robin is captured by a village full of little people!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"知られざる世界 トンタッタ王国\"},{\"title\":\"The Stratagem of the Century! Doflamingo Makes His Move!\",\"number\":642,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite Sanji`s attempt to warn him, Law finds his life in danger after being ambushed by Doflamingo. Meanwhile, Luffy is unable to hide his true identity once the fists start flying!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世紀の謀略 ドフラミンゴ動\"},{\"title\":\"Shaking Heaven and Earth! Admiral Fujitora`s Power!\",\"number\":643,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After his plan falls apart, Law must fight for his life against two powerful opponents. Elsewhere, Sanji bids a touching goodbye to his special lady friend, and Luffy tangles with Brutal Bull!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天地ゆるがす! 大将藤虎の実力\"},{\"title\":\"A Blow of Anger! A Giant vs. Lucy!\",\"number\":644,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami, Chopper, and Brook are grotesquely transformed by a hideous woman who fancies herself an artist. Back at the colosseum, Luffy gets serious when his new friend falls victim to a giant attack!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りの一撃! 巨人VSルーシー\"},{\"title\":\"Destruction Cannon Blasts! Lucy in Trouble!\",\"number\":645,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and his fairy friend argue over directions, Trafalgar Law finds himself outnumbered in his battle with Doflamingo, and Luffy`s latest opponent packs an explosive punch!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"破壊砲炸裂! ルーシー危機一髪\"},{\"title\":\"The Legendary Pirate! Don Chinjao!\",\"number\":646,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Nami, Chopper, and Brook attempt to take back the Sunny, Luffy and the monstrous mauler Don Chinjao take their brutal grudge match to a legendary level!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の海賊 首領・チンジャオ!\"},{\"title\":\"Light and Shadow! Darkness Behind Dressrosa!\",\"number\":647,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s battle with Don Chinjao heats up, Franky learns the tragic truth behind Dressrosa`s mysterious toy population, and Robin and Usopp prepare to join their little friends in battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"光と影 ドレスローザに潜む闇!\"},{\"title\":\"Making a Sortie! The Legendary Hero Usoland!\",\"number\":648,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy continues his battle with Don Chinjao, Franky and Zoro are reunited in the land of the little people, and Law is wounded in a revealing, face-to-face showdown with Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"出撃 伝説のヒーローウソランド\"},{\"title\":\"The Fierce Battle Coming to the End! Lucy vs. Chinjao!\",\"number\":649,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A flashback reveals the story of how Garp changed Chinjao`s world forever. Back in the present, Luffy and his opponent trade ferocious blows that literally rock the colosseum!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激戦決着! ルーシーVSチンジャオ!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy and the Gladiator of Fate: Rebecca!\",\"number\":650,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During a break between battles, Luffy is attacked by an angry rival, but a beautiful gladiator with mysterious motives offers him food - and a place to rest.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィと宿命の剣闘士レベッカ\"},{\"title\":\"Protect You to the End! Rebecca and the Toy Soldier!\",\"number\":651,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the moments before battle, the beautiful gladiator Rebecca flashes back to the tragic events of her childhood and the toy soldier who became her constant companion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"守り抜く! レベッカとおもちゃの兵隊\"},{\"title\":\"The Last - and Bloodiest - Block! Block D Battle Begins!\",\"number\":652,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The bloodthirsty crowd hurls insults at Rebecca as the battle of Block D begins. On the other side of the island, Law finds himself on the losing end of his battle with Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の超激戦区 Dブロック開戦\"},{\"title\":\"A Decisive Battle! Giolla vs. the Straw Hats!\",\"number\":653,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook`s trickery springs the Straw Hats from their artistic prison, but their failure to cuff the culprit means they`ll need help from a cola-powered cannon to emerge victorious!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決戦! ジョーラVS麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"Beautiful Sword! Cavendish of the White Horse!\",\"number\":654,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Cavendish wins over the female fans during the Block D battle, Luffy keeps an eye on Rebecca, and Sanji heads toward a heated collision with Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"美剣! 白馬のキャベンディッシュ\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Clash! Sanji vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":655,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji`s battle with Doflamingo is interrupted by Law`s sudden arrival, and Rebecca continues her impressive showing in the battle of Block D!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大決戦! サンジVSドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Rebecca`s Special Attack! Back-to-the-Water Dance!\",\"number\":656,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law begins a deadly, face-to-face battle with Doflamingo, Zoro enlists the aid of a star struck gladiator, and Rebecca continues to impresses Luffy with her unique fighting style!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"レベッカの死の剣! 背水の剣舞\"},{\"title\":\"The Most Violent Fighter! Logan vs. Rebecca!\",\"number\":657,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy learns the truth about life in Dressrosa under Doflamingo`s reign. Meanwhile, Rebecca needs help from a friend to survive her bone-crushing battle with Logan!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最凶の戦士! ローガンVSレベッカ\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Surprise! A True Identity of the Toy Soldier!\",\"number\":658,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rebecca`s battle continues, a madman turns a gladiator into a play thing, and the brave little toy soldier reveals his painful past – and the tragic truth behind King Riku`s fall from power!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃! おもちゃの兵隊の正体!\"},{\"title\":\"A Horrible Past! The Secret of Dressrosa!\",\"number\":659,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy learns the truth about life in Dressrosa under Doflamingo`s reign. Meanwhile, Rebecca needs help from a friend to survive her bone-crushing battle with Logan!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦慄の過去! ドレスローザの秘密\"},{\"title\":\"A Nightmare! The Tragic Night of Dressrosa!\",\"number\":660,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rebecca continues her valiant stand in the arena of battle, Luffy is reunited with Zoro, and the heartbreaking story of how Doflamingo conquered Dressrosa continues!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢! ドレスローザ悲劇の一夜\"},{\"title\":\"A Showdown Between the Warlords! Law vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":661,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law`s power begins to fade, making him an easy target for Doflamingo`s vicious attacks. Meanwhile, Franky begs Luffy to let him fight alongside Soldier and the little people!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"七武海対決 ローVSドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Two Great Rivals Meet Each Other! Straw Hat and Heavenly Demon!\",\"number\":662,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy sets his sights on a showdown with Doflamingo in a desperate attempt to save Law`s life. Sanji, Nami, Chopper, and Brook are attacked by a very deadly foe!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"両雄相まみえる! 麦わらと天夜叉\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Astonished! The Man Who Inherits Ace`s Will!\",\"number\":663,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Soldier reveals his daring plan to return all the toys to their human forms, and Luffy has an emotional encounter with someone from his very distant past!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ驚愕 エースの意志を継ぐ男\"},{\"title\":\"Operation SOP Starts! Usoland Charges Forth!\",\"number\":664,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp and Robin join the little people on their mission to turn the toys back into humans, Franky wreaks havoc at the toy house, and Rebecca continues her gladiator battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"SOP作戦開始 ウソランド突撃\"},{\"title\":\"A Burning Passion! Rebecca vs. Suleiman!\",\"number\":665,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro attracts unwanted attention by upsetting a child, Soldier risks his life to lead the attack on Doflamingo, and Rebecca struggles to survive the brutal battle of Block D!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱き思い レベッカVSスレイマン\"},{\"title\":\"The End of the Match?! A Surprising Result of Block D!\",\"number\":666,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rebecca survives an encounter with an opponent`s deadly alter ego, Franky continues his battle with a man who dresses like a baby, and Violet offers to sneak Luffy into the palace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝者決定!? Dブロック衝撃の結末\"},{\"title\":\"The Admiral`s Decision! Fujitora vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":667,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky has his hands full battling a host of enemies at the Toy House, Violet leads Luffy to a secret entrance into the palace, and Fujitora issues Doflamingo a grave warning!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大将の決断 藤虎VSドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Round Starts! Diamante the Hero Shows Up!\",\"number\":668,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Diamante`s unique abilities and the presence of special Fighting Fish add a deadly wrinkle to the tournament`s final round. Elsewhere, Luffy spoils any chance of sneaking up on Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決勝開始 英雄ディアマンテ登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Moving Castle! The Top Executive Pica Rises Up!\",\"number\":669,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy tangles with a monster made of stone, Franky bursts into flames after getting shot by a cannon, and the courageous little people hatch a plan to turn the toys back into humans!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動く城! 最高幹部ピーカ出現\"},{\"title\":\"Dragon Claw Strikes! Lucy`s Intimidating Attack!\",\"number\":670,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Soldier takes a beating from a Doflamingo Family Executive, Lucy shows off a powerful new fighting style, and Zoro pushes his blades to the breaking point in a showdown with a man made of stone!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"竜の爪炸裂! ルーシー脅威の一撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Defeat Sugar! The Army of the Little People Charges!\",\"number\":671,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro repeatedly slices his stone opponent into pieces, but he can`t find a way to make the bad guy stay down. Meanwhile, the bravery of the little people could get them turned into toys!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"打倒シュガー 小人の兵隊突撃!\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Light of Hope! The Secret of Our Commander!\",\"number\":672,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Tontattas are devastated by Trebol’s furious attack, but as Usopp tries to convince Leo to abort the operation, Leo tells him about their commander Toy Soldier’s stunning true identity! Meanwhile, with the help of another Tontatta group, the Toy Soldier finally shakes off Lao G and gets moving again!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の光 我らが隊長の秘密!\"},{\"title\":\"The Rupture Human! Gladius Blows Up Big Time!\",\"number\":673,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro continues his deadly duel with the nearly-indestructible Pica! While the Toy Soldier narrowly escapes Lao G only to come face to face with Gladius! Luffy continues his mad dash to the top of the palace to face Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"破裂[パンク]人間 グラディウス大爆発!\"},{\"title\":\"A Liar! Usoland on the Run!\",\"number\":674,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the Tontattas beaten, Robin turned into a toy, and Luffy, Franky, and the others all busy elsewhere, Usopp is the last hope for Operation SOP! But will he be able to muster the confidence and courage to face the terrible Trebol? Among the cries of the Tontattas, Usopp has a difficult decision to make - run and fight another day or face his own doom and challenge Trebol!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウソつきウソランド逃走中!\"},{\"title\":\"A Fateful Encounter! Kyros and King Riku!\",\"number\":675,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The deep and tragic story of Kyros is revealed! The legend of this invincible gladiator is tied up with the royal family of Dressrosa! Meanwhile, Trebol`s defeat at the hands of Usopp is not a sure thing yet!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"運命の出会い キュロスとリク王\"},{\"title\":\"The Operation Failed! Usoland the Hero Dies?!\",\"number\":676,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Royal Palace, Viola, Luffy, and the Toy Soldier have hidden themselves outside Doflamingo`s chamber, only to have more enemies approach from behind, leaving them surrounded! Meanwhile, Franky is knocked out cold by the Navy, and all hopes rest on Usopp to provide the miracle everyone needs!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"作戦失敗! 英雄ウソランド死す!?\"},{\"title\":\"The Legend Is Back! Kyros` All-out Blow!\",\"number\":677,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp manages to knock Sugar out and Operation SOP is accomplished! The toys in Dressrosa start turning back to their original forms and the people are slowly realizing who Doflamingo really is! In the meantime, the legendary hero Kyros reverts to his true form - and this mighty champion of the Colosseum has a score to settle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説復活! キュロス渾身の一撃\"},{\"title\":\"The Fire Fist Strikes! The Flare-Flare Fruit Power Returns!\",\"number\":678,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kyros finally taking down Doflamingo leaves Doflamingo’s clan shocked! Meanwhile at the Colosseum, Rebecca gets her memories of her loving father Kyros back, and Sabo makes a move to end the championship battle by blowing up the whole ring! Will he be able to snag the Flare-Flare Fruit?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火拳炸裂! 復活メラメラの実の力\"},{\"title\":\"Dashing onto the Scene! The Chief of Staff of the Revolutionary Army, Sabo!\",\"number\":679,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy hurries to free Law, but with their pirate alliance dissolved, will Law still see Luffy as an ally? Meanwhile, Usopp has convinced his new-found followers to destroy the factory! Doflamingo`s defeat has thrown Dressrosa into chaos, but the Young Master may have a trick left up his sleeve...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"颯爽登場 革命軍参謀総長サボ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil`s Trap! A Dressrosa Extermination Plan!\",\"number\":680,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The mystery of Doflamingo`s return from the dead is revealed! But there isn`t much time to ponder how it happened, as his plan to silence the country of Dressrosa unfolds, spelling doom for the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔の罠 ドレスローザ殲滅作戦\"},{\"title\":\"The 500 Million Berry Men! Target: Usoland!\",\"number\":681,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the people of Dressrosa see their friends and loved ones slaughter each other under the manipulation of Doflamingo, memories of 10 years ago rush back, and the truth of that event becomes clear. Doflamingo announces the rules for his deadly game - targeting Luffy, King Riku, and Law, but with the highest bounty reserved for Usopp!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五億の男 狙われたウソランド!\"},{\"title\":\"Breaking Through Enemy Lines! Luffy and Zoro Launch the Counter-Attack!\",\"number\":682,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Doflamingo and Fujitora`s agreement to not engage each other lasts for the moment - meaning all eyes are turned towards taking down the Straw Hats and claiming the rewards! And as Luffy starts heading to the Royal Palace along with Zoro and Law, Fujitora stands in his way!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵陣突破 ルフィ・ゾロ反撃開始\"},{\"title\":\"With a Rumbling of the Ground! The God of Destruction - Giant Pica Descends!\",\"number\":683,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin, Usopp, the Tontatta`s and the others make moves to rejoin Luffy as Doflamingo`s deadly game rages on! Meanwhile, Kin`emon makes it to the trash heap in his search for his friend Kanjuro - just as Pica emerges in the town and changes the stakes of the game!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大地鳴動 破壊神巨大ピーカ降臨\"},{\"title\":\"Gathering into a Powerful Front! Luffy and a Group of Brutal Warriors!\",\"number\":684,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Luffy and the others recovering from Pica`s attack, the game is afoot! Luffy has just enough time to regroup and set out to find Doflamingo, only to find that the dastardly Warlord has more enemies than he might realize! A strange argument breaks out - to decide who gets to take down Doflamingo once and for all!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大集結! ルフィと凶悪戦士軍団\"},{\"title\":\"Steady Progress! Luffy`s Army vs. Pica!\",\"number\":685,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Don Chin Jao and Elizabello successfully break Pica’s giant arm but the rock giant is unfazed and starts throwing even more destructive punches at Luffy and his band of unwanted collaborators! Meanwhile, Navy Admiral Fujitora moves into action, summoning all the Navy soldiers on the island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"快進撃! ルフィ軍団VSピーカ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Shocking Confession! Law`s Soulful Vow!\",\"number\":686,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Moocy fast approach the showdown with Doflamingo - while the others with a beef against him continue to tag along. Meanwhile, Violet finds the key to Law`s handcuffs, and Rebecca pledges to deliver it to him. Finally, Law`s reason for despising Doflamingo is revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃告白! ロー熱き魂の誓い!\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Collision! Chief of Staff - Sabo vs. Admiral Fujitora!\",\"number\":687,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes headway toward Doflamingo`s refuge, making his way through Doflamingo`s guards, while down below Admiral Fujitora faces off against Sabo, who has the power of the Fire Fist from eating the Flare-Flare Fruit! But with Fujitora`s ability to call down a meteor, will Sabo have to power to save himself?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大激突! 参謀総長サボVS大将藤虎\"},{\"title\":\"A Desperate Situation! Luffy Gets Caught in a Trap!\",\"number\":688,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy cuts a lucky break as Kelly Funk shows him a shortcut to the Palace! But all may not be as it seems... Meanwhile, Franky and Zoro are locked in one-on-one duels, while Robin, Rebecca, and Bartolomeo enlist the help of the Tontattas to catch up with Luffy and Law!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命 罠にかかったルフィ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Great Escape! Luffy`s Tide-Turning Elephant Gun!\",\"number\":689,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Penned in at the bottom of a well, Luffy and Law are caught in a trap! But someone has come to save them who they least expect! Meanwhile, the Tontattas help Franky break in to the SMILE factory, and Bartolomeo resorts to tactics he used in the Colosseum to defend himself and protect Robin and Rebecca!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大脱出! ルフィ起死回生の象銃[エレファントガン]\"},{\"title\":\"A United Front! Luffy`s Breakthrough to the Victory!\",\"number\":690,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Tontattas locate their captive comrades and seem to be able to get the message to them - the prison break is on! Meanwhile, heavy-hitters from the Colosseum turn from wringing each other`s necks towards a unified plan, which might just be enough to get Luffy the chance to make it to a final showdown with Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"共同戦線 ルフィ勝利への突破口\"},{\"title\":\"The Second Samurai! Evening Shower Kanjuro Appears!\",\"number\":691,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hidden far underground, Kin`emon finds his old friend Kanjuro, whose powers allow the two to, quickly, but not elegantly, escape to the surface! Meanwhile, Cavendish shares his fears that the \\\"Birdcage\\\" game Doflamingo is playing has been rigged all along - and that the only way to win is to take the Warlord down!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二人目の侍 夕立ちカン十郎登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Hard-Fought Battle Against Pica! Zoro`s Deadly Attack!\",\"number\":692,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Tontattas are in full revolt! But can they keep their wits about them long enough to make it out? Meanwhile, Zoro finally gains the upper hand against Pica, and Franky finds a way to deal with Señor Pink.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奮闘とのピーカ ゾロ一とどめの一撃\"},{\"title\":\"The Little People`s Princess! Captive Mansherry!\",\"number\":693,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky finally makes it into the factory and the Tontattas are reunited with their captive friends! But Princess Mansherry is nowhere to be found. Factory manager Kuween becomes irate when ignored and launches an attack on Franky while Señor Pink, wise to Frankie`s deception, arrives on the scene ready for a manly showdown!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"小人の姫 囚われたのマンシェリー\"},{\"title\":\"Invincible! A Gruesome Army of Headcracker Dolls!\",\"number\":694,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin, Rebecca, and Bartolomeo draw closer to the Flower Field on the fourth level of the Royal Palace plateau, but a sudden attack by Gladius exploding spheres sends Robin and Bartolomeo hurtling towards the level below - and directly into Luffy and the others` battle with the creepy Headcracker Dolls!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"不死身! 恐怖の頭割り人形軍団\"},{\"title\":\"Risking Their Lives! Luffy Is the Trump Card for Victory!\",\"number\":695,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rebecca makes it to the Flower Field alone, but unfortunately finds company there that is less than friendly! Meanwhile, Bartolomeo pushes himself to the limit in order to help Luffy advance, but does he leave himself vulnerable in the process? Meanwhile, Sabo tastes Fujitora`s full might!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"命かけて! ルフィは勝利の切り札\"},{\"title\":\"A Tearful Reunion! Rebecca and Kyros!\",\"number\":696,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Diamante has Rebecca pinned and completely overpowered. If only the Soldier-san of her youth were able to protect her! Meanwhile, Luffy and Law finally surmount incredible odds to land themselves in striking distance of Doflamingo -- but Sugar stands in their way!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙の再会 レベッカとキュロス\"},{\"title\":\"One Shot One Kill! The Man Who Will Save Dressrosa!\",\"number\":697,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp uses Viola`s Clairvoyance to prepare his ammunition to take Sugar out! But the slightest hesitation now will spell disaster -- and the end of Luffy! Luckily for the Straw Hats, Usopp`s ammunition has been specially designed for this specific situation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一撃必殺 ドレスローザを救う男\"},{\"title\":\"Anger Erupts! Luffy and Law`s Ultimate Stratagem!\",\"number\":698,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The final showdown with Doflamingo begins, but the Warlord still has several tricks up his sleeve - including turning one of Luffy`s own friends against him! Meanwhile Franky and Señor Pink are in a standoff to find out who is the coolest.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒り爆発 ルフィ・ロー最強の秘策\"},{\"title\":\"A Noble Family! The True Identity of Doflamingo!\",\"number\":699,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"All hopes rest on Luffy and Law being able to take down Doflamingo; but the Warlord has other plans in mind as he gives the two the fight of their lives, and reveals his true, shocking history! Meanwhile, Sabo finds out Fujitora’s true intention…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"気高き一族 ドフラミンゴの正体!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ultimate Power! The Secret of the Op-Op Fruit!\",\"number\":700,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Fujitora`s stalemate arousing suspicion in the Navy ranks, Law and Luffy stand seconds away from execution at the hand of Doflamingo! But before he dispatches them both, he shares the secret of his sway over the Celestial Dragons!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"究極の力 オペオペの実の秘密!\"},{\"title\":\"Sad Memories! Law the Boy from the White Town!\",\"number\":701,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The horrible secret of Flevance, the White Town, is revealed, giving clues to Law`s traumatic past! A rage born from the lies of the World Government created a child who had the will to kill Corazon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しき記憶 白い町の少年ロー!\"},{\"title\":\"A Celestial Dragon! Doffy`s Stormy Past!\",\"number\":702,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law`s attack on Corazon looks less successful than he thought! And after he`s accepted into the Doflamingo Family, Corazon`s mysterious silence hides a fact that may save Law`s life - and a hidden danger Law must face in Doflamingo himself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天竜人! ドフィの壮絶なる過去\"},{\"title\":\"A Rocky Road! Law and Corazon`s Journey of Life!\",\"number\":703,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Things grow stranger for Law as he learns the secret behind why Corazon feigns being mute! But the mysterious Corazon`s actions are only beginning to baffle Law as he takes him on a journey to cure his White Lead Disease.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"苦難の道 ローとコラソン命の旅\"},{\"title\":\"The Time Is Ticking Down! Seize the Op-Op Fruit!\",\"number\":704,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Corazon`s double-dealing with the Navy raises suspicions both with Doflamingo and Law. But all that is secondary as Corazon finally has a chance to grab the Op-Op Fruit during a staged handoff arranged by the Government.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"時迫る! オペオペの実を奪え!\"},{\"title\":\"The Moment of Resolution! Corazon`s Farewell Smile!\",\"number\":705,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Op-Op Fruit is in Corazon`s hands! But the price he paid to get it might be too high... When Law goes for help, unfortunate coincidences intervene and leave the two vulnerable! Meanwhile, Doflamingo and his clan finally land at Minion Island; the location of Corazon and Law!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"覚悟の時 コラソン別れの笑顔!\"},{\"title\":\"Advance, Law! The Kindhearted Man`s Final Fight!\",\"number\":706,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Doflamingo and his Family begin to zero in on Corazon and Law`s whereabouts, but Corazon has a plan to hide Law long enough to let him escape - even if that means sacrificing his own life. However, when things turn sour, it`s a chain of lucky coincidences that allows the plan to be set into motion - almost as though someone or something is keeping Law alive!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"行けロー 優しき男最期の戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"To Be Free! Law`s Injection Shot Blasts!\",\"number\":707,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet runs down the status of the open battles raging in Dressrosa - the Straw Hats, the Tontattas, the executives of the Doflamingo Family - all of them clash around the island, but it`s Law`s revelation to Doflamingo that moves the action forward!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自由へ! ロー注射[インジェクション]ショット炸裂\"},{\"title\":\"An Intense Battle! Law vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":708,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy continues to battle Fake-mingo, but keeps accidentally battling Bellamy instead. Meanwhile the tide of battle turns against Law as painful scars from the past resurface. And Zoro gets unexpected help in his battle with Pica.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱き闘い ローVSドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"A Decisive Battle Against the Executives! Proud Hajrudin!\",\"number\":709,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bellamy escapes Doflamingo`s control, but it might be too late. His long history with Doflamingo unfolds and leads to an inglorious end. Meanwhile, Hajrudin has been beaten down, but a fire still burns in him to pay back the favor he owes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"幹部決戦 誇り高きハイルディン\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle of Love! The New Leader Sai vs. Baby 5!\",\"number\":710,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lao G and Don Chin Jao duke it out as each brings their most devastating attacks to the battle. But a misunderstanding caused by Baby 5 has Sai and Don Chin Jao distracted - are they distracted enough for Lao G to gain the upper hand?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"愛の決戦 新棟梁サイVS[たい]ベビー5\"},{\"title\":\"The Man`s Pride! Bellamy`s Last Charge!\",\"number\":711,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law is at the whim of Doflamingo and Trebol, while Luffy still has to deal with Bellamy, who fights to keep his honor even after being released by Doflamingo! Meanwhile, Gladius is about to detonate the ground around Cavendish and Bartolomeo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の意地 ベラミー最期の突撃!\"},{\"title\":\"A Strong Wind and a Surge! Hakuba vs. Dellinger!\",\"number\":712,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious force that resembles Cavendish menaces the battlefield - but while it appears to help Bartolomeo and the others at first, it sets its sights on Robin! Meanwhile, the deeply-wounded Ideo sees Dellinger’s horrible true nature!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"疾風怒濤 ハクバVS[たい]デリンジャー\"},{\"title\":\"Barrier-Barrier! Homage God Fist Strikes!\",\"number\":713,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bartolomeo is in a neck and neck battle against Gladius to save Robin, and is faced with an impossible dilemma. With all his options leading to their defeat, can his cunning ploy save the day? Meanwhile, Robin is face to face with Cavendish, but his evil aspect Hakuba keeps complicating the situation more!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"バリバリ オマージュ神拳発動!\"},{\"title\":\"The Healing Princess! Save Mansherry!\",\"number\":714,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Princess Mansherry`s amazing power - to heal living beings completely - is in the hands of the Donquixote executive. If she is able to heal all the executives who`ve gone down in battle - the Straw Hats and their allies stand no chance! It`s up to Leo to save the day!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"癒しの姫 マンシェリーを救え!\"},{\"title\":\"The Manly Duel! Senor`s Elegy of Love!\",\"number\":715,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Señor Pink and Franky continue their knock-down, drag-out, manly fight. As both of them are pushed to their limits, we learn Señor`s tragic past! Meanwhile, Princess Mansherry`s rescue hits a snag as she stubbornly refuses to leave!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の決闘 セニョール愛の挽歌\"},{\"title\":\"Stardust of Death! Diamante`s Storm of Vicious Attacks!\",\"number\":716,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky and Señor Pink end their harrowing duel in a manly way - but victory knocks the wind out of even the winner`s sails! Meanwhile, Diamante and Kyros struggle desperately on the Sunflower Field, each demonstrating their extreme prowess even in near defeat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死の星屑 ディアマンテ猛攻の嵐\"},{\"title\":\"Trueno Bastardo! Kyros` Furious Strike!\",\"number\":717,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kyros, unbowed by Diamante`s vicious attacks, fights back with the anger and retribution of all of Dressrosa in order to fulfill his promise to protect Rebecca. If he is successful, only a few executives will remain, setting the stage for the Straw Hats` victory.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雷の破壊剣[トゥルエノバスタード] キュロス怒りの一撃\"},{\"title\":\"Moving Across the Ground! The Giant Statue Pica`s Surprise Maneuver!\",\"number\":718,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pica loses his temper and turns his full wrath against King Riku, whom he hopes to destroy, ending the revolution against Doflamingo. Meanwhile, Zoro, who has been distracted by Pica and drawn far from the battle, has to hatch a plan to save the king!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大地横断 巨像ピーカ奇襲作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"A Decisive Battle in Midair! Zoro`s New Special Secret Technique Blasts!\",\"number\":719,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the lives of King Riku, Usopp, and the others on the old King`s Plateau in the balance, Zoro must dig deep and discover a powerful technique to counter Pica`s near-unstoppable onslaught. Meanwhile, King Riku ponders what it means to be a good king.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空中決戦 ゾロ新必殺奥義炸裂!\"},{\"title\":\"So Long! Bellamy`s Farewell Blow!\",\"number\":720,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro finishes off Pica, and those below his crumbling body rush to find shelter. Meanwhile, the Tontattas finish up demolishing the SMILE Factory, and Luffy`s hand is forced in his duel with Bellamy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"あばよ! ベラミー別れの一撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Law Dies! Luffy`s Raging Onslaught!\",\"number\":721,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Taking down Bellamy only enrages Luffy in his fight against Doflamingo, his anger multiplying when he finds Law`s lifeless body! Meanwhile, Doflamingo takes the next step to end the game he started, which will endanger everybody in Dressrosa!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロー死す ルフィ憤怒の猛攻撃!\"},{\"title\":\"A Blade of Tenacity! The Gamma Knife Counterattack!\",\"number\":722,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Birdcage draws tighter and tighter around Dressrosa, threatening to destroy all life on the island kingdom! Meanwhile, Doflamingo stands down Luffy for a final confrontation, but a surprising twist shocks everyone on the top of the Royal Palace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"執念の刃 逆襲のガンマナイフ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Collision of Haki! Luffy vs. Doflamingo!\",\"number\":723,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law`s attack proves powerful - but Doflamingo`s power has depths which he and Luffy haven`t bargained for. When Doflamingo makes his counterattack, Luffy stares him down with an amazing power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"覇気激突 ルフィVS[たい]ドフラミンゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Unassailable! The Stunning Secret of Trebol!\",\"number\":724,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Trebol`s wrath is fully inflamed as Law summons enough energy to speak, denouncing the Doflamingo Family executives as pawns in Doflamingo`s game. But Law gathers enough energy to do more than just speak out.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"攻撃不能 トレーボル衝撃の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Anger Erupts! I Will Take Everything Upon Myself!\",\"number\":725,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Cavendish has to make a difficult decision when the severely wounded Law begs him to be left behind. Meanwhile, seeing even his Second Gear or Third Gear attacks aren`t working against Doflamingo, Luffy decides to use his ultimate technique!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒り爆発 おれが全部引き受ける\"},{\"title\":\"Fourth Gear! The Phenomenal Bounce-Man!\",\"number\":726,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Doflamingo duke it out while the Birdcage tightens its grip on Dressrosa! Zoro sets off with a plan to stop it from slicing apart the country, while Luffy`s Fourth Gear proves quite potent against Doflamingo!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ギア4[フォース]! 驚異のバウンドマン!\"},{\"title\":\"A Massive Counterattack! Doflamingo`s Awakening!\",\"number\":727,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Birdcage continues its merciless constriction, sending the residents of Dressrosa fleeing towards the center of the island, while King Riku calls out to his people; survive long enough for Luffy to vanquish the last of the royal family - Doflamingo himself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大逆襲! ドフラミンゴの覚醒!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy! An All-Out Leo Bazooka!\",\"number\":728,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fourth Gear gives Luffy the power he needs to head off Doflamingo at every strike! But the energy required to keep Fourth Gear going starts to take a toll on Luffy. Will he have enough left to finish the job?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ! 渾身の獅子[レオ]バズーカ\"},{\"title\":\"Flame Dragon King! Protect Luffy`s Life!\",\"number\":729,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bounce-man`s power has drained Luffy, leaving him in need of a rest before he can reuse his Haki, but luckily the gladiators from the Colosseum have come around and are focusing on taking down Doflamingo! Sabo steps in at a crucial moment to defend his brother, Luffy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火炎竜王 ルフィの命を守りぬけ\"},{\"title\":\"Tears of Miracles! Mansherry`s Fight!\",\"number\":730,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Luffy and so many of the Straw Hats` allies incapacitated, victory seems inevitable for Doflamingo - but the compassion of Mansherry may be enough to turn the tide and renew their hope - to stop the Birdcage!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡の涙 マンシェリーの戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"As Long As We Breathe! Stop the Deadly Birdcage!\",\"number\":731,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With just over a minute to spare, everyone in Dressrosa turns their efforts towards slowing down the Birdcage as it squeezes the life out of the country! Meanwhile, Viola seeks Doflamingo out herself, for a shocking confrontation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"命の限り 死の鳥カゴを止めろ!\"},{\"title\":\"Dead or Alive! A Fateful Countdown!\",\"number\":732,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Only a bit more time remains before Luffy returns to the scene! But as time slips by, those who had been roused by Princess Mansherry`s powers begin to falter! Meanwhile, Rebecca, under the control of Doflamingo, is about to attack Viola!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生か死か 運命のカウントダウン\"},{\"title\":\"Attack on a Celestial! Luffy`s King Kong Gun of Anger!\",\"number\":733,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy regains enough Haki to face off against Doflamingo, but his health is still poor. With the Birdcage closing in, is there a technique left in his repertoire that is strong enough to take down Doflamingo?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天を討つ ルフィ怒りの大猿王銃[キングコングガン]\"},{\"title\":\"To Be Free! Dressrosa`s Delight!\",\"number\":734,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Doflamingo thoroughly quashed and the Birdcage collapsing, the people of Dressrosa shed tears of joy remembering the hardships they`ve endured, and the actions taken by Luffy and the others to free them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自由へ! 喜びのドレスローザ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Unheard-of! Admiral Fujitora`s Surprising Decision!\",\"number\":735,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jesus Burgess of the Blackbeard Pirates tries to agitate Sabo, mocking Ace`s final words in order to unsettle him enough that he can try to steal the Flare-Flare Fruit! Meanwhile, people of Dressrosa beg King Riku to resume the crown when Navy Admiral Fujitora steps in and takes a stunning action!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"前代未聞 大将藤虎衝撃の決断!\"},{\"title\":\"Sending a Shockwave! The Worst Generation Goes Into Action!\",\"number\":736,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Repercussions of Doflamingo`s defeat reverberate around the world! Fujitora`s actions put the Navy in a tight spot, and the \\\"Worst Generation\\\" beings to stir into action!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激震走る 動き出す最悪の世代!\"},{\"title\":\"The Birth of the Legend! The Adventures of the Revolutionary Warrior Sabo!\",\"number\":737,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The combatants in the battle for Dressrosa can finally begin to recoup, but those who stay awake are treated to the story of how Sabo joined the Revolutionary Army!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説誕生 革命戦士サボの冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"The Brothers` Bond! The Untold Story Behind Luffy and Sabo`s Reunion!\",\"number\":738,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sabo recounts his surprising reunion with Luffy at the Colosseum as the Straw Hats and the others continue to recoup. Meanwhile, Fujitora gambles on how to make his next move - and the odds are in Luffy`s favor!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兄弟の絆 ルフィ・サボ再会秘話\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Creature! One of the Four Emperors: Kaido, King of the Beasts!\",\"number\":739,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Sabo departs, our attention shifts to the other Straw Hats waging a fierce battle on a mysterious island. And a new drama is set into motion as ill portents fall from the sky!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の生物 四皇・百獣のカイドウ\"},{\"title\":\"Fujitora Takes Action! The Complete Siege of the Straw Hats!\",\"number\":740,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Luffy and the others begin to come to their senses, major players in the Navy arrive to search Dressrosa for the Straw Hats! Also, Rebecca`s history is whitewashed with a fake cover story - but why?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藤虎動く 麦わらの一味完全包囲網\"},{\"title\":\"A State of Emergency! Rebecca Is Kidnapped!\",\"number\":741,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fujitora`s flirting with chance has turned out poorly for the Straw Hats as the full Navy force bears down on Dressrosa searching for the pirates! Luffy and the others make a mad dash for the east port to get off the island, but not without finishing up a piece of business...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"非常事態 さらわれたレベッカ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Bond Between Father and Daughter! Kyros and Rebecca!\",\"number\":742,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rebecca has precious little time to follow Luffy`s lead and make it to Kyros. Can she make it in time? Meanwhile, Fujitora is closing in on Bartolomeo and the other Colosseum warriors while Trafalgar Law faces the shadows of his past!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父娘[おやこ]の絆 キュロスとレベッカ!\"},{\"title\":\"Men`s Pride! Luffy vs. Fujitora, Head-to-Head!\",\"number\":743,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law and Sengoku share memories of Corazon, and the secret of Trafalgar Law`s name. Meanwhile, Fujitora uses the destruction caused by the battle in Dressrosa as a weapon, and squares off one-on-one with Luffy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の意地 ルフィVS[たい]藤虎真向勝負\"},{\"title\":\"No Way Out! Admiral Fujitora`s Ruthless Pursuit!\",\"number\":744,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The people of Dressrosa show their appreciation to the Straw Hats one last time by foiling Fujitora`s strategy. As Luffy and the others are able to finally make their break from the island, however, an unbelievable new chapter opens in the story of the Straw Hat Pirates!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逃場無し 大将藤虎非情の追撃!\"},{\"title\":\"Sons` Cups! The Straw Hat Fleet Is Formed!\",\"number\":745,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With newfound allies won in the battle at Dressrosa, and as the Navy watches, Luffy and the Straw Hats depart Dressrosa for open water. But will Luffy accept the oath of allegiance given by his new fleet?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"子分の盃 結成! 麦わら大船団!\"},{\"title\":\"The Numerous Rivals Struggle Amongst Themselves! The Raging Monsters of the New World\",\"number\":746,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the Straw Hats are underway, Doflamingo has serious predictions for the upset of the world order! Meanwhile, the recent actions in Dressrosa have led to surprising results!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"群雄割拠 荒狂う新世界の怪物達\"},{\"title\":\"The Silver Fortress! Luffy and Barto`s Great Adventure!\",\"number\":747,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While heading to the next island, Zou, Luffy’s appetite causes them trouble and he and Bartolomeo find themselves entangled in the scheme of a pirate lord who can manipulate silver.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"銀の要塞 ルフィとバルト大冒険\"},{\"title\":\"An Underground Maze! Luffy vs. the Tram Human!\",\"number\":748,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Tram-Man arrives! And has Luffy, Bartolomeo and Desire on the run! The deeper the three fall into the pit, however, the more clear it becomes that Bill`s group hides a terrible secret!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地下迷宮 ルフィVS[たい]トロッコ人間\"},{\"title\":\"The Sword Technique Heats Up! Law and Zoro Finally Appear!\",\"number\":749,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Bartolomeo, and Desire make their way up the mineshaft, but Bill`s assassin, Peseta, has other plans! Just when the going gets tough, help arrives, and Zoro battles the assassin head on!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"剣技白熱 ロー・ゾロ遂に見参!\"},{\"title\":\"A Desperate Situation! Luffy Fights a Battle in Extreme Heat!\",\"number\":750,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Desire, and Bartolomeo go up against Bill! But the mad, Smelt-Smelt man becomes deranged and lets his true power unfurl! Do Luffy and the others have any hope of exposing Bill`s self-serving aims and turning his gang against him?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命 ルフィ極限の灼熱決戦\"},{\"title\":\"Curtain-up on a New Adventure! Arriving at the Phantom Island, Zou!\",\"number\":751,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bartolomeo recounts the formation of the Straw Hats, sharing their moving story with the rest of his crew! Meanwhile, the mysterious island of Zou approaches in the distance, obscured by fog. But when the haze clears, no one is expecting what they see!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冒険開幕 幻の島「ゾウ」到着!\"},{\"title\":\"The New Warlord! The Legendary Whitebeard`s Son Appears!\",\"number\":752,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the others arrive at the mysterious land of Zou, and find the Sunny. But when they board, they find the other Straw Hats have already disembarked. Thus, Luffy, Zoro, Robin and the others take on the challenge of climbing the monstrous elephant!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新七武海 伝説・白ひげの息子登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Elephant Climb! A Great Adventure on the Back of the Giant Elephant!\",\"number\":753,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally scaling the elephant`s back, the Straw Hats continue their search for the other half of their crew! But the mysterious \\\"island\\\" on the back of the elephant may hold more danger than they bargained for, as they learn they are not alone!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決死の登象 巨象の背の大冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"A Battle Begins! Luffy vs. the Mink Tribe!\",\"number\":754,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy pushes deeper into the mysterious forest on the elephant’s back, but he`s treading in territory where is not welcome! Meanwhile, Usopp and the others make a startling discovery in a ruined city!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦闘開始 ルフィVSミンク族!\"},{\"title\":\"Garchu! The Straw Hats Reunite!\",\"number\":755,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the others survive the Rain-Ruption and learn of its vital role in maintaining life on Zou. They continue on towards the fortress learning more about the mysterious Mink Tribe, and are finally reunited with the others - but is that the whole story?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ガルチュー! 麦わらの一味再集結\"},{\"title\":\"Start to Counterattack! Great Moves by the Twirly Hat Crew!\",\"number\":756,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the others are unexpectedly welcomed at the fortress and treated well by the Minks, although they have to navigate some cultural differences… And Nami starts sharing what happened to them after they left Dressrosa.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反撃開始 ぐるわらの一味大活躍!\"},{\"title\":\"A Threat Descends! The Beast Pirates, Jack!\",\"number\":757,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the others learn about the dangerous intruders who have come to Zou, and why the island is wrecked! Afterwards, Luffy`s loose lips get them into trouble!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"脅威襲来 百獣海賊団ジャック!\"},{\"title\":\"The King of the Day! Duke Dogstorm Appears!\",\"number\":758,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Duke Dogstorm - the Straw Hats finally meet the ruler of this strange land, and learn more about the battle that took place here; and the mysterious system by which the island is ruled!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"昼の王 イヌアラシ公爵登場!\"},{\"title\":\"The King of the Night! Master Cat Viper Emerges!\",\"number\":759,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Day turns to night as the Minks keep up their onslaught against the invading Beast Pirates! But Jack`s amazing Devil Fruit power may end the elephant island once and for all!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夜の王 ネコマムシの旦那見参\"},{\"title\":\"The Exterminated Capital! The Twirly Hat Crew Arrive!\",\"number\":760,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Night and day, Jack faces the fury of the two sworn defenders of Zou, but while they put up a good fight, the Minks aren`t able to subdue Jack, especially after he brings out his secret weapon...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"首都壊滅 ぐるわらの一味上陸!\"},{\"title\":\"The Time Limit Closes In! The Bond Between the Mink Tribe and the Crew!\",\"number\":761,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the aftermath of Jack`s deadly attack on the island of Zou, Chopper and Sanji rush in to save the fallen Mink Tribe - but they will need the help of Caesar to overcome the poisonous effects of the gas!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"刻限[リミット]迫る ミンク族と一味の絆!\"},{\"title\":\"The Delinquent Comes Home! Emperor Big Mom`s Assassins!\",\"number\":762,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"More of the dramatic happenings on Zou are revealed as we learn that Jack`s pirate band were not the only visitors to the elephant island! And what about the mysterious fate of Sanji?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪童帰郷 四皇ビッグ・マムの刺客\"},{\"title\":\"The Truth Behind the Disappearance! Sanji Gets a Startling Invitation!\",\"number\":763,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The mystery of Sanji`s disappearance deepens as Luffy learns that Big Mom`s lackeys have caught up with him and the rest - and carry with them an invitation from Big Mom that simply can`t be refused!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失踪の真実 サンジ驚愕の招待状\"},{\"title\":\"To My Buds! Sanji`s Farewell Note!\",\"number\":764,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji`s dire situation has become clear, but instead of rallying against Big Mom`s crew, he submits to go along with them to bring an end to this situation. But being separated from one of his crew is more than Luffy is willing to tolerate!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"野郎共へ サンジ別れの置手紙\"},{\"title\":\"Let`s Go and Meet Master Cat Viper!\",\"number\":765,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There`s only one key to finding out what happened to Sanji - and Luffy and the others make their way towards finding out more about their friend`s disappearance, but on their way the indigenous fauna give them trouble!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ネコマムシの旦那に会いに行こう\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Decision! Sanji on the Brink of Quitting!\",\"number\":766,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy hatches a plan to help Sanji, but he`ll have to go alone to avoid an all-out war with Big Mom. Meanwhile, Kin`emon and Kanjuro finally arrive at Zou, unwittingly setting the stage for the Minks` thirst for revenge!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ決断 サンジ脱退の危機!\"},{\"title\":\"A Volatile Situation! The Dog and the Cat and the Samurai!\",\"number\":767,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The samurai have landed! And they make their way into the country of Zou unaware of the welcome they will receive by the Minks! The Straw Hats try their best to stop the fight - but as day meets night and Cat Viper and Dogstorm face each other, tensions run high in the elephant country!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一触即発 イヌとネコと侍!\"},{\"title\":\"The Third One! Raizo of the Mist, the Ninja, Appears!\",\"number\":768,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Revelations abound as the true nature of the Wano clan and their relationship with the Minks is revealed! Momonosuke`s role is greater than any had imagined! But even more shocking - the visage of Raizo the Ninja!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三人目! 忍者・霧の雷ぞう登場\"},{\"title\":\"A Red Stone! A Guide to the One Piece!\",\"number\":769,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The mysteries of ninjutsu enthrall the Straw Hats as Raizo, the implausible ninja, makes his true powers known! Meanwhile, a mysterious artifact points the way towards the end of the Grand Line!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"赤い石! \\\"ひとつなぎの大秘宝[ワンピース]\\\" への道標\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret of the Land of Wano! The Kozuki Family and the Ponegliffs!\",\"number\":770,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The mystery of the Ponegliffs is revealed - their true significance, and the story of their creation, leads closer to the Straw Hats than they might have imagined!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワノ国の秘密 光月家と歴史の本文[ポーネグリフ]\"},{\"title\":\"A Vow Between Two Men! Luffy and Kozuki Momonosuke!\",\"number\":771,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"More mysteries of the Kozuki Clan are revealed - and the samurai propose an alliance to help topple Kaido! But Luffy`s response will shock the crew... and force the young daimyo to take responsibility!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の誓い ルフィと光月モモの助\"},{\"title\":\"The Legendary Journey! The Dog and the Cat and the Pirate King!\",\"number\":772,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dogstorm and Cat Viper share their story of being on the journey with Oden and Roger but are interrupted by Nami who is concerned about the sea route. Meanwhile, Jack is plotting to bring down the Mokomo Dukedom again!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の航海 イヌとネコと海賊王!\"},{\"title\":\"The Nightmare Returns! The Invincible Jack`s Fierce Attack!\",\"number\":773,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The plans are set! The Straw Hats divide and conquer, one group heading to save Sanji, the others to the Land of Wano! But in the final moments before their departure, the tremendous elephant island begins to quake!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢再び 不死身のジャック強襲\"},{\"title\":\"A Battle to Defend Zou! Luffy and Zunesha!\",\"number\":774,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After being aggressively attacked by Jack`s fleet, the monstrous Zunesha comes to life and beckons to those on its back! But can the Straw Hats understand its cry? And realize in time what the elephant island needs from them?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゾウ防衛戦 ルフィとズニーシャ!\"},{\"title\":\"Save Zunesha! The Straw Hat`s Rescue Operation!\",\"number\":775,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the skirmish with Jack now over, the Straw Hats move on to trying to bandage the great elephant`s wounds! But just as the whole island puts the plan into action, unseen danger lurks on horizon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨象[ズニーシャ]を救え 麦わら救急[レスキュー]大作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Saying Goodbye and Descending from the Elephant! Setting Out to Take Back Sanji!\",\"number\":776,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and the others split up into four teams, each on different missions! Some from the Mink Tribe insist on leaving with Luffy’s team! Meanwhile, Usopp makes a weapon for Nami that seems to work like magic!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"別れの下象 サンジ奪還の船出!\"},{\"title\":\"To the Reverie! Princess Vivi and Princess Shirahoshi!\",\"number\":777,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s team sets out from Zou on their way to win back Sanji! But they didn`t realize there is one more crewmember than they have bargained for! Meanwhile, the leading families and leaders of the world make their way to Mariejois for the pivotal world meeting!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界会議[レヴェリー]へ 王女ビビとしらほし姫\"},{\"title\":\"To the Reverie! Rebecca and the Sakura Kingdom!\",\"number\":778,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Carrot stows away! And settles in with the Straw Hats as they make their way to rescue Sanji! Meanwhile, in the Sakura Kingdom - formerly the Drum Kingdom, Dalton and Kureha are getting ready for the Reverie so as their former enemy in his newly-built kingdom…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界会議[レヴェリー]へ レベッカとサクラ王国\"},{\"title\":\"Kaido Returns! An Imminent Threat to the Worst Generation!\",\"number\":779,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"News of the raid on the Revolutionary Army reaches Luffy! But that`s the least of their worries as they face a storm and a sudden lack of provisions! Meanwhile, Emperor Kaido, furious at the loss of Joker, fumes with anger at the reckless generation of upstarts!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カイドウ再び 脅威迫る最悪の世代!\"},{\"title\":\"A Hungry Front! Luffy and the Navy Rookies!\",\"number\":780,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sneaking in to the Navy island facility to replenish their food supply, Luffy and the others risk being caught out in the open! Will their infamy make them easy to spot by the hotheaded Navy recruits around them?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空腹[ハラペコ]戦線 ルフィと海軍超新星[ルーキー]!\"},{\"title\":\"The Implacable Three! A Big Chase After the Straw Hats!\",\"number\":781,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The jig is up as Luffy and the others make a daring dash to avoid the furious Navy! Can they escape without having to turn to fight - and after they`ve had a chance to raid the cabinets for food?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"執念の3人 麦わら一味大追撃戦[チェイス]!\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil`s Fist! A Show Down! Luffy vs. Grount!\",\"number\":782,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Making a mad dash for the Submerge with the food they stole, Luffy and the others have to get through some of the Navy`s upstart soldiers! Grount, whose arm holds incredible power, summons his training to challenge Luffy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔の拳 決戦! ルフィVS[たい]グラント\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji`s Homecoming! Into Big Mom`s Territory!\",\"number\":783,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats continue to suffer from blazing heat and a perilous food crisis! As the seas finally calm, fishing is their only hope! Meanwhile, Sanji arrives in Big Mom`s territory and keeps his cool - until he sees his bride-to-be!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジ帰郷 ビッグ・マムの海峡[ナワバリ]へ!\"},{\"title\":\"Zero and Four! Encountering Germa 66!\",\"number\":784,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is in danger as the venomous fish poison courses through his body! With no antidotes on board, the Straw Hats must rely on a mysterious ship for help - a ship that bears a truly surprising crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"0と4 遭遇! ジェルマ66[ダブルシックス]\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Poison Crisis! Luffy and Reiju!\",\"number\":785,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On the edge of life and death, Luffy`s only hope rests with Sanji`s siblings! But even though they refuse to share an antidote, they may be able to save Luffy`s life yet, giving him enough energy to plunge right back into trouble...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"猛毒の危機 ルフィとレイジュ!\"},{\"title\":\"Totto Land! Emperor Big Mom Appears!\",\"number\":786,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Arriving on Cacao Island, Luffy and Chopper are in heaven as everything before their eyes is edible! But in this most heavenly of places, there are rules to be obeyed - and consequences for breaking them! Luckily someone is on the lookout for the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"万国[トットランド]! 四皇ビッグ・マム登場\"},{\"title\":\"The Emperor`s Daughter! Sanji`s Fiancee: Pudding!\",\"number\":787,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats confront Pudding - the fiancée of Sanji! But when they challenge her for Sanji`s heart, her answer shocks them! Meanwhile an ominous and mysterious message may spell doom for the Straw Hats...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四皇の娘 サンジの婚約者[フィアンセ]プリン\"},{\"title\":\"A Massive Attack! Mom`s Hunger Pangs!\",\"number\":788,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The dangerous waters around the Whole Cake Island harbor terrifying creatures that pose a challenge for the Straw Hats! Meanwhile, Mama slips into a bout of her sickness and ravages her own land in search a specific pastry!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大進撃! 食いわずらいのマム\"},{\"title\":\"The Capital City Falls?! Big Mom and Jimbei!\",\"number\":789,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Big Mom rampages through the Whole Cake Island in search for sweets - but when the kitchen can`t prepare them fast enough her own son steps in to curb the carnage, with deadly results. Only an old face coming across the waters brings Mom what she needs, even though he also brings ill tidings.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"首藤崩壊!? ビッグ・マムとジンベエ\"},{\"title\":\"The Emperor`s Castle! Arriving at the Whole Cake Island!\",\"number\":790,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Straw Hats draw closer to the Whole Cake Island, Pedro shares his sordid past in Big Mom’s territory - and hatches a plan to win back Sanji and take an item of great worth from the Emperor!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四皇の城 ホールケーキアイランド到着\"},{\"title\":\"A Mysterious Forest Full of Candies! Luffy vs. Luffy?!\",\"number\":791,\"airDate\":\"2017-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook and Pedro head out in a submersible to infiltrate Big Mom`s stronghold! Meanwhile Luffy, Nami, Chopper and Carrot head into the island chasing the image of Sanji, only to be distracted by the endless supply of sweets and a second Luffy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お菓子な森 ルフィVS[たい]ルフィ!?\"},{\"title\":\"Mom`s Assassin! Luffy and the Seducing Woods!\",\"number\":792,\"airDate\":\"2017-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lost in the bewildering woods and chasing after Sanji, Nami and the others find there`s more than meets the eye in this upside down part of the Whole Cake Island! Meanwhile, Sanji confronts his brother!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マムの刺客 ルフィと誘惑の森!\"},{\"title\":\"A Seafaring Kingdom! Germa`s King Judge!\",\"number\":793,\"airDate\":\"2017-06-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy continues to move through the mysterious and dangerous woods, unaware of the danger that lurks in the trees! Meanwhile, Sanji confronts his father as the wounds of his childhood are laid bare!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海遊国家 ジェルマの王ジャッジ\"},{\"title\":\"A Battle Between Father and Son! Judge vs. Sanji!\",\"number\":794,\"airDate\":\"2017-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji faces off against his father in a duel! His powerful kicks aim at protecting his hands, but the Germa Family has more in store for him yet! Meanwhile Luffy goes deeper into the Seducing Woods and falls for their powerful illusions!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父子[おやこ]対決 ジャッジVS[たい]サンジ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Giant Ambition! Big Mom and Caesar!\",\"number\":795,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Big Mom has Caesar Clown at her whims - and despite his bilking her out of countless amounts of money - she is ready to continue her pursuit of maniacal world control! Meanwhile, Big Mom`s forces are on to the Straw Hats, and Pekoms faces a dire situation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨大な野望 ビッグ・マムとシーザー\"},{\"title\":\"The Land of Souls! Mom`s Fatal Ability!\",\"number\":796,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally Nami finds Luffy and recounts her harrowing tale of battling Brulee! Meanwhile the mysterious half-buried man comes clean about his true identity! But this must all be put aside when one of Mom`s most powerful generals comes calling!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魂の国 マムの恐るべき能力!\"},{\"title\":\"A Top Officer! The Sweet 3 General Cracker Appears!\",\"number\":797,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The identity of the enigmatic Pound, the man half-buried in the woods, is revealed, but his deep connection to Big Mom might not be enough to save him! Nami`s past exploits, however, hold the key to keeping Mom`s minions at bay!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大幹部! 三将星クラッカー登場\"},{\"title\":\"An Enemy Worth 800 Million! Luffy vs. Thousand Armed Cracker!\",\"number\":798,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy squares off against Cracker, one of the Sweet 3 Generals, as Nami learns the truth about others in the Worst Generation who have come before to challenge Big Mom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"8億の敵 ルフィVS[たい]千手のクラッカー\"},{\"title\":\"An All-out Duel! Gear Four vs. the Bis-Bis Ability!\",\"number\":799,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy continues to fight against Cracker, whose powers to manipulate his surroundings may prove more troublesome than he had thought! Meanwhile, Brook and Pedro infiltrate the Whole Cake Island - and must hatch a plan to avoid getting caught!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全力勝負 ギア4[フォース]VS[たい]ビスビスの能力[ちから]\"},{\"title\":\"The First and the Second Join! The Vinsmoke Family!\",\"number\":800,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The wind starts to go out of Luffy`s sails as he fights an endless army of Biscuit Warriors! Meanwhile, the oldest two Vinsmoke brothers come home from a war to see their long-missing young brother Sanji.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"1と2 集結! ヴィンスモーク家\"},{\"title\":\"The Benefactor`s Life! Sanji and Owner Zeff!\",\"number\":801,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy starts to run out of steam as the Biscuit Warriors keep multiplying! If he can buy himself 10 minutes to recharge... Meanwhile, Sanji squares off against his family, but realizes they have some vital insurance to make sure he follows their scheme to marry Pudding.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恩人の命 サンジと料理長[オーナー]ゼフ\"},{\"title\":\"An Angry Sanji! The Secret of Germa 66!\",\"number\":802,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy needs just 10 minutes to recharge! Nami comes to rescue with the help of the Homies! Meanwhile, Sanji learns the terrible truth of Germa`s power - and his father`s dark history!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りのサンジ ジェルマ66[ダブルシックス]の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"The Past That He Let Go Of! Vinsmoke Sanji!\",\"number\":803,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami challenges Cracker on her own! During the all-out fight, she loses her advantage and is close to defeat. Can Luffy bounce back in time? Meanwhile, Sanji`s tragic childhood is made clear.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"捨てた過去 ヴィンスモーク・サンジ\"},{\"title\":\"To the East Blue! Sanji`s Resolute Departure!\",\"number\":804,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The terrible history of Sanji`s family continue to unfold. From a rare moment of compassion he is able to escape, only to face his father`s cruelty before setting out on his own.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"東の海[イーストブルー]へ サンジ決意の船出\"},{\"title\":\"A Battle of Limits! Luffy and the Infinite Biscuits!\",\"number\":805,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is in an all-out, all-you-can-eat battle! As Cracker`s endless stream of Biscuit Warriors marches on, Luffy`s endless appetite is put to the test. Meanwhile, Reiju helps Sanji to straighten himself out before he meets his fiancée.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"限界勝負 ルフィと無限ビスケット\"},{\"title\":\"The Power of Satiety! A New Gear Four Form: Tank Man!\",\"number\":806,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy needs to think fast in order to turn the battle in his favor - filled with biscuits he debuts a new Gear Four attack that has lasting repercussions! Meanwhile, Chopper and Carrot find Sanji`s reflection, but can they get a message to him in time?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"満腹の力 新ギア4[フォース]タンクマン!\"},{\"title\":\"A Heartbreaking Duel! Luffy vs Sanji! - Part 1\",\"number\":807,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy finally catches up with Sanji! However, as a happy past plays before his eyes in which he, Sanji, and the crew deepened their bonds, a new page is turning in the history of the Straw Hats - and Sanji`s journey with the crew looks to be coming to an end!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しき決闘 ルフィvs[たい]サンジ (前編)\"},{\"title\":\"A Heartbreaking Duel! Luffy vs Sanji! - Part 2\",\"number\":808,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy finally catches up with Sanji! However, as a happy past plays before his eyes in which he, Sanji, and the crew deepened their bonds, a new page is turning in the history of the Straw Hats - and Sanji`s journey with the crew looks to be coming to an end!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しき決闘 ルフィvs[たい]サンジ (後編)\"},{\"title\":\"A Storm of Revenge! An Enraged Army Comes to Attack!\",\"number\":809,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy makes a solemn promise to not move from his spot until Sanji returns to him. But as Mama`s army advances, that promise may prove a costly one. Meanwhile, Sanji and the Vinsmokes come face to face with Big Mom and his bride-to-be Pudding!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復讐の嵐 怒りの軍団襲来!\"},{\"title\":\"The End of the Adventure! Sanji`s Resolute Proposal!\",\"number\":810,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy stands his ground and waits for his friend to return! But the vengeful army washes over him - only a true friend can step in to turn the tide of battle! Meanwhile, Sanji and Pudding discuss their marriage - and come to a startling conclusion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冒険の終わり サンジ決意のプロポーズ\"},{\"title\":\"I`ll Wait Here! Luffy vs. the Enraged Army!\",\"number\":811,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy puts his all into battling Big Mom`s vengeful army, however, their skills combined prove too formidable. Meanwhile, Sanji goes to Big Mom herself to bargain for the Straw Hats lives - with shocking results!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ここで待つ ルフィVS[たい]怒りの軍団\"},{\"title\":\"Invading the Chateau! Reach the Road Ponegliff!\",\"number\":812,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper and Carrot are captured by Brulee and strung up for dinner! But Chopper sees a chance to free himself! Meanwhile, Brook and Pedro launch a plan to reach the Ponegliffs - a daring game of chance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"城内[シャトー]潜入 奪え! ロード歴史の本文[ポーネグリフ]\"},{\"title\":\"A Fateful Confrontation! Luffy and Big Mom!\",\"number\":813,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pekoms creates a diversion for Brook to set his plan into action. Meanwhile Luffy continues to goad Big Mom into a fight, and Pudding begins to have stirrings of rebellion herself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"因縁の対面 ルフィとビッグ・マム!\"},{\"title\":\"Shout of the Soul! Brook and Pedro`s Lightning Operation!\",\"number\":814,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Just when Luffy and Nami are in Big Mom`s grasp, Pudding arrives, but with news that they aren`t expecting - meanwhile Brook and Chopper both make headway getting out of their own jams!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魂[テャマスィー]の叫び ブルック&ペドロ電撃作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Goodbye! Pudding`s Tearful Determination!\",\"number\":815,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji hopes his wedding with Pudding will solve the Straw Hat`s predicament - but Pudding secretly plans to to avoid the marriage, sharing a secret with Luffy. Meanwhile Brook comes face to face with Big Mom herself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さよなら プリン涙の決意\"},{\"title\":\"The History of the Left Eye! Pedro vs. Baron Tamago!\",\"number\":816,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy tries desperately to free himself as the risk of his own well-being! Meanwhile, Chopper and Carrot continue to search the mirror universe, Brook squares off against Big Mom, and Pedro’s past is revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"左眼の因縁 ペドロVS[たい]タマゴ男爵\"},{\"title\":\"Moist Cigarette! The Night Before Sanji`s Wedding!\",\"number\":817,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy struggles to break himself free as Sanji falls deeper in love with the idea of marrying Pudding... But the mask falls off and the deadly charade of Big Mom is revealed as the depths of her treachery come to light!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シケモク サンジの結婚前夜\"},{\"title\":\"The Undaunted Soul! Brook vs. Big Mom!\",\"number\":818,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook continues his all-out struggle against Big Mom, but his secret weapon might not be enough to save him! Meanwhile an unexpected ally from the past comes to the rescue!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"不屈の魂[ソウル] ブルックVS[たい]ビッグ・マム\"},{\"title\":\"Sora`s Wish! Germa`s Failure: Sanji!\",\"number\":819,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jimbei arrives on the scene and works to free Luffy and Nami! Meanwhile Sanji confronts his sister with the awful truth of Pudding, and she confides in him the powerful secret of their mother`s undying love!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"母[ソラ]の願い ジェルマの失敗作サンジ\"},{\"title\":\"To Reach Sanji! Luffy`s Vengeful Hell-bent Dash!\",\"number\":820,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook finds himself totally at the whim of Big Mom, and comes face to face with her brutal love! Meanwhile, Pedro reveals his explosive plan to create a distraction!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジの元へ ルフィ逆襲の大激走!\"},{\"title\":\"The Chateau in Turmoil! Luffy, to the Rendezvous!\",\"number\":821,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper and Carrot use the mirror dimension to get in touch with Nami and Jimbei! Luffy makes it through more obstacles to learn that he just missed Sanji! Meanwhile, Sanji wonders alone about the best course of action.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"城内[シャトー]動乱 ルフィ約束の場所へ\"},{\"title\":\"Deciding to Say Goodbye! Sanji and His Straw-Hat Bento!\",\"number\":822,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Brook hears Big Mom`s plan firsthand as she shares her intentions with Pudding in front of him! Meanwhile Big Mom`s agents believe most of the Straw Hats to be under control, but doubt besets Montd`Or.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"別れの決意 サンジと麦わら弁当\"},{\"title\":\"The Emperor Rolls Over! Rescue Brook Mission!\",\"number\":823,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and the others finally find Brook in the mirror dimension - but he`s in the most inopportune of places! Can they challenge the sleeping Mama and rescue their friend? Meanwhile, Luffy is waylaid on his way back to the rendezvous!\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四皇の寝返り ブルック救出大作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"The Rendezvous! Luffy, a One-on-One at His Limit!\",\"number\":824,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy puts up a valiant fight in order to keep his word to Sanji! But will he be able to last until Sanji arrives at the rendezvous? Meanwhile, Jimbei shares the awful truth about the wedding with the other Straw Hats.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"約束の場所 ルフィ限界の一騎打ち\"},{\"title\":\"A Liar! Luffy and Sanji!\",\"number\":825,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji and Luffy meet finally - and while he is happy to feed Luffy to replenish his energy, Sanji`s explanation of what actions he must take baffles Luffy! The crucial decision, to turn his back on his friends or his family, tears Sanji apart!\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウソつき ルフィとサンジ\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji Comes Back! Crash! The Tea Party from Hell!\",\"number\":826,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The newly reunited Luffy and Sanji hear from the rest of the Straw Hats in the mirror dimension! Then, Jimbei starts telling them about Capone “Gang” Bege and proposes a shocking plan to take down Big Mom!\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジ復活 壊せ! 地獄のお茶会\"},{\"title\":\"A Secret Meeting! Luffy vs. the Fire Tank Pirates!\",\"number\":827,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats put Jimbei`s plan into action and approach Bege with the possibility of an alliance. But before they are granted an audience, they must make themselves presentable! At the same time, Nami learns about the terror of Big Mom from Lola`s twin sister!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"密会! ルフィVS[たい]ファイアタンク海賊団\"},{\"title\":\"The Deadly Pact! Luffy & Bege`s Allied Forces!\",\"number\":828,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The proposed alliance between the Straw Hats and Bege unfolds! A gaseous blast from the past, Gastino, a member of Bege`s team, reveals the secret weapon that the team plans to use against the Emperor! But Gastino is not who he seems, and the bait in this trap is none other than Luffy himself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死の協定 ルフィ&ベッジ連合軍!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Engages in a Secret Maneuver! The Wedding Full of Conspiracies Starts Soon!\",\"number\":829,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now, the assassination plan of Big Mom is all set and everyone starts preparing for the Tea Party. Montd`Or finds one of his crewmates, Bobbin the Disposer, dead, and suspects Sanji and Luffy of the crime. He goes to check if Sanji is in his room, just as Sanji is running to get back so as not to arouse suspicion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ暗躍 開演直前! 陰謀の結婚式\"},{\"title\":\"The Family Gets Together! The Hellish Tea Party Starts!\",\"number\":830,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The day has arrived! Guests from the criminal underground pour in in droves, but some have their own agendas to settle! Big Mom’s sons, however, stand in their way and show them what they’ve got! Meanwhile, Luffy is preparing for his own plan!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"家族[ファミリー]集結 開宴! 地獄のお茶会\"},{\"title\":\"The Broken Couple! Sanji and Pudding Enter!\",\"number\":831,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Final preparations abound on all sides and multiple plots start to come together! But can Sanji keep his nerve and go through with the plan? Or will Pudding`s beauty prove too enchanting?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仮面夫婦 サンジ♥プリン入場!\"},{\"title\":\"A Deadly Kiss! The Mission to Assassinate the Emperor Kicks Off!\",\"number\":832,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"All plans go into action as the moment of the wedding arrives - but as the veil is lifted on Pudding`s grotesque face, all hell breaks loose and unexpected circumstances mean chaos breaks out at the altar! Meanwhile, Luffy charges in, adding to the mayhem!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死のキス 四皇暗殺作戦開始!\"},{\"title\":\"Returning the Sake Cup! The Manly Jimbei Pays His Debt!\",\"number\":833,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The plan is launched! Big Mom falls to pieces as the wedding - and the wedding cake - are destroyed and a slew of Luffys are wreaking havoc around the site. But just when Luffy gets in trouble, Jimbei confronts Big Mom bravely!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"盃返上! 侠客[おとこ]ジンベエの落とし前\"},{\"title\":\"The Mission Failed?! The Big Mom Pirates Strike Back!\",\"number\":834,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The plan is in full swing however - Big Mom is pushed past the edge of sanity and can`t even bring herself to act. Meanwhile, her children make a move against Germa and Pudding takes up her original aim of killing Sanji!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"作戦失敗!? 反撃のビッグ・マム海賊団\"},{\"title\":\"Run, Sanji! SOS! Germa 66!\",\"number\":835,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The plot is in full swing as Luffy dashes towards Big Mom to show her the broken portrait again! Sanji makes an effort to free his family and wins the respect of his sister and Big Mom loses her wits!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"走れサンジ SOS! ジェルマ66[ダブルシックス]\"},{\"title\":\"Mom`s Secret! The Giant`s Island Elbaph and a Little Monster!\",\"number\":836,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The tragic and sad history of Big Mom is revealed! From abandonment, rescue, and again to ruin, Big Mom`s voracious hunger has brought her into conflict with others from the very beginning!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マムの秘密 巨人の島[エルバフ]と小さな怪物\"},{\"title\":\"The Birth of Mom! The Day That Carmel Vanished!\",\"number\":837,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Linlin enrages the Giants as she slays their respected warrior - but Mother throws herself on their mercy and begs for clemency for her beloved Linlin, forcing the troupe to leave Elbaph for good. But the kindness Mother shows belies a dark and twisted secret...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マム誕生 カルメルが消えた日\"},{\"title\":\"The Launcher Blasts! The Moment Of Big Mom`s Assassination!\",\"number\":838,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Linlin, destroyed at the disappearance of Mother, falls in with a new cohort and finds a reason to go on living, proving herself a mighty force to be reckoned with! The Straw Hats’ plan goes awry and all hope looks to be lost!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兵器[ランチャー]炸裂! ビッグ・マム暗殺の瞬間[とき]\"},{\"title\":\"The Evil Army! Transform! Germa 66!\",\"number\":839,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bege and the Straw Hats are on the defensive as the full force of Mom`s troops are brought down on them! As they retreat into a fortress, Germa 66 springs in to action! However, Bege has bad news for his allied forces.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪の軍団 変身! ジェルマ66[ダブルシックス]\"},{\"title\":\"Cutting the Father-Son Relationship! Sanji and Judge!\",\"number\":840,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and Germa 66 are cornered in Bege`s stronghold - with the full force of the Big Mom Pirates pinning them down, it`s only a matter of time before their defenses crack. The only way out seems to be to make a break for it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父子[おやこ]の訣別 サンジとジャッジ\"},{\"title\":\"Escape from the Tea Party! Luffy vs. Big Mom!\",\"number\":841,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The plan is executed to sneak the Straw Hats out of Big Mom`s castle while hidden inside Bege! But the irascible Luffy can`t resist getting in at least one punch against his foe! Meanwhile the Tamate Box slips into the hands of some surprising agent!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"茶会脱出! ルフィVS[たい]ビッグ・マム\"},{\"title\":\"The Execution Begins! Luffy`s Allied Forces Are Annihilated?!\",\"number\":842,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The full might of the Big Mom Pirates proves too much for the Straw Hats and Germa 66. With no other options, they decide to turn and fight, even though it means their total annihilation! But the mysterious Tamate Box comes in to play and shakes up the playing field - literally!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"処刑開始 ルフィ連合軍全滅!?\"},{\"title\":\"The Chateau Collapses! The Straw Hat`s Great Escape Begins!\",\"number\":843,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Whole Cake Chateau starts crumbling while everyone is trying to escape for their lives! Luffy and the others get away and move on to the next stage of their escape which involves some parting of ways. Meanwhile, Big Mom’s children notice their mother’s change of behavior at the worst possible moment.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨城[シャトー]崩壊 麦わら一味大脱走開始[スタート]!\"},{\"title\":\"The Spear of Elbaph! Onslaught! The Flying Big Mom!\",\"number\":844,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats continue their mad dash to the Sunny! As Big Mom rages, her underlings decide to turn her Hunger Pang attacks against the Straw Hats! The Whole Cake Island scrambles to remake the cake to calm down Big Mom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨人[エルバフ]の槍 強襲! 空翔るビッグ・マム\"},{\"title\":\"Pudding`s Determination! Ablaze! The Seducing Woods!\",\"number\":845,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kingbaum puts his life on the line ferrying the Straw Hats towards the Seducing Woods! But Big Mom`s word trumps him in this terrifying forest, and soon enough she catches up! Meanwhile, Pudding puts her plan to rebuild the cake into action - and reveals her surprising motivations!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"プリンの決意 大炎上! 誘惑の森\"},{\"title\":\"A Lightning Counterattack! Nami and Zeus the Thundercloud!\",\"number\":846,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zeus pursues the Straw Hats as Nami keeps him occupied. She has a shocking surprise in store for him, however, that might stop Big Mom in her tracks! Meanwhile, Brook and Chopper find the Shark Submerge in a strange situation.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反撃の雷[いかずち] ナミと雷雲ゼウス!\"},{\"title\":\"A Coincidental Reunion! Sanji and the Lovestruck Evil Pudding!\",\"number\":847,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Big Mom is relentless in her pursuit of the Straw Hats! Even being buried alive doesn`t stop her! The plan to recreate the cake to stop her onslaught progresses and Pudding’s changeable heart confuses all those looking on!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"偶然の再会 サンジと恋する悪プリン\"},{\"title\":\"Save the Sunny! Fighting Bravely! Chopper and Brook!\",\"number\":848,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mama`s onslaught continues as Pudding keeps battling the contradictory urges in her head - to kill or kiss Sanji! Meanwhile, Brook and Chopper are at Perospero`s mercy - and are being reduced to sweetened versions of themselves!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サニーを守れ 奮戦! チョッパー&ブルック\"},{\"title\":\"Before the Dawn! Pedro, the Captain of the Guardians!\",\"number\":849,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sandwiched between Big Mom and her advancing fleet, the only hope is the Sunny`s Coup-de-Burst! But can the Straw Hats prepare it in time? Meanwhile, Pedro comes face to face with his past, and embraces a dramatic end to be sure that the tides of time continue to flow!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夜明け前 侠客団[ガーディアンズ]団長ペドロ\"},{\"title\":\"I`ll Be Back! Luffy, Deadly Departure!\",\"number\":850,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The last chance the Straw Hats have is the Coup de Burst! Pedro has made the ultimate sacrifice to give them this one chance to escape, but Big Mom`s naval forces are closing in and poised to knock them out! Luffy has to put himself on the line again to save his crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必ず戻る ルフィ命がけの出航!\"},{\"title\":\"The Man with a Bounty of Billion! The Strongest Sweet General, Katakuri!\",\"number\":851,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and the others who escaped the Whole Cake Island by Pedro’s sacrifice mourn over his death. Jimbei, however, keeps his calm which makes Brook lose his temper. Meanwhile, Luffy confronts the formidable Sweet General Katakuri in the Mirroworld.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"10億の男 最強の3将星カタクリ\"},{\"title\":\"A Hard Battle Starts! Luffy vs. Katakuri!\",\"number\":852,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pudding and Sanji arrive at Cacao Island and begin to remake the only cake that will calm Big Mom! But their fake nuptials get in the way as they bicker like a married couple! Meanwhile, Luffy has lost the battle of his life - and the flame goes out of him... until the Sunny becomes the target of a new threat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘開幕 ルフィVS[たい]カタクリ\"},{\"title\":\"The Green Room! An Invincible Helmsman, Jimbei!\",\"number\":853,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy keeps the forces out to destroy the Straw Hats at bay, however the crew needs to destroy all the mirrors - the final link that secure his safe return - on the ship in order to save themselves! At the same time, the ship is on a course for disaster, with Jimbei at the helm!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"波の部屋[グリーンルーム] 無敵の操舵主ジンベエ\"},{\"title\":\"The Threat of the Mole! Luffy`s Silent Fight!\",\"number\":854,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and the others start breaking all the mirrors on the Sunny in order to keep their enemies out while she and Luffy discuss where to rendezvous – but little do they know the plan is overheard! Meanwhile, Luffy’s grueling battle against Katakuri intensifies!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"土竜の脅威 ルフィ沈黙の戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"The End of the Deadly Battle?! Katakuri`s Awakening in Anger!\",\"number\":855,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Both powerful combatants and strong users of Haki, Luffy and Katakuri are a dead match for each other. Every move is matched by their opponent! Elsewhere, the Big Mom Pirates square off against Germa! With so much at stake, Luffy falls to Katakuri, spelling his doom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死闘決着!? カタクリ怒りの覚醒\"},{\"title\":\"The Forbidden Secret! Katakuri`s Merienda!\",\"number\":856,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Katakuri retires to his sanctuary to enjoy the merienda - a chance for him to savor the sweetness of his crew of chefs and replenish his Haki! But he`s not the only one who`s doing eating, as Straw Hat uses his mouth to get out from under the mochi mountain crushing him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁断の秘密 カタクリのおやつの時間[メリエンダ]\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Fights Back! The Invincible Katakuri`s Weak Point!\",\"number\":857,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy discovers the secret to Katakuri`s unearthly fighting ability, and just might have a solution for how to stop him! Meanwhile at the Sweets Factory, Pudding receives a call from Brulee who has bad news for the Straw Hats!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ反撃 無敵カタクリの弱点!\"},{\"title\":\"Another Crisis! Gear Four vs. Unstoppable Donuts!\",\"number\":858,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy runs out of his Haki and has to buy some time - in the most peculiar way! Meanwhile the Big Mom Pirates mobilize their entire fleet to squelch the pirate threat, and the replacement cake nears completion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危機[ピンチ]再び! ギア4VS[たい]無双ドーナツ\"},{\"title\":\"The Rebellious Daughter, Chiffon! Sanji`s Big Plan for Transporting the Cake!\",\"number\":859,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Chiffon comes under attack, Sanji must choose between defending her or revealing himself to his enemies! Meanwhile, Luffy uses Brulee as a human shield to avoid the wrath of Big Mom!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反逆の娘[シフォン] サンジのケーキ輸送大作戦\"},{\"title\":\"A Man`s Way of Life! Bege and Luffy`s Determination as Captains!\",\"number\":860,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bege arrives on the scene, seemingly willing to risk it all to bring down the Big Mom Pirates in a blaze of glory, but of course he has a trick up his sleeve! Meanwhile Luffy keeps on the move to regain his Haki, but begins to ponder just how far his limits can be pushed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の生き様 ベッジとルフィ船長の決意\"},{\"title\":\"The Cake Sank?! Sanji and Bege`s Getaway Battle!\",\"number\":861,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji and Bege get together and get off of Cacao Island successfully but their plan is in jeopardy as Oven begins to boil the sea itself! As Chiffon and the others who are on the ship are cornered, a surprising savior comes in to fight Oven!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ケーキ沈没!? サンジ&ベッジ逃亡戦\"},{\"title\":\"Sulong! Carrot`s Big Mystic Transformation!\",\"number\":862,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A vicious pincer attack bears down on the Straw Hats! Three fleets converge and try to squeeze the life from them! Daifuku himself take the lead! But Carrot draws on a deep power within and springs in to action under the light of the moon!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月の獅子[スーロン] キャロット神秘の大変身\"},{\"title\":\"Break Through! The Straw Hat`s Mighty Sea Battle!\",\"number\":863,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The much anticipated wedding cake is on its way, but there is a debate at the last minute! Shouldn`t this opportunity be used to slip poison into Big Mom`s meal to topple the Emperor of the Sea? Meanwhile, Carrot`s unearthly ability based on the power of the moon saves the day!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"突破せよ 麦わらの一味大海戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Finally, They Clash! The Emperor of the Sea vs. the Straw Hats!\",\"number\":864,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, through sheer force of will, can almost use his Haki to battle Katakuri! Meanwhile, the Sunny catches fire while the Straw Hats try to kick out Big Mom but that’s when Jimbei steps up to the plate and takes a swing at her!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に激突 四皇VS[たい]麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"Dark King`s Direct Precepts! The Battle Against Katakuri Turns Around!\",\"number\":865,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy tries to enhance his Haki to foresee Katakuri’s next move but Katakuri’s attacks keep pulling him down! However, when he summons every bit of wisdom from his training with Rayleigh, he remembers something important that could turn the tables for him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"冥王直伝 カタクリ戦大逆転開始\"},{\"title\":\"Finally He Returns! Sanji, the Man Who`ll Stop the Emperor of the Sea!\",\"number\":866,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The cake is finally prepared and brought before Big Mom! With the end of her vicious rampage in sight, there is a chance for the Straw Hats to flee! Big Mom`s crew is forced to decide who to attack! Meanwhile, Luffy grows ever closer to using his Haki!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に帰還 四皇を止める男サンジ\"},{\"title\":\"Lurking in the Darkness! An Assassin Targeting Luffy!\",\"number\":867,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hiding her presence, Flampe shoots her blowgun at Luffy to support her dear brother Katakuri. Meanwhile, Oven launches a dastardly plan to fence Luffy in - by destroying every mirror on the island! And Smoothie is on the tail of the Sunny as it makes its way towards Cacao Island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇に潜む ルフィを襲う暗殺者!\"},{\"title\":\"One Man`s Determination! Katakuri`s Deadly Big Fight!\",\"number\":868,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Katakuri notices his sister Flampe is sneakily providing poison needle back up in the shadows. Becoming enraged, he takes unexpected action that surprises everyone. Meanwhile, Smoothie increases her size and closes in on the Sunny.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"男の覚悟 カタクリ命がけ大勝負\"},{\"title\":\"Wake Up! The Color of Observation Able to Top the Strongest!\",\"number\":869,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy leans on his training to bring out the power of his Haki! Meanwhile the children of Big Mom gather as a massive force ready to smash Luffy and the Straw Hats. Their resentment at being embarrassed fuels their desire to get revenge!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"目覚めろ 最強を越える見聞色!\"},{\"title\":\"A Fist of Divine Speed! Another Gear Four Application Activated!\",\"number\":870,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Katakuri are locked in a duel to end all duels! Their powers ensure that each blow could be the last! Luffy must rely on his training, let all his thoughts out, and keep pushing on! Meanwhile, Sanji is about to land at Cacao Island!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神速の拳 新たなるギア4発動!\"},{\"title\":\"Finally, It`s Over! The Climax of the Intense Fight Against Katakuri!\",\"number\":871,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s dramatic battle finally draws to a close! But even if he is able to pull out victory in the last moment, can he remember the key to escaping the Mirrorworld?! Meanwhile, the whole host of the Big Mom Pirates watch the lonely mirror to see who will come through!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に終結 壮絶カタクリ戦の行方\"},{\"title\":\"A Desperate Situation! The Iron-tight Entrapment of Luffy!\",\"number\":872,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy emerges safely! And Pekoms` bravery ensures he and the Straw Hats have a fighting chance! But can they withstand the full force of the Big Mom Pirates? At the last moment - a surprise explodes onto the scene!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命 鉄壁のルフィ包囲網!\"},{\"title\":\"Pulling Back from the Brink! The Formidable Reinforcements: Germa!\",\"number\":873,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji tries his best to save himself and his captain, Luffy! But the arrival of Germa has complicated matters. Whose side do these powerful superhumans fight on? In the end, sisterly love will see Sanji saved!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"起死回生 最強の援軍ジェルマ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Hope! The Sun Pirates Emerge!\",\"number\":874,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Sanji are safe! But the critical moment approaches - the fate of Totto Land rests on the taste of the wedding cake! Will it be sweet release or bitter defeat? Meanwhile, a cunning pincer attack leaves the Straw Hats hopelessly trapped. Only old, reliable comrades can save the day!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の砦 タイヨウの海賊団現る\"},{\"title\":\"A Captivating Flavor! Sanji`s Cake of Happiness!\",\"number\":875,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the help of the Sun Pirates, the Straw Hats see their chance to escape! And the Sun Pirates bid farewell to their former captain. Mama finally tastes the Wedding Cake and the results are positively scrumptious!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魅惑の味 幸せのサンジのケーキ\"},{\"title\":\"The Man of Humanity and Justice! Jimbei, a Desperate Massive Ocean Current\",\"number\":876,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Big Mom Pirates fooled! The Straw Hats have eluded their would-be tormentors with the help of the Sun Pirates! However, as the fleet of the Big Mom Pirates is still coming after them, Jimbei makes a crucial decision to help the Sunny to get away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仁義の漢[おとこ] ジンベエ決死の大海流\"},{\"title\":\"The Parting Time! Pudding`s Last Wish!\",\"number\":877,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At a great cost of energy and life, the Straw Hats make it out of Totto Land. Left behind in their wake are allies and friends, and would-be lovers. As the sea opens before them, what price has been paid for their escape?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"惜別の時 プリン最後の\\\"お願い\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"The World Is Stunned! The Fifth Emperor of the Sea Emerges!\",\"number\":878,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy`s recent exploits make their way around the world! The reputation of this mighty pirate begins to grow as all eyes look towards the Straw Hats` next move! Also - German 66 leaves an artifact behind which excites the crew!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界驚愕 第五の海の皇帝現る!\"},{\"title\":\"To the Reverie! The Straw Hats` Sworn Allies Come Together!\",\"number\":879,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the royals make their way to the Reverie, the mighty Navy takes all precautions to make sure they don`t fall prey to kidnappings! At the vanguard is Koby, who glimpses Luffy`s exploits and remembers their shared past. Meanwhile, Luffy is confronted with a staggering change to his bounty!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界会議[レヴェリー]へ 集結! 麦わらの盟友達\"},{\"title\":\"Sabo Goes into Action! All the Captains of the Revolutionary Army Appear!\",\"number\":880,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A vicious pirate group led by Pinkbeard who describes himself as one of Blackbeard’s affiliates attacks a town in the Kingdom of Lulucia while their king and able-bodied soldiers have gone to the Reverie. And four bizarre individuals come to help. They’re the captains of the Revolutionary Army.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サボ動く 革命軍全軍隊長登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Going into Action! The Implacable New Admiral of the Fleet - Sakazuki!\",\"number\":881,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At New Marineford, Sakazuki, the new Admiral of the Fleet, hears the news about Luffy and recalls the tumultuous Paramount War that haunts the Navy! That game-changing war has repercussions that last into the present!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出す 執念の新元帥サカズキ\"},{\"title\":\"The Paramount War! The Inherited Will of the King of the Pirates!\",\"number\":882,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nobles from around the world gather for the Reverie as the echoes of the Paramount War resound! Among them are Shirahoshi and her family from the Ryugu Kingdom under the sea. Meanwhile, Admiral Fujitora has a conversation with his new colleague, Admiral Ryokugyu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"頂上戦争 継がれた海賊王の意思\"},{\"title\":\"One Step Forward for Her Dream! Shirahoshi Goes Out in the Sun!\",\"number\":883,\"airDate\":\"2019-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stelly, Sabo’s adopted brother and now the king of the Goa Kingdom, walks up to Garp who is escorting the royal family of the Fish-Man Island, with an air of importance and something up his sleeve. Meanwhile, Shirahoshi sees the surface world for the first time.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夢の一歩 しらほし太陽の下へ!\"},{\"title\":\"I Miss Him! Vivi and Rebecca`s Sentiments!\",\"number\":884,\"airDate\":\"2019-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shirahoshi and her family finally reach the Holyland of Mariejois! But all the unexpected attention confuses her. Meanwhile, Vivi from Alabasta meets Leo and Rebecca from Dressrosa, and tells them the story of her journey with the Straw Hats.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"会いたい ビビとレベッカの想い\"},{\"title\":\"In the Dark Recesses of the Holyland! A Mysterious Giant Straw Hat!\",\"number\":885,\"airDate\":\"2019-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vivi reunites with Dalton and Dr. Kureha from the Sakura Kingdom and they share their memories of the Straw Hats with Shirahoshi and Rebecca. Meanwhile, a shadowy figure descends a long staircase at the castle in the Holyland and opens a mysterious door.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖地の闇 謎の巨大な麦わら帽子\"},{\"title\":\"The Holyland in Tumult! The Targeted Princess Shirahoshi!\",\"number\":886,\"airDate\":\"2019-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shirahoshi crosses the fancy of a Celestial Dragon, and those living gods are not open to having their whims disobeyed! As she is dragged away, King Neptune comes to her rescue, risking life and limb by defying the Celestial Dragon, but luckily an old friend of the Ryugu Kingdom is on hand and tries to defuse the situation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖地騒然 狙われたしらほし姫!\"},{\"title\":\"An Explosive Situation! Two Emperors of the Sea Going After Luffy!\",\"number\":887,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Emperors of the Sea, Big Mom and Kaido decide to team up against Luffy! Meanwhile, Garp hears about the wild exploits of his grandson, all while a mysterious outsider visits the highest authority in the world!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一触即発 ルフィ狙う二人の四皇\"},{\"title\":\"Sabo Enraged! The Tragedy of the Revolutionary Army Officer Kuma!\",\"number\":888,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After sneaking into the Land of the Gods, Sabo sees the shocking figure of his friend – Kuma! Abused by the World Government as a pawn in their games, Kuma, who was made an example of what happens when you disobey the gods!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サボ怒る 革命軍幹部くまの悲劇\"},{\"title\":\"Finally, It Starts! The Conspiracy-filled Reverie!\",\"number\":889,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Reverie has begun! The representative kings and queens first discuss what to do with Straw Hat Luffy. Meanwhile the Revolutionary Army confirms its desire to save Kuma! All while they recount how the Straw Hats have grown from upstarts into world players!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に開幕 陰謀渦巻く世界会議[レヴェリー]!\"},{\"title\":\"Marco! The Keeper of Whitebeard`s Last Memento!\",\"number\":890,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to recruit a strong ally towards bringing down Kaido, Cat Viper and his crew stop by Whitebeard’s homeland to see Marco, the 1st division commander of the Whitebeard Pirates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マルコ! 白ひげの形見の守護者\"},{\"title\":\"Climbing up a Waterfall! A Great Journey Through the Land of Wano`s Sea Zone!\",\"number\":891,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the others become excited as they see familiar faces in a newspaper article about the Reverie while they close in on the Land of Wano. But this dangerous and foreboding land is as inaccessible as it is mysterious! The sea itself is a barrier!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"滝登り! ワノ国の海域大航海!\"},{\"title\":\"The Land of Wano! To the Samurai Country Where Cherry Blossoms Flutter!\",\"number\":892,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious country, a rampaging slasher, ancient samurai rituals of seppuku - and Zoro in the crosshairs! When a street assault occurs, all signs point to Zoro! Meanwhile, Luffy finally arrives at the Land of Wano but all his friends are nowhere to be found.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワノ国! 桜舞うサムライの国へ\"},{\"title\":\"Otama Appears! Luffy vs. Kaido`s Army!\",\"number\":893,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stranded alone on the beach, Luffy tries to gather his bearings only to be confronted by some mysterious, and dangerous, local fauna! And then, he meets a little girl named Otama! Meanwhile, Zoro makes trouble for the others who are trying to blend in!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お玉登場 ルフィVS[たい]カイドウ軍!\"},{\"title\":\"He`ll Come! The Legend of Ace in the Land of Wano!\",\"number\":894,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Otama`s gratitude towards Luffy knows no bounds! But the feast she cooks him exhausts her food stores completely! As she suffers from poor drinking water, her companion tells the story of the mysterious outsider she waits for - Ace!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必ず来る ワノ国のエース伝説!\"},{\"title\":\"Side Story! The World`s Greatest Bounty Hunter, Cidre!\",\"number\":895,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ambushed and outgunned by a skilled bounty hunter Cidre’s group, the Straw Hats rely on the Sunny`s Coup de Burst to escape! But they end up stranded without cola! A nearby soda island offers a solution - but Luffy is quickly in over his head! Luckily a vivacious old friend is nearby!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特別編! 最強の賞金狩りシードル\"},{\"title\":\"Side Story! Clash! Luffy vs. the King of Carbonation!\",\"number\":896,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Boa Hancock square off against the Cidre Guild! These unscrupulous bounty hunters have one thing in mind - profit at any cost! When the battle looks won, Cidre gears up in a menacing power suit!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特別編! 決戦! ルフィVS炭酸王\"},{\"title\":\"Save Otama! Straw Hat, Bounding Through the Wasteland!\",\"number\":897,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Otama recounts her promise to Ace while Luffy rushes her to medical attention. But just as they reach the wasteland, a familiar face comes into view! But Kaido`s underlings show up too!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お玉救え 麦わら荒野を駆ける!\"},{\"title\":\"The Headliner! Hawkins the Magician Appears!\",\"number\":898,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Otama’s temperature is going up and Luffy has no time to waste! However, Hawkins, one of Kaido’s Headliners, blocks their way by showing his unique powers and skills which can harm his own men.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"真打ち! 魔術師ホーキンス登場\"},{\"title\":\"Defeat Is Inevitable! The Strawman`s Fierce Attack!\",\"number\":899,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Zoro have been stalled by Hawkins but their fortune looks bright as they are guided by a woman who Zoro had saved. She leads them to a teahouse and to an herbal remedy for the river poison. All the while, old acquaintances look on from a distance!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敗北確定 ストローマンの猛攻!\"},{\"title\":\"The Greatest Day of My Life! Otama and Her Sweet Red-bean Soup!\",\"number\":900,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Otama`s life is saved by Otsuru at her teahouse. The proud Otama finds it hard to take more kindness. The group learns of the Okobore Town - living on the cast-offs of the officials! Then, suddenly, they were attacked by the Shogun’s men!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最高の日 お玉初めてのおしるこ\"},{\"title\":\"Charging into the Enemy`s Territory! Bakura Town: Where Officials Thrive!\",\"number\":901,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Otama has been kidnapped by the Gifters! She is taken to a flourishing town called Bakura Town where a creepy-looking Headliner was expecting her. Luffy and Zoro rush to rescue her along with a samurai, Okiku!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵陣突入 役人はびこる博羅町!\"},{\"title\":\"The Yokozuna Appears! The Invincible Urashima Goes After Okiku!\",\"number\":902,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Luffy, Zoro, and Okiku bounce through Bakura Town on Komachiyo’s back, looking for the kidnapped Otama, a sumo wrestler comes flying towards them! Interested, they go down to watch sumo but the undefeated yokozuna Urashima has been expecting Okiku there and shows his brutal nature!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"横綱登場 お菊狙う無敵の浦島!\"},{\"title\":\"A Climactic Sumo Battle! Straw Hat vs. the Strongest Ever Yokozuna!\",\"number\":903,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy challenges Urashima, the strongest yokozuna in the Land of Wano, to a sumo match! Urashima even uses illegal moves to beat Luffy at any cost! Meanwhile, Holdem tells Otama that he knows she committed a crime and he has to punish her for it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"相撲決戦 麦わらVS最強の横綱!\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Rages! Rescue Otama from Danger!\",\"number\":904,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After sending the yokozuna Urashima flying, Luffy and his clan continue their search for Bakura Town’s boss to save Otama! They finally find the boss, Holdem, one of the Beast Pirates’ Headliners, and Otama who is hanging in the mouth of a lion in Holdem’s stomach.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ激怒 ピンチのお玉を救え!\"},{\"title\":\"Taking Back Otama! A Fierce Fight Against Holdem!\",\"number\":905,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Facing Holdem who is holding Otama as hostage, Luffy prepares for a fight but Okiku tries to stop him by sharing who is really ruling the region. Meanwhile, Basil Hawkins who is also working for Kaido and chasing after Luffy, is confronted by a mysterious figure.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お玉奪還 激闘! ホールデム戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Duel! The Magician and the Surgeon of Death!\",\"number\":906,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Taking down Holdem, Luffy rescues Otama and tries to catch up to Zoro and Okiku who stole the food treasure ship and started a mad dash to get out of the town! Meanwhile, Trafalgar Law’s attempt to silence Basil Hawkins fails when he hears bad news about his alliance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一騎打ち 魔術師と死の外科医!\"},{\"title\":\"Romance Dawn\",\"number\":907,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"This is a story of Luffy in an alternate reality. While sailing on the sea by himself, a strange bird crashes into his small boat. He looks up to find a giant ship where a girl named Ann has been captured. It seems like the bird belongs to her.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"20周年特別編「ROMANCE DAWN」\"},{\"title\":\"The Coming of the Treasure Ship! Luffytaro Returns the Favor!\",\"number\":908,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and the others dash out of BakuraTown on the treasure ship filled with food! Luffy catches up to them bringing ahuge bucket of fresh water! Then, they distribute the food and the water to thepeople of Okobore Town who were thirsty and hungry.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"宝船到来 ルフィ太郎の恩返し!\"},{\"title\":\"Mysterious Grave Markers! A Reunion at the Ruins of Oden Castle!\",\"number\":909,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy arrives at the ruins of Oden Castle following Law and finds the graves of his friends, Kin’emon and the others. As Law starts telling the already-stunned Luffy about the creepy story of Kin’emon’s ghost, Luffy sees it coming towards him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"謎の墓標 おでん城跡での再会!\"},{\"title\":\"A Legendary Samurai! The Man Who Roger Admired!\",\"number\":910,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kin’emon tells Luffy and the others about how Kozuki Oden made Kuri into a peaceful region and became its Daimyo. However, he was set up by Kaido and Kurozumi Orochi and executed. Kin’emon and his fellow vassals ran to Oden Castle in flames to save Oden’s wife Toki and children but Toki told him a shocking truth.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の侍 ロジャーが惚れた男!\"},{\"title\":\"Bringing Down the Emperor of the Sea! A Secret Raid Operation Begins!\",\"number\":911,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kin’emon and the others crossed through time by the power of Kozuki Toki, Momonosuke’s mother, and arrived at the Land of Wano 20 years later, a totally different country before their eyes. However, discovering that there were still their allies there, they started preparing to take down Kaido and Orochi who ruined the country.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"打倒四皇 極秘討ち入り作戦発動\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Man in the World! Shutenmaru, the Thieves Brigade Chief!\",\"number\":912,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ashura Doji, one of the allies Kin’emon wants to search for, has become the head of a thieves brigade and they now raid Okobore Town taking away the food that Luffy gave to the people. Ashura Doji, under the name Shutenmaru, then faces Kaido’s right-hand man and gets into a fierce fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の男 盗賊団棟梁・酒天丸!\"},{\"title\":\"Everyone Is Annihilated! Kaido`s Furious Blast Breath!\",\"number\":913,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The drunken Kaido flies above Okobore Town in his dragon form and threatens Shutenmaru and all the people in the town. Luffy, Law, Kin’emon, and Okiku start running towards the town to rescue them. However, Kaido heads towards the ruins of Oden Castle where they left their crew behind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全員消滅 カイドウ怒りのボロブレス!\"},{\"title\":\"Finally Clashing! The Ferocious Luffy vs. Kaido!\",\"number\":914,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Luffy sees Kaido shattering the ruins of Oden Castle where he left his friends, he becomes enraged and attacks Kaido! Soon after, he finds out Kaido even assaulted Otama who was riding on Speed’s back to her home. Furious, Luffy reveals himself to Kaido and starts to retaliate!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遂に激突 猛攻ルフィVSカイドウ\"},{\"title\":\"Destructive! One Shot, One Kill: Thunder Bagua!\",\"number\":915,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An infuriated Luffy strikes blow after blow on the drunken Kaido. When he activates Gear Four Bounce-Man and launches even more powerful attacks, Kaido fights back and knocks him out with just one blow. Law tries to rescue Luffy but is interrupted by Hawkins and now Kaido approaches Luffy, unconscious on the ground.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"破壊的! 一撃必殺の雷鳴八卦!\"},{\"title\":\"A Living Hell! Luffy, Humiliated in the Great Mine!\",\"number\":916,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy gets beaten by Kaido and is sent to a great mine where prisoners are made to work in forced labor. There, he finds an unexpected reunion. Meanwhile, Okiku is rushing to the ruins of Oden Castle in order to confirm the safety of the Straw Hats and the others.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生き地獄 ルフィ屈辱の大採掘場\"},{\"title\":\"The Holyland in Tumult! Emperor of the Sea Blackbeard Cackles!\",\"number\":917,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On Gloom Island in the Grand Line, Perona finds out that her captain, Gecko Moria, is alive and she is about to leave Dracule Mihawk who let her stay there for the last two years. Meanwhile, Moria raids the Pirate Island of Fullalead with his zombie army to take back his friend from Blackbeard.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖地激動 不敵に笑う四皇黒ひげ\"},{\"title\":\"It`s On! The Special Operation to Bring Down Kaido!\",\"number\":918,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dogstorm fights against Shutenmaru to ally with him for their operation but Shutenmaru still rejects their call. Meanwhile, Sanji and the others are on their mission to recruit like-minded people who become skeptical as they receive the secret message from the Kozuki Clan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出す 打倒カイドウ大計画!\"},{\"title\":\"Rampage! The Prisoners: Luffy and Kid!\",\"number\":919,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Excavation Labor Camp, Luffy competes against Kid by hauling stones for food and they both get tons of it. However, Dobon, a vice warden, becomes furious when he finds out all their provisions are gone, and gives Luffy and Kid a new sentence: death.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大暴れ! 囚人ルフィとキッド!\"},{\"title\":\"A Great Sensation! Sanji`s Special Soba!\",\"number\":920,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji’s Special Soba becomes very popular but some gang members come to disturb his business and knock over a customer’s bowl. Infuriated, Sanji takes them down and gives the customer, a little girl named Toko, another serving. Later, Sanji and his friends find out that Toko is an attendant to an important figure in the Land of Wano.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大評判! サンジの十八番[おはこ]そば!\"},{\"title\":\"Luxurious and Gorgeous! Wano`s Most Beautiful Woman: Komurasaki!\",\"number\":921,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Wano’s top courtesan Komurasaki is in procession and slowly makes her way to Orochi Palace. There is a crowd of people on the street as well as Sanji and the others. While everyone is fascinated by her, some seeking vengeance get in the Oiran’s way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"豪華絢爛 ワノ国一の美女・小紫\"},{\"title\":\"A Tale of Chivalry! Zoro and Tonoyasu`s Little Trip!\",\"number\":922,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro who has been wandering around the Land of Wano since he got separated from his friends meets a sycophant named Tonoyasu. Tonoyasu paid for Zoro’s sushi and to pay him back, Zoro gambles at dice. However, he realizes that the dealer and the others are cheating.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"任侠伝! ゾロとトの康二人旅!\"},{\"title\":\"A State of Emergency! Big Mom Closes In!\",\"number\":923,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is taken to the sycophant Tonoyasu’s poor hometown, Ebisu Town where people laugh away their misfortune. On the other hand, Wano’s Shogun – Orochi has a lavish banquet while Big Mom is closing in on the country at a furious speed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緊急事態 ビッグ・マム大接近!\"},{\"title\":\"The Capitol in an Uproar! Another Assassin Targets Sanji!\",\"number\":924,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Big Mom Pirates approach the Land of Wano, Kaido’s subordinates led by King and Queen try to get rid of them. Meanwhile, in the Flower Capital, another member of the Animal Kingdom Pirates, Page One, attacks every soba restaurant in the city, in search of Sanji.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"都騒然! サンジ狙う新たな刺客\"},{\"title\":\"Dashing! The Righteous Soba Mask!\",\"number\":925,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji faces Page One, a Headliner of the Animal Kingdom Pirates, who questions the soba cook’s true identity. Sanji uses Germa’s device for the first time and transforms himself into Stealth Black while dubbing himself Soba Mask.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大活躍! 正義のおそばマスク!\"},{\"title\":\"A Desperate Situation! Orochi`s Menacing Oniwabanshu!\",\"number\":926,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the banquet grows livelier at Orochi’s Castle, Robin is confronted by his ninja force called Oniwabanshu. In the meanwhile in Kuri, Chopper, Tama, and Momonosuke train themselves preparing for the incoming battle but are interrupted when they find someone washed up on the beach.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命 脅威のオロチお庭番衆\"},{\"title\":\"Pandemonium! The Monster Snake, Shogun Orochi!\",\"number\":927,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the banquet, the Shogun Orochi starts to talk about his late old enemy which bores the attendees. Suddenly, the Oiran’s child attendant Toko bursts with laughter and won’t stop. Orochi becomes furious and attacks her, but an unexpected person stands in his way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"修羅場! 怒れる大蛇 将軍オロチ\"},{\"title\":\"The Flower Falls! The Final Moment of the Most Beautiful Woman in the Land of Wano!\",\"number\":928,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to save her child attendant Toko, the top Oiran Komurasaki stands up to the Shogun Orochi, but the yakuza boss Kyoshiro interrupts and does something that no one expected. Meanwhile, Robin is trying to get out of Orochi’s Castle with the help of Nami and Brook.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"花散る! ワノ国一の美女の最期\"},{\"title\":\"The Bond Between Prisoners! Luffy and Old Man Hyo!\",\"number\":929,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami, Robin, and the others got away from Oden’s Castle and now discuss what they have found out about the enemy so far. Meanwhile, Chopper’s group sets off to rescue Luffy from the Excavation Labor Camp where, at the same time, Luffy is in big trouble.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"囚人の絆 ルフィとヒョウじい!\"},{\"title\":\"A Lead Performer! Queen the Plague Emerges!\",\"number\":930,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Excavation Labor Camp in Udon, Luffy tries to save Old Man Hyo and stands up to Vice Warden Daifuku and Warden Babanuki with his physical strength weakened by the Sea Prism Stone cuffs. Then when a Lead Performer of the Animal Kingdom Pirates, Queen the Plague, comes to the camp, Luffy makes an escape!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大看板! 疫災のクイーン現る!\"},{\"title\":\"Climb Up! Luffy`s Desperate Escape!\",\"number\":931,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Old Man Hyo try to climb up the wall and break out of the Excavation Labor Camp, but Queen the Plague stands in their way and gives them a hard time! Meanwhile, Nami and Robin experience a public bathhouse along with Shinobu and come to know about the Land of Wano’s great yakuza boss.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"よじ登れ ルフィ決死の逃走劇!\"},{\"title\":\"Dead or Alive! Queen`s Sumo Inferno!\",\"number\":932,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy fights quite a few Queen’s men at once in the deadly sumo match while protecting Old Man Hyo! Meanwhile, Nami, Robin, and Shinobu are cornered as Hawkins comes to raid the bathhouse. However, someone who they don’t expect to be there pops up from nowhere to save them.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生か死か クイーンの大相撲地獄[インフェルノ]\"},{\"title\":\"Gyukimaru! Zoro Fights a Duel on Bandit`s Bridge!\",\"number\":933,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy deals with the endless supply of opponents trying to figure out the way to use Haki that Rayleigh taught him a while ago. Meanwhile, Zoro faces Gyukimaru who is accusing him of stealing Shusui, however, their duel is interrupted by a woman’s scream.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"牛鬼丸! ゾロおいはぎ橋の決闘\"},{\"title\":\"A Big Turnover! The Three-Sword Style Overcomes Danger!\",\"number\":934,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The duel between Zoro and Gyukimaru is interrupted by Kamazo, Orochi’s assassin who came after a little girl Toko. Without Shusui, Zoro has a hard time fighting the two at the same time, but he finds an unlikely third sword to take down the enemies.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大逆転! 死線を越えた三刀流!\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro, Stunned! The Shocking Identity of the Mysterious Woman!\",\"number\":935,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy’s next enemies in the deadly sumo match in the Excavation Labor Camp are two tough Gifters. Much to Old Man Hyo’s surprise, Luffy keeps practicing using Haki properly at the same time as he fights them. Meanwhile, the wounded Zoro wakes up to find out the stunning identity of the mysterious woman he saved.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゾロ驚愕 衝撃! 謎の美女の正体\"},{\"title\":\"Get the Hang of It! The Land of Wano`s Haki: Ryuo!\",\"number\":936,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hiyori tells Zoro a stunning story of escaping the incident 20 years ago and surviving until the present day. Meanwhile, Luffy stills struggles to master the Haki of the Color of Arms, but a surprising person steps up and gives an example.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"会得せよ ワノ国の覇気・流桜!\"},{\"title\":\"Tonoyasu! Ebisu Town`s Most Loved!\",\"number\":937,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy continues training himself to use Haki with Old Man Hyo’s help, but the battle is suddenly suspended and shortly thereafter Raizo appears in front of them. Meanwhile, Nami, Usopp, and the others are wondering who Tonoyasu, Ebisu Town’s hero, really is.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"トの康! えびす町一の人気者!\"},{\"title\":\"Shaking the Nation! The Identity of Ushimitsu Kozo the Chivalrous Thief!\",\"number\":938,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ushimitsu Kozo the great thief who robbed from the rich and gave to the poor gets caught and his true identity stuns Orochi and the others. When Toko hears the news, she gets very upset and so is Zoro when he hears the reason.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃走る 義賊丑三つ小僧の正体\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hats Run! Save the Captive Tonoyasu!\",\"number\":939,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tonoyasu has been strung up and is soon-to-be executed. The people of the Land of Wano recognize who he really is and start raising their voice while the Straw Hats rush to save him. Then, Tonoyasu starts addressing the nation and the corrupt Shogun Orochi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味疾[はし]る! 救え囚われのトの康\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro`s Fury! The Truth About the Smile!\",\"number\":940,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"By the time Kin’emon and the others notice that Yasuie is trying to sacrifice his life to save their raid plan, it was all too late. Ebisu Town`s people laughing out loud annoys Zoro, but when Hiyori tells him the reason behind it, he is in for a shock!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゾロの怒り SMILEの真実!\"},{\"title\":\"Toko`s Tears! Orochi`s Pitiless Bullets!\",\"number\":941,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hiyori and Shinobu tearfully tell the Straw Hats the truth behind Ebisu Town residents` cheerfulness and smiles, which infuriates them. When Yasuie’s daughter, Toko, runs to her father’s body, Orochi recognizes who she is and takes a shot at her!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"トコの涙! オロチ非情の銃弾!\"},{\"title\":\"The Straw Hats Step In! An Uproarious Deadly Battle at the Execution Ground!\",\"number\":942,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Sanji start fighting against Orochi’s clan. Nami and the rest of the Straw Hats join them. Meanwhile, at the Excavation Labor Camp, a new criminal, Hitokiri Kamazo, has arrived. And someone else who is brought to the site reveals the shocking truth about Kamazo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一味乱入! 騒然! 処刑場の激闘\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Determination! Win Through the Sumo Inferno!\",\"number\":943,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro keeps fighting Kyoshiro, but Orochi’s Oniwabanshu comes to back Kyoshiro up. Meanwhile, at the Excavation Labor Camp, Queen announces the restart of the Sumo Inferno with a new cruel rule which is painful not only to Luffy, but also to Drake and Killer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィの決意 破れ大相撲地獄[インフェルノ]!\"},{\"title\":\"The Storm Has Come! A Raging Big Mom!\",\"number\":944,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kin’emon apologizes Ashura Doji AKA Shutenmaru for goading Holdem to attack Atamayama where Ashura’s hideout was located, and asks him to join the fight against Kaido. Meanwhile, Chopper and his group finally arrived at the Excavation Labor Camp and Big Mom forces her way in to find her favorite soup!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"嵐到来! 大暴れビッグ・マム!\"},{\"title\":\"A Grudge over Red-bean Soup! Luffy Gets into a Desperate Situation!\",\"number\":945,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Craving red-bean soup, Big Mom attacks Queen, the Animal Kingdom Pirates’ Lead Performer who reins over Udon. However, when she finds out that the pot is empty, she turns her wrath against the one who ate it all: Luffy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おしるこの恨み ルフィ絶体絶命\"},{\"title\":\"Stop the Emperor of the Sea! Queen`s Secret Plan!\",\"number\":946,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After finding out that Luffy ate the whole pot ofthe red-bean soup that she was looking for, Big Mom becomes infuriated and goesafter him. Meanwhile, Queen, the Lead Performer, comes up with a plan to stopthe rampaging Big Mom.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四皇を止めろ! クイーンの秘策\"},{\"title\":\"Brutal Ammunition! The Plague Rounds Aim at Luffy!\",\"number\":947,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Queen hastily ties up the sleeping Big Mom and carries her to Onigashima leaving Udon to Babanuki. Babanuki uses a weapon that Queen made to threaten inmates and make them catch Luffy, but a mysterious figure emerges from the forbidden cell to save Luffy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最凶兵器! ルフィを狙う疫災[エキサイト]弾\"},{\"title\":\"Start Fighting Back! Luffy and the Akazaya Samurai!\",\"number\":948,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kawamatsu the Kappa is freed and stands up against Babanuki and his underlings! Listening to Old Man Hyo’s suggestion, Raizo and Kiku reveal their true identities which give the desperate prisoners not only a shock but also some hope.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"反撃開始! ルフィと赤鞘の侍!\"},{\"title\":\"We`re Here to Win! Luffy`s Desperate Scream!\",\"number\":949,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy faces those who are infected by the Plague Rounds and the non-infected prisoners who submit to the authority of Udon. To open their eyes, Luffy takes a measure that will risk his life. However, the Chief Warden Babanuki has something up his sleeve.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝ちに来た! ルフィ決死の叫び\"},{\"title\":\"Warriors` Dream! Luffy`s Conquer of Udon!\",\"number\":950,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The freed prisoners in Udon refuse to fight alongside Luffy because he is a pirate. Raizo and Old Man Hyo try their best to convince them, but an unexpected person stands up to bring the prisoners hope after taking down Kaido!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兵[つわもの]どもが夢! ルフィ兎丼制圧!\"},{\"title\":\"Orochi`s Hunting Party! The Ninja Group vs. Zoro!\",\"number\":951,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After standing against Orochi, Zoro and Hiyori are chased by Orochi’s ninja group. Meanwhile, Orochi is told that they captured Trafalgar Law as the people of the Flower Capital prepare for the upcoming Fire Festival.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オロチの追手! 忍者軍団VSゾロ\"},{\"title\":\"Tension Rises in Onigashima! Two Emperors of the Sea Meet?!\",\"number\":952,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and Franky join Kanjuro who has taken Yasuie’s dead body to bury him with Oden, and together they hit the road. Robin, Usopp, and Brook are at the dock trying to figure out a way to pass through a check point. Meanwhile, Big Mom and Kaido finally clash at Onigashima.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鬼ヶ島緊迫! 遭遇!? 二人の四皇\"},{\"title\":\"Hiyori`s Confession! A Reunion at Bandit`s Bridge!\",\"number\":953,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the clash between Kaido and Big Mom continues, Queen looks for a way to get out of Onigashima. Meanwhile in Udon, Old Man Hyo finds his former allies, four bosses from each region. At Bandit’s Bridge, Hiyori and Kawamatsu finally see each other after a long time.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日和の告! おいはぎ橋の再会\"},{\"title\":\"Its Name Is Enma! Oden`s Great Swords!\",\"number\":954,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro runs after the warrior-monk who took his Shusui and Kawamatsu shares with Hiyori his memory of a fox that was guarding the graves in Ringo. As they catch up to Zoro, they find a room filled with swords. And Hiyori tells Zoro to give Shusui back to the Land of Wano.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"その名は閻魔! おでんの名刀!\"},{\"title\":\"A New Alliance?! Kaido`s Army Gathers!\",\"number\":955,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the day of the raid approaches, Law finds someone who might help him escape the prison and Kin’emon gathers up most of his main allies to discuss the raid plan. Meanwhile, at Onigashima, Kaido and Big Mom make a stunning declaration!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな同盟!? カイドウ軍大集結\"},{\"title\":\"Ticking Down to the Great Battle! The Straw Hats Go into Combat Mode!\",\"number\":956,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kin’emon, Momonosuke, and the others can’t fight back tears when they hear that Hiyori is alive.\\nZoro is stunned by Enma’s demonic power and its ties to him.\\nAnd as the day of the Fire Festival is finally in sight, Kin’emon and the others head out for the rendezvous point.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迫る決戦! 麦わら一味戦闘態勢\"},{\"title\":\"Big News! An Incident That Will Affect the Seven Warlords!\",\"number\":957,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The resolution that passed the Reverie and the incidents surrounding the conference stun people all over the world and corner the Seven Warlords of the Sea. Meanwhile, a Navy captain Koby secretly contacts someone who is currently in the Land of Wano.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大[ビッグ]ニュース! 七武海を襲う事件\"},{\"title\":\"A Legendary Battle! Garp and Roger!\",\"number\":958,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Admiral Issho and Fleet Admiral Sakazuki argue over the abolition of the Seven Warlord system and the alliance of the two Emperors of the Sea. Meanwhile, ex-Fleet Admiral Sengoku teaches the young Navy soldiers about the legendary Rocks Pirates that Kaido and Big Mom once belonged to along with all the other big names.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の戦い! ガープとロジャー\"},{\"title\":\"The Rendezvous Port! The Land of Wano Act Three Begins!\",\"number\":959,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On the day of the Fire Festival, Orochi leaves the mainland of the Land of Wano heading for Onigashima where a big banquet will take place. Meanwhile, at Tokage Port, the rendezvous point for the rebel group, Kin’emon and the others are stunned by the fact that none of their allies are there.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"約束の港! ワノ国編第三幕開幕\"},{\"title\":\"The Number-One Samurai in the Land of Wano! Here Comes Kozuki Oden!\",\"number\":960,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The night before the great battle, Orochi orders the destruction of the Sunny along with some bridges across the country to block Akazaya samurai’s allies from their rendezvous. Disappointed, the group of samurai still sets out for Onigashima with the memory of their beloved lord, Oden, in their hearts. However, 41 years ago, Oden was not respected by everyone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワノ国一の侍! 光月おでん登場\"},{\"title\":\"Tearfully Swearing Allegiance! Oden and Kin`emon!\",\"number\":961,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When the angry mountain god, the giant boar, almost kills Kin’emon, Oden steps in. Kin’emon is impressed when he sees Oden’s strength and pledges his life to serve him. Disavowed by his father, Oden decides to go on a journey around the country and gathers more followers along the way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙の弟子入り おでんと錦えもん\"},{\"title\":\"Changing Destiny! The Whitebeard Pirates Cast Ashore!\",\"number\":962,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oden transforms the wild land of Kuri into a habitable region and is made Daimyo over it. Then he meets Kawamatsu the Kappa and the two Minks, Dogstorm and Cat Viper, who become his followers like the others. Kin’emon and the other vassals are scolded by Yasuie when they try to steal money from him, and they begin reforming themselves for their lord Oden.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動く運命 漂着! 白ひげ海賊団!\"},{\"title\":\"Oden`s Determination! Whitebeard`s Test!\",\"number\":963,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Whitebeard and his crew dock at one of the ports in the Land of Wano with their broken ship and the news excites Oden. He runs to the port and asks Whitebeard to let him get on board the ship but the request is rejected. When the ship`s repairs are complete, Whitebeard tries to sneak out of the country, but he finds Oden tagging along.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おでんの決意! 白ひげの試練!\"},{\"title\":\"Whitebeard`s Little Brother! Oden`s Great Adventure!\",\"number\":964,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oden’s journey finally begins. He is in awe of all the things that he has never seen before. And for the first time in his life, he becomes a wanted person and makes the headlines which catches the eye of a high-profile figure. Meanwhile he becomes romantically involved with Toki and they have a child together.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白ひげの弟! おでんの大冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"Crossing Swords! Roger and Whitebeard!\",\"number\":965,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Land of Wano, the Shogun Sukiyaki falls critically ill and names Orochi proxy Shogun until Oden returns in case he dies. Meanwhile, Whitebeard’s ship carrying Oden docks at some island overseas, unaware that Gold Roger and his clan are fighting against the Navy on the other side of the island.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"交える刃! ロジャーと白ひげ!\"},{\"title\":\"Roger`s Wish! A New Journey!\",\"number\":966,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Roger is amazed when he finds out that Oden can read the script on the Ponegliff since he believes it will guide him to the last, undiscovered island where no man has ever been. Roger begs Whitebeard for permission to take Oden with him on a one-year journey. But Oden gives it some thought and speaks his mind as well!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ロジャーの願い! 新たな旅立ち\"},{\"title\":\"Devoting His Life! Roger`s Adventure!\",\"number\":967,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Singing out loud, the Roger Pirates continue on with their journey. They soar up to the island above the clouds and go down into the deep sea to get to the island at the sea bottom. Oden deciphers the Ponegliffs on those islands for Roger who believes those inscriptions will tell them the location of the last island on the Grand Line.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生涯をかけて! ロジャーの冒険\"},{\"title\":\"The King of the Pirates Is Born! Arriving at the Last Island!\",\"number\":968,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oden and the Roger Pirates head for the Land of Wano to obtain a copy of the Road Ponegliff. Oden sees Kin’emon and the others for the first time in years, but he immediately returns to the sea leaving his wife and children behind. Then, after stopping by at the Mokomo Dukedom and getting a copy of the last Road Ponegliff, the Roger Pirates finally make it to the last island.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海賊王誕生 到達! \\\"最後の島\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"To the Land of Wano! The Roger Pirates Disband!\",\"number\":969,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After reaching Laugh Tale, Roger declares the disbanding of his pirate group and disembarks first. Oden gets dropped off at the Land of Wano and reunites with his family and retainers. Later, he hears that Orochi took over the country with the help of a strong pirate named Kaido after the Shogun Sukiyaki’s death and becomes enraged by stories of his tyrannical acts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワノ国へ! ロジャー海賊団解散\"},{\"title\":\"Sad News! The Opening of the Great Pirate Era!\",\"number\":970,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Enraged by Orochi’s tyrannical acts, Oden raids his castle in the Flower Capital and points his sword at Orochi. However, hours later, people who were waiting for Oden to come out after defeating Orochi see the unexpected. Meanwhile, the King of the Pirates Roger’s execution and last words are printed in newspapers and spread across the world.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しき知らせ 大海賊時代幕開け\"},{\"title\":\"Raid! Oden and the Akazaya Nine!\",\"number\":971,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oden keeps dancing naked in the Flower Capital and losing all the trust of the people. One day, Orochi comes to Kuri and reveals his evil plan for the Land of Wano as well as his brutalities against the country’s mobster and Oden’s friend, Hyogoro and his wife. Despairing and in a rage, Oden finally decides to take down Orochi’s supporter, Kaido.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"討ち入り! おでんと赤鞘九人男\"},{\"title\":\"The End of the Battle! Oden vs. Kaido!\",\"number\":972,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaido comes to the mainland along with his troops to fight against Oden and the Akazaya samurai who were on their way to raid Kaido’s mansion. Even though Oden’s group are unprepared and outnumbered, they fight hard to save the future of the Land of Wano.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決着の時! おでんVSカイドウ!\"},{\"title\":\"Boiled to Death! Oden`s One-hour Struggle!\",\"number\":973,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oden and the Akazaya members are sentenced to death by boiling in a pot. Oden asks for a chance to survive which is accepted by Kaido. Then, Oden enters the boiling pot holding his retainers over his head. Shinobu watches from among the spectators and reveals what Oden had been doing to save the country, to the surprise of the citizens.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"釜茹での刑 おでん決死の一時間\"},{\"title\":\"Oden Wouldn`t Be Oden If It Wasn`t Boiled!\",\"number\":974,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Oden continues trying to survive in the boiling pot holding his retainers over his head, people learn the truth from Shinobu and get shocked.\\nAt the same time, Oden tells his retainers the importance of opening the borders of the Land of Wano. Time ticks down for Oden and his clan’s freedom.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"\\\"煮えてなんぼのおでんに候\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"The Castle on Fire! The Fate of the Kozuki Clan!\",\"number\":975,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Kin’emon and the others run to Oden Castle to save Oden’s family, the castle is set on fire and Kaido attacks Toki and her children. Leaving Momonosuke to Kin’emon and Hiyori to Kawamatsu, Toki appears in front of the desperate people of the Land of Wano and gives a prophecy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"燃える城! 光月の一族の運命!\"},{\"title\":\"Back to the Present Day! 20 Years Later!\",\"number\":976,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After 20 years since Oden Castle burned down, Oden’s surviving retainers are working hard separately at their own missions, believing in Toki’s prophecy. The day of the Fire Festival has finally come and the whole army is now getting ready to head for Onigashima to raid Kaido!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再び現在! 二十年の時をこえて\"},{\"title\":\"The Sea Is for Pirates! Raid! To Onigashima!\",\"number\":977,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and thousands of allies who were supposed to be there are nowhere to be found, but Kin’emon and the others decide to set sail to the stormy sea in a small boat. Kaido’s army that appears out of nowhere and a betrayal drive the Akazaya members into a corner.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海は海賊! 討入り! いざ鬼ヶ島\"},{\"title\":\"The Worst Generation Charges In! The Battle of the Stormy Sea!\",\"number\":978,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Law, and Kid join the Akazaya samurai and begin to fight Kaido’s army. The three rivals from the Worst Generation compete with each other as they attack the enemy fleet with their ultimate skills. When it seems like they gain upper hand in the battle, another strong enemy appears to help Kaido’s army.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最悪の世代進撃! 嵐の海の戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Good Luck?! Leader Kin`emon`s Plot!\",\"number\":979,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akazaya members are surprised by help from their old mate and Kin’emon notices he made a big mistake which has luckily saved all his allies. As their battle against Kaido’s army heats up, the cornered Kanjuro makes a stunning move.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"強運!? リーダー錦えもんの一計\"},{\"title\":\"A Tearful Promise! The Kidnapped Momonosuke!\",\"number\":980,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Swept away by Kanjuro, Momonosuke remembers his father, tries to rise above his fear, and speak to his allies. Luffy and the others start heading for Onigashima, but Kaido’s army gets in their way again with a formidable weapon. However, a surprising figure comes to help the cornered Straw Hats.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙の約束! さらわれたモモの助\"},{\"title\":\"A New Member! `First Son of the Sea` Jimbei!\",\"number\":981,\"airDate\":\"2021-07-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the rest of the Straw Hat crew are excited to see Jimbei again and welcome him as a new member. Meanwhile, Law and the Akazaya members strategize on how to enter Onigashima and attack Kaido. As the Straw Hats approach the giant torii gate in front of Onigashima, they are attacked out of the blue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな仲間! 海侠のジンべエ!\"},{\"title\":\"Kaido`s Trump Card! The Tobi Roppo Appear!\",\"number\":982,\"airDate\":\"2021-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To Law and the others’ surprise, Luffy and the rest of the Straw Hats attack the giant torii gate in front of Onigashima. Meanwhile, Kaido and Orochi are having a big banquet on the island where Kaido’s formidable subordinates are also called in.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カイドウの切り札 飛び六胞登場\"},{\"title\":\"The Samurai Warriors` Earnestness! The Straw Hats Land at Onigashima!\",\"number\":983,\"airDate\":\"2021-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and the samurai warriors finally reach Onigashima! Before they set out for the castle as they planned, the samurai warriors use surprising but determined tactics to cut off their retreat which leave the Straw Hats in shock.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"侍たちの本気! 一味鬼ヶ島上陸\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Goes Out of Control?! Sneaking into Kaido`s Banquet!\",\"number\":984,\"airDate\":\"2021-07-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Eustass Kid and his clan start heading for Kaido`s castle head on waving Luffy off. Luffy and Zoro go after them to stop them from causing trouble, but they happen to step into Kaido’s banquet. Meanwhile, Kanjuro loses his way to Kaido in underground passages with Momonosuke who he kidnapped in tow.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ暴走!? 潜入カイドウの宴\"},{\"title\":\"Thinking of Otama! Luffy`s Furious Strike!\",\"number\":985,\"airDate\":\"2021-08-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Zoro each witness Kaido’s subordinates waste food at the banquet and make fun of the poor people in the Land of Wano. Thinking of Otama, a small girl who liked red-bean soup so much, both Luffy and Zoro become infuriated and create turmoil.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お玉への思い ルフィ怒りの一撃\"},{\"title\":\"Fighting Music! An Ability That Harms Luffy!\",\"number\":986,\"airDate\":\"2021-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After making a scene at the Golden Festival, Luffy and Zoro try to get away, but Queen announces his subordinates that anyone who catches them will be rewarded with a position in the Tobi Roppo. Scratchmen Apoo stands Luffy and Zoro’s way and with his ability to use music as a weapon, he launches unpredictable attacks which corner Luffy and Zoro.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦う音楽[ミュージック]! ルフィを襲う能力!\"},{\"title\":\"His Dream Broken?! The Trap That Lures Sanji!\",\"number\":987,\"airDate\":\"2021-08-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Haccha, a supergiant Number, joins in and the pursuit of Luffy and the others becomes even more intense. Meanwhile, Kin’emon changes his strategy and his group tries to infiltrate the castle from its side, but there is an unexpected change of the floor plan which coincidentally makes Sanji excited.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夢やぶれる!? サンジを誘う罠!\"},{\"title\":\"Reinforcements Arrive! The Commander of the Whitebeard Pirates!\",\"number\":988,\"airDate\":\"2021-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Law, Kin’emon, and all the others are trying to infiltrate Kaido’s castle from all sides. Meanwhile, Big Mom’s children are climbing up the waterfall towards Onigashima again, but this time, Marco the Phoenix appears from nowhere and stands in their way!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"援軍到着! 白ひげ海賊団隊長!\"},{\"title\":\"The Pact Between Men! The Fierce Fighting of Brachio Tank!\",\"number\":989,\"airDate\":\"2021-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The furious Big Mom chases Brachio Tank driven by Chopper and Usopp, but they bravely fight back! Meanwhile, Kanjuro takes the battered and bruised Momonosuke to Kaido and Orochi, then breaks the news to them about Oden’s retainers who were thought to be dead.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"漢[おとこ]の誓い! 激闘ブラキオタンク\"},{\"title\":\"Thunder Bagua! Here Comes Kaido`s Son!\",\"number\":990,\"airDate\":\"2021-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy runs into Ulti and Page One, members of the Tobi Roppo from the Animal Kingdom Pirates. Hearing that he aims to become the King of the Pirates, the brother and sister duo become infuriated and turn themselves into massive beasts. When Luffy is driven into a corner, someone wearing a demon mask appears and whisks him away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雷鳴八卦! 登場カイドウの息子\"},{\"title\":\"Enemy or Ally? Luffy and Yamato!\",\"number\":991,\"airDate\":\"2021-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Evading Ulti and Page One, strong members of the Tobi Roppo, Luffy tries to find out what Kaido’s son Yamato’s motive is. However, the two get in a fight. Taking Luffy’s punishing attacks, Yamato remembers someone he fought against in the past.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵か? 味方か? ルフィとヤマト\"},{\"title\":\"Desire to Be Oden! Yamato`s Dream!\",\"number\":992,\"airDate\":\"2021-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akazaya members who were on board Law’s Polar Tang finally reach Onigashima and see someone who they didn’t expect. Kaido’s son Yamato starts telling his story to Luffy, shares his passion, and reveals what’s behind his mask!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おでんになりたい ヤマトの思い\"},{\"title\":\"Explosive?! The Handcuffs That Shackle Yamato`s Freedom!\",\"number\":993,\"airDate\":\"2021-09-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the back entrance of Onigashima, the Akazaya members try to get inside the gate, but they’re blocked by their former colleague Kanjuro. Meanwhile, as Kaido’s son Yamato shows Luffy the handcuffs that have restricted his freedom for years, they hear Kaido making a speech on his grand plan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"爆発!? ヤマトの自由を縛る錠!\"},{\"title\":\"The Akazaya Face-off! Kikunojo vs. Kanjuro!\",\"number\":994,\"airDate\":\"2021-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaido’s plan to obtain the great treasure infuriates Orochi, but his unexpected violent move silences everyone. Meanwhile at the back entrance of Onigashima, Kikunojo squares off against Kanjuro and gets into an emotional fight with her former colleague.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"赤鞘一騎打ち 菊之丞VSカン十郎\"},{\"title\":\"Raid! Inheriting Oden`s Will\",\"number\":995,\"airDate\":\"2021-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akazaya members start charging towards Kaido from the back of Onigashima. Meanwhile, at the Performance Floor, Kaido closes in on Momonosuke shivering in terror and asks him the ultimate question which will determine his fate.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"討入り! 受け継ぐおでんの意志\"},{\"title\":\"Onigashima in Tumult! Luffy`s All-Out War Begins!\",\"number\":996,\"airDate\":\"2021-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akazaya members deliver a crushing blow to Kaido. Luffy and Yamato try to back them up, but Ulti stands in their way and Big Mom spots Luffy. Meanwhile, Nami and Carrot free themselves from their enemies and move on to take back Zeus!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鬼ヶ島激動 ルフィ全面戦争開始\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Under the Moon! The Berserker, Sulong the Moon Lion!\",\"number\":997,\"airDate\":\"2021-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Animal Kingdom Pirates gasp with surprise to see thousands of samurai warriors coming into the castle. In his dragon form, Kaido goes outside to fight the Akazaya members under the moon. However, the Akazaya members have secret weapons to use against him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月下の戦い 狂戦士\\\"月の獅子[スーロン]\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"Zeus` Treason?! The Cornered Nami!\",\"number\":998,\"airDate\":\"2021-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shinobu tries to rescue the weakened Momonosuke but is found by King and attacked. On the other hand, Nami takes back Zeus from Big Mom and runs away but loses him again and gets chased by Zeus who is ordered to kill to her by Big Mom.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゼウスの反逆!? ナミ絶体絶命!\"},{\"title\":\"I`ll Protect You! Yamato Meets Momonosuke!\",\"number\":999,\"airDate\":\"2021-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Franky faces Big Mom with the help of Robin and Jimbei, but the Numbers come interrupting their battle. One of them holds Brachio Tank with Usopp and Chopper inside in his hand. Meanwhile, Yamato, the self-proclaimed Oden, finally meets his son Momonosuke.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"君を守る 邂逅ヤマトとモモの助\"},{\"title\":\"Overwhelming Strength! The Straw Hats Come Together!\",\"number\":1000,\"airDate\":\"2021-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Minks struggle with a poor hand against the Gifters, Kin’emon tries to assist them, but Dogstorm and Cat Viper stop him and start fighting for the other Minks! Meanwhile, Luffy and Zoro try to get to the rooftop to help Kin’emon and the others, but Queen and King get in their way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"圧倒的戦力! 麦わらの一味集結\"},{\"title\":\"A Risky Invitation! A Plot to Eliminate Queen!\",\"number\":1001,\"airDate\":\"2021-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Who’s-Who invites Drake and Hawkins to a plot to kill Queen. Meanwhile, the Straw Hats are facing two large monsters that remind them of the Giant who they once struggled to take down. As Luffy charges towards them, someone unexpected comes in to help.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危険な誘い! クイーン抹殺計画\"},{\"title\":\"A New Rivalry! Nami and Ulti!\",\"number\":1002,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Drake vows to fight alongside Luffy, but Zoro becomes skeptical and challenges him to a fight. Meanwhile, Usopp’s practical joke pushes Nami into confronting Ulti, who is infuriated since her brother got attacked.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな因縁! ナミとうるティ!\"},{\"title\":\"A Heroic Blade! Akazaya vs. Kaido, Again Once More!\",\"number\":1003,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Queen uses a new version of the Plague Bullets which will turn the samurai into ogre-like monsters. Meanwhile, the Minks keep pushing the fight against the Gifters and drive Jack into a corner. However, Kaido stands up for his subordinate.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲壮の刃! 赤鞘VSカイドウ再び\"},{\"title\":\"An Inherited Technique! Unleashing Oden`s Secret Swordplay!\",\"number\":1004,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy is hurrying to the rooftop and Yamato is trying to catch up to Momonosuke to protect him, the Akazaya members finally face off against Kaido. Hearing Kaido jeering at them for being weak, the samurai retainers attack him relentlessly, remembering the day Oden told them to master his sword skill.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"受け継ぎし技 炸裂おでんの秘剣\"},{\"title\":\"The Power of \\\"Ice Oni\\\"! A New Version of the Plague Rounds!\",\"number\":1005,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Queen, the Lead Performer, blazes away at samurai on the Performance Floor with the special version of the Plague Rounds, which turns them into hideous ogres that corner Zoro and Drake. Meanwhile, Luffy and Sanji, who are on their way to the rooftop, run into another Headliner with a special ability.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"「氷鬼」の威力! 新たな疫災[エキサイト]弾\"},{\"title\":\"I Won`t Forgive Him! Chopper`s Determination!\",\"number\":1006,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"King orders his subordinates to go after Momonosuke. Shinobu tries to protect him, but they are cornered by one of the strong Lead Performers from the Animal Kingdom Pirates. Meanwhile, seeing people suffering from Queen’s Plague Rounds, Chopper is determined to save everyone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"許さねェ! チョッパーの決意!\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro`s Pursuit! Ice Oni Tag!\",\"number\":1007,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yamato fights Sasaki and the Animal Kingdom Pirates Armored Division to protect Momonosuke. Meanwhile, Zoro tries to get rid of the Gifters who have turned into Ice Oni, but Queen starts a horrible game which involves the antibody for the virus.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゾロの追撃! 氷鬼 in 鬼ゴッコ\"},{\"title\":\"Nami Surrenders?! Ulti`s Fierce Headbutt!\",\"number\":1008,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ulti and Page One of the Tobi Roppo chase Nami and Usopp, after being infuriated by their attack as well as Luffy’s declaration of becoming the King of the Pirates. Cornered, Nami gives in and Ulti pushes her to say the unthinkable.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミ降伏!? うるティの猛頭突き\"},{\"title\":\"Sasaki`s Onslaught! Armored Division vs. Yamato!\",\"number\":1009,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Carrot and Wanda step in to help Marco, who is cornered by Big Mom and Perospero. In the meantime, Yamato fights a fierce battle against the Animal Kingdom Pirates Armored Division led by Sasaki, while protecting Shinobu and Momonosuke.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ササキの猛攻 装甲部隊VSヤマト\"},{\"title\":\"Eliminate the Ice Oni! Chopper`s Fire Trick!\",\"number\":1010,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro and Drake continue to chase Apoo to get the antibody against Ice Oni, while Chopper is trying to figure out how to fight the virus. In the castle, Luffy, Jimbei, and Sanji are climbing up the stairs to reach the rooftop where the Akazaya members’ tough battle against Kaido rages on.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"氷鬼を破れ チョッパーの火策!\"},{\"title\":\"It`s Not Okay! The Spider Lures Sanji!\",\"number\":1011,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji hears a woman’s scream for help and dashes into the room the scream can be heard from. However, it’s a trap set up by Black Maria of the Tobi Roppo. Meanwhile, Luffy and Jimbei who are trying to reach the rooftop get help from the unexpected.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"よかねェよ!! サンジを誘う蜘蛛\"},{\"title\":\"A Turnaround Move! The Flames of Marco the Phoenix!\",\"number\":1012,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Kaido begins the New Onigashima Project, Marco appears in front of Chopper and the others, who are struggling with Ice Oni. The members of the Tobi Roppo continue to give the Straw Hats a hard time while their former member helps Zoro.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逆転の一手! 不死鳥マルコの炎\"},{\"title\":\"Yamato`s Past! The Man Who Came for an Emperor of the Sea!\",\"number\":1013,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yamato tells Momonosuke and Shinobu that he once confronted a man, who came to Onigashima looking to get Kaido’s head. His name was Ace. The two of them engaged in a fierce battle that eventually turned into an important friendship.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヤマトの過去 四皇の首を狙う男\"},{\"title\":\"Marco`s Tears! The Bond of the Whitebeard Pirates!\",\"number\":1014,\"airDate\":\"2022-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The formidable Lead Performers of the Animal Kingdom Pirates stand in Zoro’s way as he tries to get to the rooftop. Marco sees his late comrade in Zoro’s determination and tries to pave the way for him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マルコの涙! 白ひげ海賊団の絆\"},{\"title\":\"Straw Hat Luffy! The Man Who Will Become the King of the Pirates!\",\"number\":1015,\"airDate\":\"2022-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yamato tells Momonosuke and Shinobu about how Ace gave him hope for the future. Meanwhile, Luffy and the other allied pirates from the Worst Generation make it to the rooftop to finally face off against Kaido and Big Mom.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麦わらのルフィ 海賊王になる男\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle of the Monsters! The Three Stubborn Captains!\",\"number\":1016,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy’s strong attack reminds Kaido of all the strong ones he’s ever met. On the other hand, Luffy, Law, and Kid keep quarreling amongst themselves. Meanwhile, Sanji is caught and interrogated by Black Maria in what he calls “heaven.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怪物決戦! 意地張りあう三船長\"},{\"title\":\"A Barrage of Powerful Techniques! The Fierce Attacks of the Worst Generation!\",\"number\":1017,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy, Law, Kid, Zoro, and Killer keep landing hard blows against Kaido in tandem despite the arguing. However, when Big Mom steps in and unleashes powerful lightning strikes, the tide turns for all except one of the rookies.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大技連発! 最悪の世代の猛攻!\"},{\"title\":\"Kaido Laughs! The Emperors of the Sea vs. the New Generation!\",\"number\":1018,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy pummels Kaido with his well-trained Kong Gatling and delivers a final blow using all his strength. Big Mom tries to fight back, but Law gets in her way and Kid and Killer also try to finish Kaido off.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"笑うカイドウ! 四皇VS新世代!\"},{\"title\":\"Otama`s Secret Plan! Operation Kibi Dango!\",\"number\":1019,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After watching the Straw Hats’ departure to Onigashima, Tama wondered if there was anything she could do to help the Straw Hats and the samurai. Now that she’s here on Onigashima, it’s time to execute her powerful plan – Operation Kibi Dango!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お玉の秘策! きびだんご大作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji`s Scream! An SOS Echoes over the Island!\",\"number\":1020,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji is captured and tortured by the merciless Black Maria. She names the terms of his release: to turn over one of his crewmates. He hesitates but has no other option. After much distress, he makes a move that surprises everyone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジ絶叫! 島中に響くSOS\"},{\"title\":\"Spank Strikes! Sanji`s Woman-trouble!\",\"number\":1021,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Robin bursts in to rescue Sanji along with Brook, and faces Black Maria, who is trying to keep Sanji as her pet. Meanwhile, Yamato, Momonosuke, and Shinobu are spotted hiding by the enemy, and they find themselves on the run again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スパンク炸裂! サンジの女難!\"},{\"title\":\"No Regrets! Luffy and Boss, a Master-Disciple Bond!\",\"number\":1022,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chopper works hard to make the cure for Ice Oni, even though he is turning into one himself. Meanwhile, the infected Boss Hyogoro the Flower regains his youth and fights fiercely to protect Chopper and the others.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悔いなし ルフィと親分師弟の絆\"},{\"title\":\"All Set! Chopperphage Nebulizer!\",\"number\":1023,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Seeing everyone turning into Ice Oni, there is nothing that the samurai warriors can do other than grieve. However, it wasn’t just them who were devastated by Queen’s raging virus. When their desperation and frustration peak, they hear a hopeful voice.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"準備OK! チョパファージ霧砲[ネブライザー]\"},{\"title\":\"Oden Appears! The Confused Hearts of the Akazaya Members!\",\"number\":1024,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The wounded Akazaya members are surprised to see Kozuki Oden alive. They were disappointed by their failure to take down Kaido, but now with their lord, they are filled with hope to face their sworn enemy again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おでん現る! 揺れる赤鞘の心!\"},{\"title\":\"The Worst Generation Gets Wiped Out?! The Emperors` Deadly Attack!\",\"number\":1025,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akazaya members run to save Momonosuke, but an unexpected contender stands in their way. Queen gets infuriated after Chopper ruined his plot and goes after him. Meanwhile, on the rooftop, Kaido and Big Mom unleashes a combination attack on Luffy and the others.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最悪の世代全滅!? 四皇の大技!\"},{\"title\":\"The Supernovas Strike Back! The Mission to Tear Apart the Emperors!\",\"number\":1026,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The returned Orochi clashes the Akazaya members who are trying to save Momonosuke. Meanwhile, Luffy and the others are all covered in bruises, but they unite their strength and launch an attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"超新星反撃! 四皇分解作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Defend Luffy! Zoro and Law`s Sword Technique!\",\"number\":1027,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Even after Big Mom was pushed off of the island, Zoro and the others keep fighting the exhausting battle against Kaido. When Kaido tries to beat up the unconscious Luffy, Zoro launches an all-out attack at the risk of his life.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィを守れ! ゾロとローの剣技\"},{\"title\":\"Surpass the Emperor of the Sea! Luffy Strikes Back with an Iron Fist!\",\"number\":1028,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy remembers how he was advised by his friends, how he was saved by his comrades, and the frustrations of being defeated. As Kaido mocks him to his face, the Color of the Supreme King Haki gushes out and they clash again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四皇を超えろ ルフィ反撃の鉄拳\"},{\"title\":\"A Faint Memory! Luffy and Red-Haired`s Daughter Uta!\",\"number\":1029,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A young Luffy who has been dreaming about getting out of Windmill Village one day to accomplish something great meets a young girl named Uta who came along with Shanks and the Red-Hair Pirates calling herself the musician of the pirate group. \\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動エピソード 淡い記憶 ルフィと赤髪の娘ウタ\"},{\"title\":\"A Pledge for the New Genesis! Luffy and Uta!\",\"number\":1030,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Uta run across Windmill Village, compete with each other, and share their dreams with each other. They also pledge to build a new genesis for everyone to live happily. However, one day, the unexpected happens. \\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画連動エピソード 新時代の誓い! ルフィとウタ\"},{\"title\":\"Nami Screams - A Deadly Death Race!\",\"number\":1031,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Kaido who have both infused themselves with the Color of the Supreme King clash! Meanwhile, Nami, Usopp, and Tama are running from Page One to get to the Performance Floor, but they bump into another tough enemy, Big Mom.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミ絶叫 絶体絶命デスレース!\"},{\"title\":\"The Dawn of the Land of Wano - The All-Out Battle Heats Up!\",\"number\":1032,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kin’emon and the Akazaya members are rushing to help Momonosuke and everyone else while Yamato leaves Momonosuke and Shinobu in a hide-out to lure away their enemies. At the same time, Ulti tries to avenge her brother against Big Mom.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワノ国の夜明け 全面対決激化!\"},{\"title\":\"The Conclusion! Luffy, Accelerating Fist of the Supreme King\",\"number\":1033,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji is forced to run with Zoro on his shoulder. Meanwhile, Nami bravely stands up against Ulti and Big Mom. On the rooftop, the intense battle between Luffy and Kaido finally comes to an end.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決着! ルフィ加速する覇王の拳[こぶし]\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy, Defeated! The Straw Hats in Jeopardy?!\",\"number\":1034,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy is pushed off the rooftop by Kaido. Meanwhile, Zeus intervenes in a fight between Big Mom and Nami’s group and stands up for the one who he wants to save. On the Performance Floor, Chopper is in a fierce battle against Queen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ敗北! 麦わらの一味窮地!?\"},{\"title\":\"The Animal Kingdom Pirates Trample Down! The End of the Kozuki Clan!\",\"number\":1035,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While the Straw Hats and their allies are all having a hard time, they are shocked by the news that Luffy lost to Kaido. At the same time, Kanjuro closes in on Momonosuke to destroy the Kozuki lineage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"百獣蹂躙! 光月家の終焉!\"},{\"title\":\"Fight Against the Dark Night - The Commander-in-Chief of the Land of Wano Sounds Off\",\"number\":1036,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Like all the other samurai, Chopper is discouraged by the news of Luffy’s loss and Queen doesn’t miss the chance to finish him off! Meanwhile, Kin’emon fights for his life to save Momonosuke and that motivates Momonosuke to rise up!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇夜に抗え ワノ国総大将吠える\"},{\"title\":\"Believe in Luffy! The Alliance`s Counterattack Begins!\",\"number\":1037,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momonosuke and Shinobu face Kaido while Kid and Law challenge Big Mom. Meanwhile, Nami, heading towards the stage on the Performance Floor along with Usopp and Tama, hears a strange voice.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィを信じろ! 同盟反撃開始!\"},{\"title\":\"Nami`s Lethal Attack! Otama`s Desperate Challenge!\",\"number\":1038,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami strikes a thunder blast to clear the way to the stage on the Performance Floor. However, the elite corps of the Gifters shows up to crush their inferior opponents. Upset but unbroken, Otama stands up to give a command!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナミ必殺! お玉決死の大一番!\"},{\"title\":\"A Dramatic Increase of Allies! Straw Hats Fight Back!\",\"number\":1039,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hearing Otama’s command, the Gifters side with the samurai and upset the Tobi Roppo and others! Chopper starts to take care of Zoro while suffering from the side effect of the enhanced Rumble Ball. Meanwhile, Jimbei gets stunned by Who’s-Who’s story.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"味方激増! 麦わらの一味逆襲!\"},{\"title\":\"The Pride of a Helmsman - The Enraged Jimbei!\",\"number\":1040,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Who’s-Who expresses fierce resentment toward Luffy and Jimbei fights back out of his loyalty to Luffy. As Who’s-Who asks Jimbei a question, he tramples on the dignity of the Fish-Men and that sparks Jimbei’s outrage.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"操舵手の誇り 怒りのジンベエ!\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown Battles of the Monsters! Yamato and Franky\",\"number\":1041,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To cut ties with Kaido, Yamato unleashes his true power. Meanwhile, Queen repeatedly attacks Sanji with his power as a cyborg, and Sasaki in his Man-Beast Form launches tricky attacks on Franky and drives him into a corner.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怪獣大決戦! ヤマトとフランキー\"},{\"title\":\"The Predator`s Trap - Black Maria`s Temptation\",\"number\":1042,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaido tries to convince Yamato to become the Shogun of the Land of Wano and rule the country with the special power he obtained by accident. Meanwhile, Saul, Professor Clover, and Robin’s mother Olvia suddenly appear in front of her.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"捕食者の罠 ブラックマリアの誘惑\"},{\"title\":\"Slash the Nightmare - Brook Draws His Freezing Sword!\",\"number\":1043,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the dense mist, Brook is surprised to see his old friends, the Rumbar Pirates and Laboon. They reminisce about the old days and play music together, however, they suddenly attack Brook.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢を斬る ブルックの氷の抜刀!\"},{\"title\":\"Clutch! A Demon Incarnate, Robin!\",\"number\":1044,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Black Maria torments Robin both physically and spiritually. As she burns in hellfire, Robin remembers the people who gave her a hard time and the people who supported her, and she as Demon Child shows what she is really capable of.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"クラッチ! 悪魔の化身ロビン!\"},{\"title\":\"A Spell! Kid and Zoro Facing Threats!\",\"number\":1045,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Killer is shocked to find out who Hawkins’ straw doll he slashed represents. Meanwhile, Sanji who is in a hard battle against Queen and King sees enemy brutes going after the injured Zoro, and no one else is there to save him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呪縛! 迫る脅威 キッドとゾロ!\"},{\"title\":\"Taking a Chance! The Two Arms Go into Battle!\",\"number\":1046,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro gets back on his feet and along with Sanji, confronts King and Queen, the Lead Performers of the Animal Kingdom Pirates. Watching Zoro fight, Hyogoro and Kawamatsu remember someone from way back.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一か八かの大勝負! 両翼出陣!\"},{\"title\":\"Ascend to the Dawn! A Pink Dragon Gets Agitated\",\"number\":1047,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dogstorm confronts his sworn enemy who destroyed his country. Meanwhile, Cat Viper faces Perospero who is responsible for Pedro’s death. At Tokage Port, Momonosuke roars with his determined eyes.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夜明けへと昇れ! 桃色の龍猛る\"},{\"title\":\"For the Future! Yamato and the Great Swordsmen`s Pledge\",\"number\":1048,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Kaido and Yamato gets intense. Backed into a corner, Yamato remembers three great swordsmen who he met when he was a child. Their stunning choice for the future of the Land of Wano encourages Yamato.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"未来へ! ヤマトと大剣豪の誓い\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Soars! Revenge Against the King of the Beasts\",\"number\":1049,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy amps up the reluctant Momonosuke, who is afraid of heights, in his giant pink dragon form, to fly and take him to Onigashima in the sky. Meanwhile, Yamato, in a hard battle against Kaido, vows to survive until Luffy returns.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ飛翔! 百獣へのリベンジ\"},{\"title\":\"Two Dragons Face Off! Momonosuke`s Determination!\",\"number\":1050,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momonosuke faces Kaido once again trembling in fear. However, with Luffy’s encouragement, he bravely steps up and shows his dragon fangs remembering what he had to go through because of Kaido.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"双龍相搏つ! モモの助の覚悟!\"},{\"title\":\"A Legend All Over Again! Luffy`s Fist Roars in the Sky\",\"number\":1051,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Asked to stop Onigashima by Luffy, Momonosuke once again gets cold feet, but this time, he has a reliable ally who can teach him how to fly. The clash between Luffy and Kaido shakes up the sky and enables Dogstorm and Cat Viper to exert all their strength.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説の再来! 天に轟くルフィの拳\"},{\"title\":\"The Situation Has Grown Tense! The End of Onigashima!\",\"number\":1052,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Realizing Onigashima’s impending threat, imperiling everyone’s life, Yamato and Momonosuke launch a secret operation. Meanwhile, Sanji and Zoro are both in a deadly battle against Queen and King.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"風雲急を告げる! 鬼ヶ島の末路!\"},{\"title\":\"Sanji`s Mutation - The Two Arms in Crisis!\",\"number\":1053,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Queen’s unforeseen move stuns everyone on the Performance Floor. And then, he goes on to utilize another special technique which can break every bone in Sanji’s body. On the verge of a crisis, Sanji feels something strange again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サンジの異変 両翼黄色信号!\"},{\"title\":\"Death to Your Partner! Killer`s Deadly Gamble\",\"number\":1054,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Killer tries to figure out how to fight against Hawkins whose power enables him to transfer damage against him to Kid. Kid is dying not knowing where his damage is coming from. Killer takes a chance with Kid’s life on the line.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"相棒に死を! キラー決死の大博打\"},{\"title\":\"A Shadowy Figure Pulls the Strings! Onigashima in Flames\",\"number\":1055,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji still wonders what is happening to his body as he receives attacks. Meanwhile, the dying Kin’emon hears an unexpected voice calling for the also dying Kanjuro. Through the Smail, the voice of Orochi tries to stir up Kanjuro to make him perform one last time.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇の者の暗躍! 鬼ヶ島炎上\"},{\"title\":\"A Countercharge! Law and Kid`s Return-Attack Combination\",\"number\":1056,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Law and Kid are having a tough battle against a formidable Emperor of the Sea, Big Mom. However, when they decide to work collaboratively and use their awakened Devil Fruit powers, they see the possibility of taking down the old generation.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逆襲! ローとキッドの反撃同盟\"},{\"title\":\"For Luffy - Sanji and Zoro`s Oath\",\"number\":1057,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sanji is tormented by the idea of becoming a cruel Germa warrior like his siblings and torn between being strong or being humane as he is now. When he makes up his mind, he asks Zoro the ultimate favor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィの為に サンジとゾロの誓い\"},{\"title\":\"The Onslaught of Kazenbo - Orochi`s Evil Clutches Close In\",\"number\":1058,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kazenbo, the giant specter of fire symbolizing the burning wrath of the Kurozumi Clan, rampages through the castle creating panic among both the Animal Kingdom Pirates and the samurai. Orochi who is watching in excitement suddenly hears a sound that brings back memories.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火前坊襲来 迫るオロチの魔の手\"},{\"title\":\"Zoro Faces Adversity - A Monster! King the Wildfire\",\"number\":1059,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro is facing a hard fight against King who seems invincible. Even one of Zoro’s deadliest attacks doesn’t leave a scratch on him. On top of that, one of Zoro’s swords goes out of control and gets in his way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逆境のゾロ 怪物! 火災のキング\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret of Enma! The Cursed Sword Entrusted to Zoro\",\"number\":1060,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro still can’t gain control of Enma which keeps extracting his Haki. Backed into a corner by the formidable King, Zoro remembers the encounter with an old man in his hometown when he was a child.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"閻魔の秘密! ゾロに託されし妖刀\"},{\"title\":\"The Strike of an Ifrit! Sanji vs. Queen\",\"number\":1061,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Queen’s formidable attacks remind Sanji of his family. Annoyed by Queen’s provocations, Sanji remembers a young woman mysteriously getting hurt in front of him and realizes what happened at that time, which lights a fire within him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔神の一撃! サンジVSクイーン\"},{\"title\":\"The Three-Sword Style of the Supreme King! Zoro vs. King\",\"number\":1062,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zoro tries to figure out a way to damage King. Meanwhile, King remembers when he first met his captain Kaido and declares that his captain is the one to become the King of the Pirates, which leads Zoro to set his swords alight with hellfire.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"覇王の三刀流! ゾロVSキング\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Is on the Move! A Turning Point to a New Era!\",\"number\":1063,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Usopp finds Kin’emon’s upper body and the heavily wounded Kiku. However, they are surrounded by the Gifters and can’t find a way out. Seeing the samurai giving up hope, Usopp remembers his determination.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ躍動! 新時代の分岐点!\"},{\"title\":\"Drunken Dragon Bagua! The Lawless Dragon Closing in on Luffy\",\"number\":1064,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Flower Capital, the Fire Festival is about to end. On Onigashima, the battle between Luffy and Kaido is getting even more intense. However, Kaido who is excited about having a strong opponent starts drinking too much.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"酒龍八卦! ルフィに迫る無法の龍\"},{\"title\":\"The Destruction of the Alliance?! Fire Up, the Will of the New Generation!\",\"number\":1065,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the ongoing battles in various parts of Onigashima, everyone is reaching their limits. In the face of Big Mom, Law and Kid are exhausted and deeply wounded. Mocking them, Big Mom tries to head for the rooftop.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"同盟壊滅!? 燃えろ新世代の意志!\"},{\"title\":\"Here Comes the Main Act! Powerful Techniques of Shockwave and Magnetism\",\"number\":1066,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Big Mom’s strong life force discourages Law and Kid. Law tells Kid that he only has enough energy for one last strike. However, a monster Big Mom summons puts the two in even more of a bind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大トリ来る! 波動と磁気の大技\"},{\"title\":\"To the New Era! Settled! The Determination of the Brats\",\"number\":1067,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kid’s all-out deadly attack and Law’s tactical action leave Big Mom in the lurch. Then she remembers what Roger said in the past and wonders if the treasure he mentioned is out there after all.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新時代へ! 決着! ガキ共の覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"Moon Princess Echoes! The Final Phase of the Land of Wano!\",\"number\":1068,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaido mourns Big Mom’s defeat and remembers the day he met her for the first time. Meanwhile, backed into a corner, Orochi sees the true nature of Komurasaki, the woman he loves, and trembles with fear.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月姫が響く! ワノ国最終局面!\"},{\"title\":\"There Is Only One Winner - Luffy vs. Kaido\",\"number\":1069,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On orders from the Five Elders, the CP-0 agent Guernica tries to get to Luffy, but Drake stands in his way. Meanwhile, Luffy who only has very little energy left uses his last Gear Four to emancipate the people of the Land of Wano from Kaido.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝者はひとり ルフィVSカイドウ\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy Is Defeated?! The Determination of Those Left Behind\",\"number\":1070,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Luffy and Kaido comes to an unexpected end. Kaido comes down and tells everyone that Luffy has been defeated and the Land of Wano is finished. Momonosuke and Yamato argue over whether they should still continue fighting.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィ敗北!? 残された者の覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Peak - Attained! Gear Five\",\"number\":1071,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Luffy’s heart pounds in a funny way, the Five Elders reveal the secret behind the Gum-Gum Fruit. Meanwhile, Orochi tries to convince Komurasaki to escape with him, but when he sees Kanjuro, he makes a malicious decision.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィの最高地点 到達! \\\"ギア5\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"The Ridiculous Power! Gear Five in Full Play\",\"number\":1072,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bouncing on the ground and becoming a giant, Luffy enjoys his new, bizarre power while Kaido is bewildered and can’t make sense of it. Meanwhile, Kid, Law, and Luffy’s other allies continue the fight down below against flames and enemies alike, waiting for Luffy to emerge victorious.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ふざけた能力! 躍動するギア5\"},{\"title\":\"No Way Out! A Hellish Scene on Onigashima\",\"number\":1073,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now the whole Onigashima is ablaze. Chopper reunites with Nami while Sanji and the others are each trying to escape from the flames. However, Raizo who harbors a great regret from his past stands up to the fire with the help of Jimbei.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逃げ場なし! 地獄絵図の鬼ヶ島\"},{\"title\":\"I Trust Momo - Luffy`s Final Powerful Technique!\",\"number\":1074,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momonosuke struggles to create Flame Clouds to sustain Onigashima which is in free fall. In the Flower Capital, the Fire Festival is ending with people flying their Sky Boats in the air. To fulfill the promise to free the Land of Wano, Luffy inflates his fist to strike Kaido.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"モモを信じる ルフィ最後の大技!\"},{\"title\":\"20 Years` Worth of Prayers! Take Back the Land of Wano\",\"number\":1075,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Oden died 20 years ago, Orochi took over the Land of Wano. People were separated from their loved ones, forced into labor, and starved. Now they pray that Kaido will vanish as Luffy’s battle against him reaches a climax.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二十年の祈り! ワノ国を取り戻せ\"},{\"title\":\"The World That Luffy Wants!\",\"number\":1076,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaido remembers how he was treated unfairly in the past and how he believes the world should be. While his friends struggle to survive on Onigashima, Luffy is asked by Kaido to picture his ideal world as he throws a destructive punch.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルフィの目指す世界!\"},{\"title\":\"The Curtain Falls! The Winner, Straw Hat Luffy!\",\"number\":1077,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The samurai and the Straw Hats shout for joy as they hear that Luffy defeated Kaido. Meanwhile, Momonosuke informs Zunesha of a major decision that he made. However, when Yamato calls on the Animal Kingdom Pirates to stop fighting, the earth trembles.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"幕引き! 勝者 麦わらのルフィ!\"},{\"title\":\"He Returns! The Shogun of the Land of Wano, Kozuki Momonosuke\",\"number\":1078,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The people of the Flower Capital get flustered when Kin’emon and the other Akazaya samurai who were supposed to be dead appear from the smoke. However, the last one who walks out of the smoke, and what he says, confuses the people even more.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"帰還! ワノ国将軍光月モモの助\"},{\"title\":\"The Morning Comes! Luffy and the Others Rest!\",\"number\":1079,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Land of Wano is in a celebratory mood now that the years of tyranny are over. However, Yamato is holding back his hunger alone until Hiyori arrives with the news he was waiting for. Meanwhile, some unknown figure approaches the Land of Wano.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"朝が来た! ルフィ達の休息!\"},{\"title\":\"A Celebration Banquet! The New Emperors of the Sea!\",\"number\":1080,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The news of the defeat of the Emperors of the Sea spreads across the world. Luffy enjoys the banquet but just as he is about to make a toast, an enraged Kid comes in to strike him. The reason behind his action surprises Luffy\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"祝祭の宴! 新しき海の皇帝達!\"},{\"title\":\"The World Will Burn! The Onslaught of a Navy Admiral!\",\"number\":1081,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Navy Admiral Ryokugyu comes to strike the Flower Capital, the Akazaya samurai notice and try to stop him, but his Woods-Woods Fruit power overwhelms them. Meanwhile, another formidable, yet friendly, guest approaches the Land of Wano\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界が燃える! 海軍大将襲来!\"},{\"title\":\"The Coming of the New Era! The Red-Haired`s Imperial Rage\",\"number\":1082,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Navy Admiral Ryokugyu keeps up a savage assault against the Akazaya samurai who are still recovering from the last battle. Momonosuke tries to defend the Land of Wano with all his might, but he gets driven into a corner.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新時代到来! 赤髪の皇帝の怒り\"},{\"title\":\"The World That Moves On! A New Organization, Cross Guild\",\"number\":1083,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momonosuke and Hiyori are happy to see their grandfather who was supposed to be dead and the Straw Hats are surprised when Robin tells them about Pluton the Ancient Weapon. Meanwhile, Momonosuke is kept busy in his role as the new Shogun.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動く世界! 新組織クロスギルド\"},{\"title\":\"Time to Depart - The Land of Wano and the Straw Hats\",\"number\":1084,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An untold story from before the Straw Hats’ departure. Luffy visits the ruins of Oden Castle where Oden’s grave once was and Zoro visits Yasuie’s grave where he meets Hiyori. Later, Luffy and Tama eat red-bean soup together for the last time and share their feelings with each other.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"旅立ちの時 ワノ国と麦わらの一味\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Curtain! Luffy and Momonosuke`s Vow\",\"number\":1085,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Angered by Luffy`s attempt to leave without saying goodbye, Momonosuke rushes with Kin’emon and Yamato to the port from where the Straw Hats are about to leave, thinking back on his days with Luffy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"終幕! ルフィとモモの助の誓い\"},{\"title\":\"A New Emperor! Buggy the Genius Jester!\",\"number\":1086,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and the other Straw Hats’ new bounties are revealed. Meanwhile, at Emptee Bluffs Island,　Crocodile and the greatest swordsman in the world Mihawk, visit Buggy to discuss their newly-established organization, Cross Guild.\\nSource: Crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新皇帝! 千両道化のバギー!\"},{\"title\":\"The War on the Island of Women! A Case Involving Koby the Hero\",\"number\":1087,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Navy Captain Koby comes to the Island of Women to arrest Pirate Empress Hancock with the new Pacifistas. While the Navy and Kuja fighters clash, Blackbeard comes to raid, also targeting　Hancock.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"女ヶ島の乱! 英雄コビーの一件\"},{\"title\":\"Luffy`s Dream\",\"number\":1088,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The three-way struggle between the Navy, the Blackbeard Pirates, and the Kuja Pirates comes to an end when an unexpected figure shows up. On the Sunny, the Straw Hats talk about the recent incidents around the world and Luffy’s words surprise everyone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"\\\"ルフィの夢\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"Entering a New Chapter! Luffy and Sabo`s Paths!\",\"number\":1089,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sabo, the Chief of Staff of the Revolutionary Army, contacts Koala and everyone in Kamabakka Queendom. He explains to them about the things that he is accused of, but someone who was eavesdropping on the call takes a stunning action.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新章突入! ルフィとサボの針路!\"},{\"title\":\"A New Island! Future Island Egghead\",\"number\":1090,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Chopper fall into the rough cold sea along with the mysterious girl. Jimbei tries to help them but another attack comes from the unknown creature. Meanwhile, the Sunny is hit by torpedoes and the rest of the Straw Hats are thrown into the sea, too.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新しい島! 未来島エッグヘッド\"},{\"title\":\"Brimming with the Future! An Adventure on the Island of Science!\",\"number\":1091,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy and Chopper fall into the rough cold sea along with the mysterious girl. Jimbei tries to help them but another attack comes from the unknown creature. Meanwhile, the Sunny is hit by torpedoes and the rest of the Straw Hats are thrown into the sea, too.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"未来満載! 科学の国の冒険!\"},{\"title\":\"Bonney`s Lamentation! Darkness Lurking on the Future Island\",\"number\":1092,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Luffy and the others are enjoying the futuristic machines of Egghead, someone who resembles Bartholomew Kuma comes after them. When Luffy tries to fight back, Bonney stops him and reveals her shocking relationship with Kuma.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ボニーの慟哭! 未来島に潜む闇\"},{\"title\":\"The Winner Takes All! Law vs. Blackbeard!\",\"number\":1093,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Blackbeard Pirates ambushed the Heart Pirates led by Law. The Blackbeard Pirates’ top officers use a variety of formidable Devil Fruit powers and keep pushing the Heart Pirates in order to obtain the copies of the Road Ponegliffs.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝者総取り! ローVS 黒ひげ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Mystery Deepens! Egghead Labophase\",\"number\":1094,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats without Luffy, Chopper, and Jimbei are taken to the laboratory on the clouds far above the ground by Lilith. They get excited about the things they`ve never seen before. However, inside the laboratory, a new threat is waiting for them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"深まる謎! エッグヘッド研究層[ラボフェーズ]\"},{\"title\":\"The Brain of a Genius - Six Vegapunks!\",\"number\":1095,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nami and the others are attacked by a Pacifista who resembles Jimbei and while they’re in battle, some of Vegapunk’s Satellites look on with excitement. Meanwhile, Luffy and the others find something extraordinary at the scrap heap.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天才の頭脳 6人のベガパンク!\"},{\"title\":\"A Forbidden Piece of History! A Theory Concerning a Kingdom\",\"number\":1096,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vegapunk Shaka shares with Robin and the others his theory about an ancient kingdom and the 100-Year Void. He even says that he visited Ohara after its destruction. Meanwhile, Luffy and Chopper try to activate the giant robot and something surprising happens.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁じられた歴史! ある王国の仮説\"},{\"title\":\"The Will of Ohara! The Inherited Research\",\"number\":1097,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shaka reveals the secret behind the foundation of the Revolutionary Army and how the relationship between Vegapunk and Dragon affected it. Meanwhile, Vegapunk explains to Luffy and the others about his special power and how his clones work.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オハラの意志! 受け継がれる研究\"},{\"title\":\"The Eccentric Dream of a Genius!\",\"number\":1098,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vegapunk reveals the shocking history of the ancient giant robot and asks Luffy to take him off Egghead. Rob Lucci and his fellow Cipher Pol agents arrive at the island and ask for permission to enter the port.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇想天外! 天才が想い描く夢!\"},{\"title\":\"Preparations for Interception! Rob Lucci Strikes!\",\"number\":1099,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"CP-0 led by Rob Lucci makes a forced landing at Egghead and people on the Fabriophase are plunged into confusion while Shaka and the others prepare to fight back on the Labophase. The enraged Atlas stands up to defend the peace of the island.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迎撃準備! ロブ・ルッチ襲来!\"},{\"title\":\"Powers on a Different Level! Luffy vs. Lucci!\",\"number\":1100,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Luffy transforms into the Warrior of Liberation as Rob Lucci also shows his awakened Devil Fruit form. As the two clash, Vegapunk reveals the shocking truth of the Gum-Gum Fruit and his eye-opening theory on Devil Fruits.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"異次元の力! ルフィVSルッチ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Form of Humanity! The Seraphim`s Powers!\",\"number\":1101,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vegapunk describes how he managed to grant the Seraphim Devil Fruit powers, which surprises Franky and the others. Meanwhile, Luffy is still facing Lucci in his savage, awakened form, but the rocket to the Labophase is about to leave.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の人類! セラフィムの能力!\"},{\"title\":\"Sinister Schemes! The Operation to Escape Egghead\",\"number\":1102,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vegapunk asks the Straw Hats to take him on board their ship which makes Franky and Usopp happy but annoys Nami. Lucci orders his troops to block off all Vegapunk’s escape routes and looks to invade the heavily-secured Labophase.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"蠢く陰謀! エッグヘッド脱出作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Turn Back My Father! Bonney`s Futile Wish!\",\"number\":1103,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"CP-0 enters the Labophase and starts attacking the Thousand Sunny as soon as they find it. Luffy reunites with Nami and the others but finds out that Vegapunk is missing. Meanwhile, Bonney is pressing Vegapunk to change back her father Kuma.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父を戻せ! 儚きボニーの願い!\"},{\"title\":\"A Desperate Situation! The Seraphim`s All-out Attack!\",\"number\":1104,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Seraphim come following CP-0 to the Labophase, pitting Zoro and Brook against the seven of them. Sanji, Franky, Edison, and Lilith leave the lab to fight them, but the Seraphim launch a full-scale attack on the lab.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命! セラフィム総攻撃!\"},{\"title\":\"A Beautiful Act of Treason! The Spy, Stussy!\",\"number\":1105,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stussy suddenly knocked out Lucci to the Straw Hats’ surprise, and when Shaka reveals her true identity, they’re stunned again. Meanwhile, a major incident occurs on an island called Sphinx where Whitebeard came from.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"麗しき反逆! 内通者ステューシー\"},{\"title\":\"Trouble Occurs! Seek Dr. Vegapunk!\",\"number\":1106,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"CP-0 takes control of the Fabriophase but gets attacked by an unknown force. Meanwhile, in the Labophase, the Straw Hats and Dr. Vegapunk’s Satellites find out that Vegapunk has disappeared and begin searching for him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"異常発生! 探せ! Dr.ベガパンク\"},{\"title\":\"A Shudder! The Evil Hand Creeping Up on the Laboratory\",\"number\":1107,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bonney witnesses her father Bartholomew Kuma’s painful memories. Meanwhile at the lab, Shaka notices that their communications and surveillance cameras are being cut off by somebody.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦慄! 研究所へ忍び寄る魔の手\"},{\"title\":\"Incomprehensible! The Seraphim`s Rebellion!\",\"number\":1108,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Seraphim suddenly start attacking the Straw Hats and the Vegapunk Satellites. They are not stopping even when the Satellites order them to. When Luffy and Zoro are cornered, Lucci and Kaku wake up and make them a surprising offer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"理解不能! セラフィムの反逆!\"},{\"title\":\"A Tough Decision! An Unusual United Front!\",\"number\":1109,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucci and Kaku from CP0, who came to Egghead with a mission to eliminate the seven Vegapunks, ask Luffy and Zoro to uncuff them so they can fight alongside them against the Seraphim, but Luffy and Zoro are reluctant to do so.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"苦渋の決断! 異色の共闘戦線!\"},{\"title\":\"Survive! Deadly Combat with the Strongest Form of Humanity!\",\"number\":1110,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Straw Hats and CP0 relentlessly attack the Seraphim, but the Seraphim keep getting back up. Then, Zoro notices that the Seraphim remind him of someone who he fought before. Meanwhile, Shaka goes to check one place where he thinks Vegapunk Stella might be.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生き残れ! 最強の人類との死闘\"},{\"title\":\"The Second Ohara! The Mastermind`s Ambition!\",\"number\":1111,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stussy and Sentomaru discuss how big the threat that closes in on Egghead is as Luffy and the others keep fighting the uncontrollable Seraphim. Meanwhile, in an underground lab, someone approaches Vegapunk, who is being held captive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オハラの再来! 黒幕の野望!\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Shanks vs. Eustass Kid\",\"number\":1112,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kid gives his crew a pep talk before the battle with Shanks. Shanks also prepares for the battle, but learns how his own subordinates do as they like to protect their beloved boss. Finally, Kid has his Damned Punk ready to shoot.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! シャンクスVSユースタス・キッド\"},{\"title\":\"Run, Koby! A Desperate Escape Strategy!\",\"number\":1113,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Held at the Pirate Island of Beehive, Koby gets a chance to be free but decides to become a decoy to liberate slaves on the island. Pirates from all over the island come after him because of the big bounty on his head.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"走れコビー! 決死の脱出作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"For the Beloved Pupil - The Fist of Vice Admiral Garp!\",\"number\":1114,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A massive warship comes flying towards the Pirate Island of Beehive and Vice Admiral Garp launches a crushing attack on top of it to save his pupil Koby. Koby almost reaches the ship with Navy HQ Commander Hibari running by his side.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"愛弟子のため ガープ中将の拳骨!\"},{\"title\":\"The Navy Surprised! The Navy Headquarters` Former Admiral, Kuzan\",\"number\":1115,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kuzan, a former Navy Admiral, stands in the way of Garp who came to rescue Koby. He was once Garp’s pupil but is now a member of the Blackbeard Pirates. What happened to him after he was defeated by Sakazuki is now revealed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海軍驚愕! 元海軍本部大将クザン\"},{\"title\":\"Let`s Go Get It! Buggy`s Big Declaration\",\"number\":1116,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sengoku, the former Admiral of the Fleet, and Great Adviser Tsuru discuss the murder of Vice Admiral T-Bone and concerns about Cross Guild. Meanwhile, Buggy gives a passionate speech to Crocodile, Mihawk, and his crew.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"取りに行こうぜ! バギーの大宣言\"},{\"title\":\"Sabo Returns - The Shocking Truth to Be Told!\",\"number\":1117,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sabo returns to Kamabakka Queendom and starts recounting what happened at the Holy Land Mary Geoise. A month ago, during the Reverie, he and the captains of the Revolutionary Army raided the Land of Gods and Sabo witnessed Bartholomew Kuma being the Celestial Dragons’ slave.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サボの帰還 語られる衝撃の真実!\"},{\"title\":\"The Holy Land in Tumult! Sai and Leo`s Full-Power Blow!\",\"number\":1118,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Holy Land Mary Geoise during the Reverie, Sabo runs into Bartholomew Kuma’s daughter Bonney. Meanwhile, King Cobra of the Kingdom of Alabasta begins asking the Five Elders questions that trouble them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖地騒然! サイとレオ渾身の一撃!\"},{\"title\":\"The Entrusted Message! King Cobra`s Resolve\",\"number\":1119,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"King Cobra is surprised by seeing someone sitting on the Empty Throne and by learning about the truth of the world. When he is subject to a deadly attack, Sabo cuts in to save him. The injured king entrusts Sabo with a message.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"託された伝言[メッセージ]! コブラ王の覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"The World Is Shaken! The Ruler`s Judgment and the Five Elders` Actions!\",\"number\":1120,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Vivi tries to escape the Holy Land Mary Geoise with Wapol while the injured Sabo also looks for a way to leave to deliver King Cobra’s message to Luffy and Vivi. Meanwhile, Imu orders the Five Elders to test a horrendous weapon.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"揺らぐ世界! 支配者の審判と五老星の始動!\"},{\"title\":\"Garp and Kuzan - A Master and a Pupil`s Beliefs Clash\",\"number\":1121,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Pirate Island of Beehive, Vice Admiral Garp, who came to rescue the kidnapped Koby, deals with an overwhelming number of pirates alone. As he and his fellow Navy soldiers try to escape the island, Kuzan, the former Navy admiral, stands in their way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ガープとクザン 衝突する師弟の正義\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Lesson! Impact Inherited\",\"number\":1122,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Avalo Pizarro, who merged with the Pirate Island, reaches his giant hand to crush the Navy ship with many soldiers and civilians on board. The wounded Garp gives orders to Koby, Helmeppo, and Prince Grus, and delivers a powerful blow to save the ship.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の教え! 受け継がれた拳骨[インパクト]\"},{\"title\":\"The World Shakes! The Straw Hats` Hostage Situation\",\"number\":1123,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"sy